Robusto\", \"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"Eye of the Shark\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Hemingway\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Launched in the 1980s, Perfectos and Classicos formats. Named in tribute to the author who lived in Cuba. The Hemingway range is the Arturo Fuente entry point — sweet, creamy, not aggressive. The Masterpiece (9 inches) is the longest in the range.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"African Cameroon\", \"vitolas\": [\"Classic\", \"Short Story\", \"Best Seller\", \"Masterpiece\", \"Signature\"]}, {\"name\": \"Añejo\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper aged in cognac barrels — a world first at its 1999 launch. نكهات:  cognac, Belgian شوكولاتة, cashew nuts. The Añejo No.77 Shark is regularly ranked among Cigar Aficionado\'s top 25 cigars of the year.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.46\", \"No.48\", \"No.50\", \"No.55\", \"No.60\", \"No.77 Shark\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Carlos Fuente Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"After the 1980 fire destroyed the factory, Carlos Jr. rebuilt the family empire from scratch in the Dominican Republic. He reportedly said: \'My father lost a factory. I found a country.\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Michael Jordan\", \"anecdote\": \"Jordan, a passionate cigar smoker, is a regular Opus X buyer. His personal orders during NBA playoffs have become legendary in the cigar world.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Carlos Fuente Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"After the 1980 fire destroyed the factory, Carlos Jr. rebuilt the family empire from scratch in the Dominican Republic. Supuestamente dijo: \'My father lost a factory. I found a country.\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Michael Jordan\", \"anecdote\": \"Jordan, a passionate cigar smoker, is a regular Opus X buyer. His personal orders during NBA playoffs have become legendary in the cigar world.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Carlos Fuente Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"After the 1980 fire destroyed the factory, Carlos Jr. rebuilt the family empire from scratch in the Dominican Republic. Er soll gesagt haben: \'My father lost a factory. I found a country.\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Michael Jordan\", \"anecdote\": \"Jordan, a passionate cigar smoker, is a regular Opus X buyer. His personal orders during NBA playoffs have become legendary in the cigar world.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Carlos Fuente Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"After the 1980 fire destroyed the factory, Carlos Jr. rebuilt the family empire from scratch in the Dominican Republic. 据报道他曾说： \'My father lost a factory. I found a country.\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Michael Jordan\", \"anecdote\": \"Jordan, a passionate cigar smoker, is a regular Opus X buyer. His personal orders during NBA playoffs have become legendary in the cigar world.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Carlos Fuente Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"After the 1980 fire destroyed the factory, Carlos Jr. rebuilt the family empire from scratch in the Dominican Republic. يُروى أنه قال: \'My father lost a factory. I found a country.\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Michael Jordan\", \"anecdote\": \"Jordan, a passionate cigar smoker, is a regular Opus X buyer. His personal orders during NBA playoffs have become legendary in the cigar world.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Rémy Martin XO Cognac\", \"notes\": \"The original pairing — the Añejo range is aged in cognac barrels. Smoking an Añejo with Rémy XO is a delicious recursion.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Napa Valley Cabernet 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The power of California Cabernet matches the Opus X without dominating it. An equal-strength pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Panama Gesha\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s rarest and most floral coffee with the Opus X. An absolute luxury pairing — two waiting-list products united.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Licores\", \"name\": \"Rémy Martin XO Cognac\", \"notes\": \"The original pairing — the Añejo range is aged in cognac barrels. Smoking an Añejo with Rémy XO is a delicious recursion.\"}, {\"type\": \"Vino\", \"name\": \"Napa Valley Cabernet 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The power of California Cabernet matches the Opus X without dominating it. An equal-strength pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Panama Gesha\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s rarest and most floral coffee with the Opus X. An absolute luxury pairing — two waiting-list products united.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirituosen\", \"name\": \"Rémy Martin XO Cognac\", \"notes\": \"The original pairing — the Añejo range is aged in cognac barrels. Smoking an Añejo with Rémy XO is a delicious recursion.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wein\", \"name\": \"Napa Valley Cabernet 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The power of California Cabernet matches the Opus X without dominating it. An equal-strength pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Panama Gesha\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s rarest and most floral coffee with the Opus X. An absolute luxury pairing — two waiting-list products united.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"烈酒\", \"name\": \"Rémy Martin XO Cognac\", \"notes\": \"The original pairing — the Añejo range is aged in cognac barrels. Smoking an Añejo with Rémy XO is a delicious recursion.\"}, {\"type\": \"葡萄酒\", \"name\": \"Napa Valley Cabernet 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The power of California Cabernet matches the Opus X without dominating it. An equal-strength pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Panama Gesha\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s rarest and most floral coffee with the Opus X. An absolute luxury pairing — two waiting-list products united.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"المسكرات\", \"name\": \"Rémy Martin XO Cognac\", \"notes\": \"The original pairing — the Añejo range is aged in cognac barrels. Smoking an Añejo with Rémy XO is a delicious recursion.\"}, {\"type\": \"النبيذ\", \"name\": \"Napa Valley Cabernet 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The power of California Cabernet matches the Opus X without dominating it. An equal-strength pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Panama Gesha\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s rarest and most floral coffee with the Opus X. An absolute luxury pairing — two waiting-list products united.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Arturo Fuente';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Ernest Hemingway and Cuban tobacco occupied the same world for most of the writer\'s adult life. He lived in Cuba from 1939 to 1960 — the longest continuous period he spent anywhere — and his finca outside Havana became the center of his literary production, his fishing expeditions, and his cigar habit. The man who wrote The Old Man and the Sea did so in a country where tobacco was both industry and ritual, where the best cigars on earth were grown an hour\'s drive from his desk.\r\n\r\nArturo Fuente\'s tribute to this relationship is built around a format that Hemingway never actually smoked but that embodies the craftsmanship he would have appreciated: the Perfecto. A cigar tapered at both ends — head and foot — the Perfecto is the most technically demanding format in cigar production. Rolling a conventional parejo is difficult enough; rolling a Perfecto requires the torcedor to maintain perfect symmetry across two tapering ends while achieving consistent density throughout. The draw must remain effortless despite the varying ring gauge. The burn must be even despite the structural complexity. Most factories do not attempt it at scale. The Arturo Fuente factory in the Dominican Republic does it routinely.\r\n\r\nThe wrapper is Cameroon — a natural choice given the range\'s complexity ambitions. Cameroonian leaf over a Dominican blend creates a profile of unusual refinement: cashew and cream on the first third, developing through light coffee and cedar toward a finish of mild pepper and honey. The medium-body strength makes the range accessible without sacrificing the complexity that justifies the Hemingway name.\r\n\r\nThe range includes several formats beyond the signature Perfecto — the Short Story, the Work of Art, the Classic — each a different expression of the same aesthetic principle: construction as an end in itself, difficulty deployed in service of pleasure. Carlos Fuente Sr. reportedly conceived the range as a personal project, a demonstration that the Dominican Republic could produce cigars of artistic ambition equal to anything from Havana.', `history_es` = 'La gama Hemingway de Arturo Fuente rinde homenaje a Ernest Hemingway — gran aficionado a Cuba. El formato Perfecto — con dos extremos apuntados — es difícil de lanzar y difícil de fumar perfectamente. Envolvente de Camerún sobre base dominicana.', `history_de` = 'Die Hemingway-Linie von Arturo Fuente huldigt Ernest Hemingway — dem großen Kuba-Fan. Das Perfecto-Format — mit zwei spitzen Enden — ist schwer zu rollen und schwer perfekt zu rauchen. Kamerunischer Wrapper über dominikanischer Basis.', `history_zh` = '阿图罗·富恩特的海明威系列向古巴狂热爱好者欧内斯特·海明威致敬。Perfecto规格——两端均有锥形——难以卷制，也难以完美吸食。喀麦隆茄衣覆盖多米尼加烟叶。', `history_ar` = 'تشكيلة هيمنغواي من أرتورو فوينتي تُكرِّم إرنست هيمنغواي — العاشق الكبير لكوبا. مقاس البيرفيكتو — بطرفَيه المدبَّبَيْن — صعب اللف وصعب التدخين الكامل. غلاف كاميروني فوق قاعدة دومينيكانية.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Hemingway\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Perfecto format — tapered at both ends. Cameroonian wrapper over aged Dominican filler. Notes of cashew, café crème, sandalwood. Each size is named after a Hemingway work: Short Story, Best Seller, Masterpiece (9 inches — the longest of the range, 90 minutes).\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"Short Story\",\"Best Seller\",\"Signature\",\"Masterpiece\",\"Classic\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Hemingway\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Formato Perfecto, afilado por ambos extremos. Capa camerunesa sobre tripa dominicana envejecida. Notas de anacardo, café con crema y sándalo. Cada vitola lleva el nombre de una obra hemingwayana: Short Story, Best Seller, Masterpiece (9 pulgadas, la más larga de la gama, 90 minutos).\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"Short Story\",\"Best Seller\",\"Signature\",\"Masterpiece\",\"Classic\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Hemingway\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Perfecto-Format — an beiden Enden zugespitzt. Kamerun-Deckblatt über gereifter dominikanischer Einlage. Noten von Cashew, Milchkaffee und Sandelholz. Jedes Format trägt den Namen eines Hemingway-Werks: Short Story, Best Seller, Masterpiece (9 Zoll — das längste der Linie, 90 Minuten).\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"Short Story\",\"Best Seller\",\"Signature\",\"Masterpiece\",\"Classic\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Hemingway\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Perfecto 规格——两端皆呈锥形。喀麦隆茄衣，配陈化的多米尼加填充。腰果、奶咖与檀木的气息。每一种规格都以海明威的作品命名：Short Story、Best Seller、Masterpiece（9 英寸，系列中最长的一支，90 分钟）。\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"Short Story\",\"Best Seller\",\"Signature\",\"Masterpiece\",\"Classic\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Hemingway\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"طراز Perfecto — مدبَّب الطرفين. غلاف كاميروني على حشوة دومينيكية معتَّقة. لمسات من الكاجو وقهوة بالقشدة وخشب الصندل. ويحمل كل طراز اسم عمل من أعمال همنغواي: Short Story وBest Seller وMasterpiece (تسع بوصات — أطول ما في التشكيلة، تسعون دقيقة).\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"Short Story\",\"Best Seller\",\"Signature\",\"Masterpiece\",\"Classic\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'Arturo Fuente Hemingway';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Maduro wrapper is tobacco\'s most radical transformation. A wrapper leaf already selected for thinness, even color, and structural integrity is then subjected to extended fermentation — sometimes months, sometimes years — that converts its natural sugars through controlled heat and humidity into a range of complex compounds. The leaf darkens from brown to near-black. It develops an oily surface texture. And it acquires a natural sweetness — not added, not artificial, but the biochemical product of prolonged cellular transformation — that fundamentally changes the character of any cigar it wraps.\r\n\r\nArturo Fuente\'s approach to Maduro was deliberate and geographically specific. Rather than using Connecticut broadleaf — the standard American Maduro source — the family chose Brazilian tobacco from Bahia and Arapiraca, regions where the combination of deep red soils, equatorial humidity, and centuries of cultivation expertise produces naturally dark, slightly thick leaves that ferment with unusual reliability. Brazilian Maduro wrapper is known for a specific chocolate character — somewhere between cocoa powder and dark ganache — that Connecticut broadleaf rarely achieves.\r\n\r\nApplied over the Dominican blend that the Fuente family has refined across four generations of production, this Brazilian wrapper creates a profile of striking contrast. The Fuente blend is known for its refined elegance — cedar, coffee cream, mild spice — and the Maduro wrapper adds to this foundation a layer of dark sweetness that deepens rather than overwhelms. The combination produces notes of chocolate-covered espresso, dried fig, and a long finish of dark cocoa that extends well past the final draw.\r\n\r\nThe range exists in productive tension with the Opus X at the top of the Fuente catalog. Where the Opus X is the house at maximum intensity — full Dominican power, Dominican grown wrapper, demanding and extraordinary — the Maduro offers a parallel argument: that Brazilian tobacco over the same Dominican filler base can produce a completely different kind of complexity, one built around sweetness and depth rather than power and spice.', `history_es` = 'La gama Maduro de Arturo Fuente utiliza el envolvente brasileño Maduro — hojas de Bahia y Arapiraca, naturalmente oscuras y ligeramente dulces. Sobre la base dominicana Fuente, este envolvente brasileño crea un perfil chocolateado y suave que contrasta magníficamente con la potencia del Opus X.', `history_de` = 'Die Maduro-Linie von Arturo Fuente verwendet den brasilianischen Maduro-Wrapper — Bahia- und Arapiraca-Blätter, von Natur aus dunkel und leicht süß. Über der dominikanischen Fuente-Basis schafft dieser brasilianische Wrapper ein schokoladiges, sanftes Profil, das wunderbar mit der Kraft des Opus X kontrastiert.', `history_zh` = '阿图罗·富恩特的马杜罗系列使用巴西马杜罗茄衣——巴伊亚和阿拉皮拉卡叶片，天然深色微甜。覆盖多米尼加富恩特底叶，这款巴西茄衣创造出一种巧克力风格、甜美的轮廓，与Opus X的强劲力度形成精彩对比。', `history_ar` = 'تشكيلة مادورو من أرتورو فوينتي تستخدم الغلافة البرازيلية مادورو — أوراق باهيا وأراباريكا، الداكنة طبيعيًا والحلوة قليلًا. فوق قاعدة فوينتي الدومينيكانية، تُنتج هذه الغلافة ملفًا شوكولاتيًا ناعمًا يتناقض بشكل رائع مع قوة أوبوس إكس.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Fuente Maduro\",\"color\":\"#3D1C00\",\"story\":\"Brazilian Maduro wrapper (Bahia/Arapiraca) over aged Dominican Fuente filler. Notes of chocolate, molasses, a light cane sweetness. Medium-full. Arturo Fuente\'s Brazilian face — mild on the surface, complex underneath. Robusto format recommended for optimal balance.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Brazilian Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\",\"Panetela\",\"Corona Imperial\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Fuente Maduro\",\"color\":\"#3D1C00\",\"story\":\"Capa Brazilian Maduro (Bahía/Arapiraca) sobre tripa Dominican Fuente envejecida. Notas de chocolate, melaza y un ligero dulzor de caña. Medio-pleno. La cara brasileña de Arturo Fuente: suave en apariencia, compleja en el fondo. Se recomienda el formato Robusto para el equilibrio óptimo.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Brazilian Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\",\"Panetela\",\"Corona Imperial\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Fuente Maduro\",\"color\":\"#3D1C00\",\"story\":\"Brasilianisches Maduro-Deckblatt (Bahia/Arapiraca) über gereifter dominikanischer Fuente-Einlage. Noten von Schokolade, Melasse und einer leichten Zuckerrohrsüße. Medium bis kräftig. Das brasilianische Gesicht von Arturo Fuente — mild im Auftritt, tief im Aufbau. Für die beste Ausgewogenheit empfiehlt sich das Robusto-Format.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Brazilian Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\",\"Panetela\",\"Corona Imperial\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Fuente Maduro\",\"color\":\"#3D1C00\",\"story\":\"巴西 Maduro 茄衣（Bahia／Arapiraca），配陈化的多米尼加 Fuente 填充。巧克力、糖蜜与一丝甘蔗甜。中至浓。这是 Arturo Fuente 的巴西面孔——表面柔和，内里复杂。追求最佳平衡，推荐 Robusto 规格。\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Brazilian Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\",\"Panetela\",\"Corona Imperial\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Fuente Maduro\",\"color\":\"#3D1C00\",\"story\":\"غلاف Maduro برازيلي (Bahia/Arapiraca) على حشوة Dominican Fuente معتَّقة. لمسات من الشوكولاتة والدبس وحلاوة قصب خفيفة. متوسط إلى كامل. إنه الوجه البرازيلي لـ Arturo Fuente — ناعم في ظاهره، مركّب في عمقه. ويُنصح بطراز Robusto لأمثل توازن.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Brazilian Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\",\"Panetela\",\"Corona Imperial\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'Arturo Fuente Maduro';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Ashton story begins in Philadelphia, in 1985, in a specialty tobacco shop where William Ashton Taylor had spent years selling other people\'s premium cigars and developing an educated dissatisfaction with what was available at the price points his customers could sustain. The Dominican Republic, which had emerged in the 1970s as the primary alternative to Cuban production for American smokers, was producing cigars of widely variable quality — some excellent, many merely adequate. Taylor believed the best Dominican factory was producing at a level that deserved a premium brand, and that the market had not yet given that factory the brand vehicle it required.\r\n\r\nThe factory was Arturo Fuente. The relationship that Taylor established with Carlos Fuente Sr. in 1985 remains in place today — every Ashton cigar is produced in Fuente facilities, using tobaccos that the Fuente family selects and ferments according to the specifications Taylor and Carlito developed together. This arrangement gives Ashton access to the finest Dominican sourcing and manufacturing precision in the island\'s industry. It also means that Ashton and Arturo Fuente share a quality floor — whatever the Fuente family is willing to put their own name on, they will also produce for Taylor\'s brand.\r\n\r\nThe portfolio that resulted from this collaboration covers the full range of Dominican expression. The classic Connecticut shade ranges demonstrate the house\'s core proposition: refined, creamy, consistent. The VSG — Virgin Sun Grown — lines use Ecuadorian sun-grown wrapper to produce a fuller, more complex character that surprised many smokers who knew Ashton only through the milder expressions. The Cabinet Selection, aged in Spanish cedar boxes after rolling, represents the house at maximum sophistication.\r\n\r\nThe brand\'s identity is Philadelphia in character — understated, quality-conscious, more interested in execution than in the theatrical aspects of cigar culture. Ashton does not make headlines with extreme formats or unexpected blends. It makes cigars that experienced enthusiasts return to with reliable satisfaction, which is a more difficult achievement than it sounds.', `history_es` = 'William Ashton Taylor fundó Ashton en Filadelfia en 1985 asociándose con Arturo Fuente — la mejor fábrica de República Dominicana — y confiando el blend al propio Carlos Fuente Sr. El Cabinet Selection, añejada 12-24 meses extras en cajas de cedro español, es su expresión más elegante.', `history_de` = 'William Ashton Taylor gründete Ashton 1985 in Philadelphia in Partnerschaft mit Arturo Fuente — der besten Fabrik in der Dominikanischen Republik — und vertraute das Blend Carlos Fuente Sr. persönlich an. Das Cabinet Selection, 12-24 Monate extra in spanischen Zedernholzboxen gereift, ist sein elegantester Ausdruck.', `history_zh` = '威廉·阿什顿·泰勒于1985年在费城与阿图罗·富恩特合作创立阿什顿——多米尼加共和国最好的工厂——并将混合配方委托给卡洛斯·富恩特本人。Cabinet Selection在西班牙雪松木盒中额外陈化12-24个月，是其最优雅的表达。', `history_ar` = 'أسّس ويليام أشتون تايلور أشتون في فيلادلفيا عام 1985 بالشراكة مع أرتورو فوينتي — أفضل مصانع جمهورية الدومينيكان — مُسنِدًا التركيبة إلى كارلوس فوينتي الأب شخصيًا. الكابينت سيليكشن، المعتَّقة 12-24 شهرًا إضافية في صناديق أرز إسبانية، هي أرق تعبيراته.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Ashton Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican vintage blend — Fuente blend. Notes of cream, vanilla, toasted grain. Consistent, elegant, no surprises. The Magnum format (52 x 127mm) is the most popular. The cigar you give when you don\'t know your guest\'s preferences — it pleases everyone.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"Magnum\", \"Churchill\", \"Cordial\", \"Panetela\"]}, {\"name\": \"VSG — Virgin Sun Grown\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 1999 — the other Ashton. Ecuadorian sun-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan-Dominican blend. Full body, notes of black coffee, chocolate, cayenne pepper. Cigar Aficionado score 94. The VSG reveals a house capable of power when it chooses to exercise it.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Illuminado\", \"Enchantment\", \"Conquistador\", \"Hero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinet Selection\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The prestige range — aged 12 to 24 additional months in Spanish cedar boxes after rolling. Connecticut Shade wrapper. Notes of refined hazelnut, mountain honey, white cedar. Perfection of accessibility — complex without being demanding.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.6\", \"No.7\", \"No.8\", \"No.10\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Ashton Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican vintage blend — Fuente blend. Notas de cream, vainilla, tostado grain. Consistent, elegant, no surprises. The Magnum format (52 x 127mm) is the most popular. The cigar you give when you don\'t know your guest\'s preferences — it pleases everyone.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"Magnum\", \"Churchill\", \"Cordial\", \"Panetela\"]}, {\"name\": \"VSG — Virgin Sun Grown\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 1999 — the other Ashton. Ecuadorian sun-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan-Dominican blend. Full body, notas de black café, chocolate, cayenne pimienta. Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 94. The VSG revela a house capable of power when it chooses to exercise it.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Illuminado\", \"Enchantment\", \"Conquistador\", \"Hero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinet Selection\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The prestige range — aged 12 to 24 additional months in Spanish cedro boxes after rolling. Connecticut Shade wrapper. Notas de refined avellana, mountain miel, white cedro. Perfection of accessibility — complex without being demanding.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.6\", \"No.7\", \"No.8\", \"No.10\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Ashton Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican vintage blend — Fuente blend. Noten von cream, Vanille, geröstet grain. Consistent, elegant, no surprises. The Magnum format (52 x 127mm) is the most popular. The cigar you give when you don\'t know your guest\'s preferences — it pleases everyone.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"Magnum\", \"Churchill\", \"Cordial\", \"Panetela\"]}, {\"name\": \"VSG — Virgin Sun Grown\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 1999 — the other Ashton. Ecuadorian sun-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan-Dominican blend. Full body, Noten von black Kaffee, Schokolade, cayenne Pfeffer. Cigar Aficionado Score 94. The VSG reveals a house capable of power when it chooses to exercise it.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Illuminado\", \"Enchantment\", \"Conquistador\", \"Hero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinet Selection\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The prestige range — aged 12 to 24 additional months in Spanish Zeder boxes after rolling. Connecticut Shade wrapper. Noten von refined Haselnuss, mountain honey, white Zeder. Perfection of accessibility — complex without being demanding.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.6\", \"No.7\", \"No.8\", \"No.10\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Ashton Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican vintage blend — Fuente blend. 风味： cream, 香草, 烘烤 grain. Consistent, elegant, no surprises. The Magnum format (52 x 127mm) is the most popular. The cigar you give when you don\'t know your guest\'s preferences — it pleases everyone.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"Magnum\", \"Churchill\", \"Cordial\", \"Panetela\"]}, {\"name\": \"VSG — Virgin Sun Grown\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 1999 — the other Ashton. Ecuadorian sun-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan-Dominican blend. Full body, 风味包括： black 咖啡, 巧克力, cayenne 胡椒. 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 94. The VSG 展现出 a house capable of power when it chooses to exercise it.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Illuminado\", \"Enchantment\", \"Conquistador\", \"Hero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinet Selection\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The prestige range — aged 12 to 24 additional months in Spanish 雪松木 boxes after rolling. Connecticut Shade wrapper. 风味： refined 榛子, mountain honey, white 雪松木. Perfection of accessibility — complex without being demanding.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.6\", \"No.7\", \"No.8\", \"No.10\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Ashton Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican vintage blend — Fuente blend. نكهات:  cream, فانيليا, محمَّص grain. Consistent, elegant, no surprises. The Magnum format (52 x 127mm) is the most popular. The cigar you give when you don\'t know your guest\'s preferences — it pleases everyone.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"Magnum\", \"Churchill\", \"Cordial\", \"Panetela\"]}, {\"name\": \"VSG — Virgin Sun Grown\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 1999 — the other Ashton. Ecuadorian sun-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan-Dominican blend. Full body, نكهات:  black قهوة, شوكولاتة, cayenne فلفل. تقييم Cigar Aficionado 94. The VSG يكشف عن a house capable of power when it chooses to exercise it.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Illuminado\", \"Enchantment\", \"Conquistador\", \"Hero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinet Selection\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The prestige range — aged 12 to 24 additional months in Spanish أرز boxes after rolling. Connecticut Shade wrapper. نكهات:  refined بندق, mountain honey, white أرز. Perfection of accessibility — complex without being demanding.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.6\", \"No.7\", \"No.8\", \"No.10\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"William Ashton Taylor\", \"anecdote\": \"Taylor is the rare example of a retailer who successfully became a manufacturer. His relationship with Carlos Fuente — built on trust and mutual respect — is often cited as one of the industry\'s finest collaborations.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"William Ashton Taylor\", \"anecdote\": \"Taylor is the rare example of a retailer who successfully became a manufacturer. His relationship with Carlos Fuente — built on trust and mutual respect — is often cited as one of the industry\'s finest collaborations.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"William Ashton Taylor\", \"anecdote\": \"Taylor is the rare example of a retailer who successfully became a manufacturer. His relationship with Carlos Fuente — built on trust and mutual respect — is often cited as one of the industry\'s finest collaborations.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"William Ashton Taylor\", \"anecdote\": \"Taylor is the rare example of a retailer who successfully became a manufacturer. His relationship with Carlos Fuente — built on trust and mutual respect — is often cited as one of the industry\'s finest collaborations.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"William Ashton Taylor\", \"anecdote\": \"Taylor is the rare example of a retailer who successfully became a manufacturer. His relationship with Carlos Fuente — built on trust and mutual respect — is often cited as one of the industry\'s finest collaborations.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Champagne\", \"name\": \"Perrier-Jouët Belle Époque\", \"notes\": \"The floral delicacy of Perrier-Jouët accompanies the Cabinet Selection\'s elegance in a pairing of absolute refinement.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenfiddich 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The pear and walnut notes of Glenfiddich resonate with the nutty sweetness of an Ashton Classic.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Champán\", \"name\": \"Perrier-Jouët Belle Époque\", \"notes\": \"The floral delicacy of Perrier-Jouët accompanies the Cabinet Selection\'s elegance in a pairing of absolute refinement.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenfiddich 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The pear and walnut notas de Glenfiddich resonate with the nutty sweetness of an Ashton Classic.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Champagner\", \"name\": \"Perrier-Jouët Belle Époque\", \"notes\": \"The floral delicacy of Perrier-Jouët accompanies the Cabinet Selection\'s elegance in a pairing of absolute refinement.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenfiddich 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The pear and walnut Noten von Glenfiddich resonate with the nutty sweetness of an Ashton Classic.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"香槟\", \"name\": \"Perrier-Jouët Belle Époque\", \"notes\": \"The floral delicacy of Perrier-Jouët accompanies the Cabinet Selection\'s elegance in a pairing of absolute refinement.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Glenfiddich 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The pear and walnut 风味： Glenfiddich resonate with the nutty sweetness of an Ashton Classic.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الشامبانيا\", \"name\": \"Perrier-Jouët Belle Époque\", \"notes\": \"The floral delicacy of Perrier-Jouët accompanies the Cabinet Selection\'s elegance in a pairing of absolute refinement.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Glenfiddich 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The pear and walnut نكهات: Glenfiddich resonate with the nutty sweetness of an Ashton Classic.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Ashton';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'William Ashton Taylor founded Ashton Cigars in Philadelphia in 1985 with a premise that seems simple in retrospect but was genuinely unusual at the time: that the Dominican Republic, given the right tobacco sourcing and the right manufacturing partner, could produce cigars of absolute world-class quality. The partner he chose was Arturo Fuente — the family house that had rebuilt its reputation in the Dominican Republic after a catastrophic factory fire in 1980 and was by 1985 acknowledged as the finest manufacturer on the island.\r\n\r\nThe Cabinet Selection is the expression that validates Taylor\'s founding premise most completely. It is not merely a premium cigar — it is a cigar that undergoes an additional aging process specifically designed to address what Taylor considered the main deficiency of otherwise excellent Dominican production: the need for time.\r\n\r\nAfter rolling, Cabinet Selection cigars are placed in Spanish cedar boxes — not the decorative cedar of standard packaging, but structural cedar of the type traditionally used in Spanish wine and spirits aging — and left for 12 to 24 months before release. During this period, the tobaccos continue fermenting in a controlled environment that simultaneously smooths any remaining harshness and allows the blend\'s components to fully harmonize. The cedar boxes contribute their own character: the slow transfer of resinous cedar oils over months of contact produces a subtle influence on the wrapper and outer leaves that the standard aging process cannot replicate.\r\n\r\nThe result, in the glass, is a cigar of exceptional composure. The Connecticut shade wrapper — Ecuadorian, like most quality Connecticut-style wrappers today — presents notes of refined hazelnut and mountain honey from the first draw. The Dominican filler, built around Carlos Fuente Sr.\'s personal recipe, develops through white cedar and dried fruit before resolving in a finish of unusual length and cleanliness. There are no rough edges. There is no moment where the cigar asks anything of the smoker beyond attention. The Cabinet Selection is what happens when craft, patience, and exceptional raw material are aligned without compromise.', `history_es` = 'El Cabinet Selection de Ashton es su expresión más elegante — añejada 12 a 24 meses extra en cajas de cedro español tras el lanzado. Envolvente Connecticut Shade ecuatoriano. Notas de avellana refinada, miel de montaña, cedro blanco. Complejidad sin exigencia.', `history_de` = 'Das Cabinet Selection von Ashton ist sein elegantester Ausdruck — 12 bis 24 Monate extra in spanischen Zedernholzboxen nach dem Rollen gereift. Ecuadorianischer Connecticut-Shade-Wrapper. Noten von verfeinerten Haselnüssen, Berghonig, weißer Zeder. Komplexität ohne Anspruchshaltung.', `history_zh` = '阿什顿的Cabinet Selection是其最优雅的表达——卷制后在西班牙雪松木盒中额外陈化12至24个月。厄瓜多尔康涅狄格遮阴茄衣。精炼榛子、山地蜂蜜、白雪松风味。复杂而不苛求。', `history_ar` = 'الكابينت سيليكشن من أشتون هو أرق تعبيراته — معتَّق 12 إلى 24 شهرًا إضافية في صناديق أرز إسبانية بعد اللف. غلاف Connecticut Shade الإكوادوري. نكهات البندق المكرَّر وعسل الجبال والأرز الأبيض. تعقيد دون تطلُّب.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Cabinet Selection\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"Aged Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade wrapper, Dominican Fuente filler aged 2 years in cedar. Notes of refined hazelnut, mountain honey, white cedar. Elegant medium. Each number (No.1 to No.10) is a different format — Ashton\'s most complete range.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.1\",\"No.2\",\"No.3\",\"No.6\",\"No.7\",\"No.8\",\"No.10\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Cabinet Selection\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"Capa Connecticut Shade ecuatoriana envejecida y tripa Dominican Fuente reposada 2 años en cedro. Notas de avellana afinada, miel de montaña y cedro blanco. Medio elegante. Cada número (del No.1 al No.10) corresponde a un formato distinto: la gama más completa de Ashton.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.1\",\"No.2\",\"No.3\",\"No.6\",\"No.7\",\"No.8\",\"No.10\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Cabinet Selection\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"Gereiftes ecuadorianisches Connecticut-Shade-Deckblatt, dominikanische Fuente-Einlage, zwei Jahre in Zedernholz gelagert. Noten von veredelter Haselnuss, Bergwiesenhonig und hellem Zedernholz. Elegantes Medium. Jede Nummer (No.1 bis No.10) steht für ein anderes Format — Ashtons vollständigste Linie.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.1\",\"No.2\",\"No.3\",\"No.6\",\"No.7\",\"No.8\",\"No.10\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Cabinet Selection\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"陈化的厄瓜多尔 Connecticut Shade 茄衣，多米尼加 Fuente 填充在雪松中陈放两年。精致榛果、山地蜂蜜与白雪松的气息。优雅的中度。每个编号（No.1 至 No.10）对应一种规格——这是 Ashton 最完整的一条产品线。\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.1\",\"No.2\",\"No.3\",\"No.6\",\"No.7\",\"No.8\",\"No.10\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Cabinet Selection\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"غلاف Connecticut Shade إكوادوري معتَّق، وحشوة Dominican Fuente مُعتَّقة سنتين في خشب الأرز. لمسات من البندق المكرَّر وعسل الجبال والأرز الفاتح. متوسط أنيق. وكل رقم (من No.1 إلى No.10) يقابل طرازاً مختلفاً — وهي أشمل تشكيلات Ashton.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.1\",\"No.2\",\"No.3\",\"No.6\",\"No.7\",\"No.8\",\"No.10\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'Ashton Cabinet';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Avo Uvezian\'s biography defies the conventions of the cigar industry\'s typical founder narrative. Born in Beirut in 1926 to Armenian parents who had survived the genocide, he left Lebanon in his twenties for New York, where he became a jazz pianist of sufficient accomplishment to join Frank Sinatra\'s touring band. His musical career took him through the clubs of New York, the concert halls of Europe, and eventually to the unlikely distinction of having contributed to one of the twentieth century\'s most recognizable popular songs — though the credit for \'Strangers in the Night\' remained disputed throughout his life.\r\n\r\nBy his sixties, Uvezian had settled into a life that combined modest jazz performance with a deepening interest in cigars. He was a smoker of the old Cuban school, educated by the same Havana tobacco culture that Sinatra and his circle had absorbed in their own Manhattan years. The Dominican Republic, which had become the premium cigar world\'s alternative to Cuba by the 1980s, offered what Uvezian needed: access to excellent manufacturing and the possibility of building something under his own name.\r\n\r\nHis friend Zino Davidoff facilitated the introduction to the MATASA factory in Santiago — the same facility where Davidoff\'s Dominican production was being developed. The first Avo XOs appeared in 1988, immediately distinguished by naming conventions that no other cigar manufacturer had employed: the vitolas carried jazz chord names — Intermezzo, Maestoso, Notturno, Impromptu — rather than the numerical or format-based designations that the rest of the industry used. It was a statement of aesthetic identity that proved to be commercially effective.\r\n\r\nThe Davidoff group acquired Avo during the 1990s and has maintained production in the Dominican Republic under the original ethos. Avo Uvezian died in February 2017 at the age of 89, having smoked his own cigars daily throughout his final years. The brand continues as a tribute, with each release maintaining the connection between jazz\'s vocabulary and Dominican tobacco\'s possibilities that Uvezian established when he decided, at an age when most musicians are considering retirement, to become a cigar maker instead.', `history_es` = 'Avo Uvezian era pianista de jazz que acompañó a Frank Sinatra. A sus 60 años, su amigo Zino Davidoff le ayudó a crear su propia marca en 1988 en República Dominicana. Los primeros Avo llevaban nombres de acordes de jazz: Intermezzo, Maestoso, Notturno. Avo murió en 2017 a los 89 años rodeado de su música y sus cigarros.', `history_de` = 'Avo Uvezian war ein Jazzpianist, der Frank Sinatra begleitete. Im Alter von 60 Jahren half ihm sein Freund Zino Davidoff 1988, seine eigene Marke in der Dominikanischen Republik zu gründen. Die ersten Avos trugen Jazz-Akkordnamen: Intermezzo, Maestoso, Notturno. Avo starb 2017 im Alter von 89 Jahren, umgeben von seiner Musik und seinen Zigarren.', `history_zh` = '阿沃·乌维齐安是一位爵士钢琴家，曾为弗兰克·辛纳特拉伴奏。60多岁时，他的朋友齐诺·大卫杜夫帮助他于1988年在多米尼加共和国创立了自己的品牌。第一批阿沃以爵士和弦命名：间奏曲、庄严曲、夜曲。阿沃于2017年以89岁高龄在音乐和雪茄的陪伴中离世。', `history_ar` = 'آفو أوفيزيان كان عازف بيانو جاز رافق فرانك سيناترا. في الستينيات من عمره، ساعده صديقه زينو ديفيدوف عام 1988 على تأسيس علامته في جمهورية الدومينيكان. حملت أول سيجار آفو أسماء توافقات جاز: إنترميتسو، مايستوسو، نوتورنو. رحل آفو عام 2017 عن 89 عامًا وسط موسيقاه وسيجاره.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range — Connecticut Shade over aged Dominican. Notes of cream, vanilla, café au lait. Each vitola numbered (No.1 to No.9) by format. Sweet, musical, unaggressive. The cigar Sinatra would have loved after a concert — accessible and elegant like a jazz standard.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.5\", \"No.9\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}, {\"name\": \"XO Series\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"The jazz range — musical chord names: Intermezzo (Robusto), Maestoso (Churchill), Notturno (Toro). Thicker Connecticut Shade wrapper over more structured Dominican. Notes of golden hazelnut, cedar, golden vanilla. The XO Intermezzo is the most played — like a jazz tune you hum without realizing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Intermezzo\", \"Maestoso\", \"Notturno\", \"Preludio\"]}, {\"name\": \"Uvezian\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Posthumous tribute to the founder — launched after his 2017 death. Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper over Dominican-Nicaraguan. Medium-Full, bolder than the classic ranges. Notes of toasted bread, coffee, light spice. The final signature of a man who transformed two passions into one.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range — Connecticut Shade over aged Dominican. Notas de cream, vainilla, café au lait. Each vitola numbered (No.1 to No.9) by format. Sweet, musical, unaggressive. The cigar Sinatra would have loved after a concert — accessible and elegant like a jazz standard.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.5\", \"No.9\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}, {\"name\": \"XO Series\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"The jazz range — musical chord names: Intermezzo (Robusto), Maestoso (Churchill), Notturno (Toro). Thicker Connecticut Shade wrapper over more structured Dominican. Notas de golden avellana, cedro, golden vainilla. The XO Intermezzo is the most played — like a jazz tune you hum without realizing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Intermezzo\", \"Maestoso\", \"Notturno\", \"Preludio\"]}, {\"name\": \"Uvezian\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Posthumous tribute to the founder — launched after his 2017 death. Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper over Dominican-Nicaraguan. Medium-Full, bolder than the classic ranges. Notas de tostado bread, café, light spice. The final signature of a man who transformed two passions into one.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range — Connecticut Shade over aged Dominican. Noten von cream, Vanille, café au lait. Each vitola numbered (No.1 to No.9) by format. Sweet, musical, unaggressive. The cigar Sinatra would have loved after a concert — accessible and elegant like a jazz standard.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.5\", \"No.9\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}, {\"name\": \"XO Series\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"The jazz range — musical chord names: Intermezzo (Robusto), Maestoso (Churchill), Notturno (Toro). Thicker Connecticut Shade wrapper over more structured Dominican. Noten von golden Haselnuss, Zeder, golden Vanille. The XO Intermezzo is the most played — like a jazz tune you hum without realizing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Intermezzo\", \"Maestoso\", \"Notturno\", \"Preludio\"]}, {\"name\": \"Uvezian\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Posthumous tribute to the founder — launched after his 2017 death. Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper over Dominican-Nicaraguan. Medium-Full, bolder than the classic ranges. Noten von geröstet bread, Kaffee, light spice. The final signature of a man who transformed two passions into one.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range — Connecticut Shade over aged Dominican. 风味： cream, 香草, café au lait. Each vitola numbered (No.1 to No.9) by format. Sweet, musical, unaggressive. The cigar Sinatra would have loved after a concert — accessible and elegant like a jazz standard.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.5\", \"No.9\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}, {\"name\": \"XO Series\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"The jazz range — musical chord names: Intermezzo (Robusto), Maestoso (Churchill), Notturno (Toro). Thicker Connecticut Shade wrapper over more structured Dominican. 风味： golden 榛子, 雪松木, golden 香草. The XO Intermezzo is the most played — like a jazz tune you hum without realizing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Intermezzo\", \"Maestoso\", \"Notturno\", \"Preludio\"]}, {\"name\": \"Uvezian\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Posthumous tribute to the founder — launched after his 2017 death. Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper over Dominican-Nicaraguan. Medium-Full, bolder than the classic ranges. 风味： 烘烤 bread, 咖啡, light spice. The final signature of a man who transformed two passions into one.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Classic\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range — Connecticut Shade over aged Dominican. نكهات:  cream, فانيليا, café au lait. Each vitola numbered (No.1 to No.9) by format. Sweet, musical, unaggressive. The cigar Sinatra would have loved after a concert — accessible and elegant like a jazz standard.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.3\", \"No.5\", \"No.9\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}, {\"name\": \"XO Series\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"The jazz range — musical chord names: Intermezzo (Robusto), Maestoso (Churchill), Notturno (Toro). Thicker Connecticut Shade wrapper over more structured Dominican. نكهات:  golden بندق, أرز, golden فانيليا. The XO Intermezzo is the most played — like a jazz tune you hum without realizing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Intermezzo\", \"Maestoso\", \"Notturno\", \"Preludio\"]}, {\"name\": \"Uvezian\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Posthumous tribute to the founder — launched after his 2017 death. Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper over Dominican-Nicaraguan. Medium-Full, bolder than the classic ranges. نكهات:  محمَّص bread, قهوة, light spice. The final signature of a man who transformed two passions into one.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He reportedly smoked the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He supuestamente fumaba the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He angeblich rauchte the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He 据报道 smoked the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He يُقال إن smoked the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"Licores\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"Spirituosen\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"烈酒\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"المسكرات\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Avo';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Bolívar is the cigar that does not negotiate. Founded in 1902 and named in deliberate tribute to Simón Bolívar — the Venezuelan-born general who liberated six South American nations from Spanish colonial rule — the brand has always understood itself as something distinct from the refinements of Havana\'s more diplomatic houses. The portrait on the band shows Bolívar in full military uniform, jaw set, eyes direct. This is not ornamentation. It is a declaration of intent.\r\n\r\nThe brand was created by José F. Rocha and quickly distinguished itself through the sheer force of its tobacco selection. Where other Havana houses of the era sought balance and elegance, Rocha built Bolívar around the darkest, most mature leaves from the Vuelta Abajo growing region — tobaccos that had spent more time fermenting, more time aging, and more time developing the deep earthiness that defines the style. The result was a cigar that divided opinion immediately and has continued to do so for 120 years. It is the most powerful of the major Cuban brands. It asks something of the smoker.\r\n\r\nThe aromatic profile is unlike any other great Cuban. Humid forest floor after rain. Old leather and dark tanning. Unsweetened espresso. Bitter cocoa from Cacao Barry\'s darkest shelf. Occasionally, late in the smoke, a wave of black truffle that experienced enthusiasts recognize as the signature of old Vuelta Abajo fermenting at its peak. These are not metaphors constructed for marketing purposes. They are the consistent testimony of the most experienced tasters in the world, reviewing Bolívar across decades and formats.\r\n\r\nThe Royal Corona — 42 x 127mm, a Petit Robusto — is the house\'s most versatile proposition: 30 minutes of concentrated power that delivers the full Bolívar experience in a format accessible to smokers who cannot commit to a 90-minute session. The Belicosos Finos, in pyramidal Torpedo format at 52 x 140mm, is the brand\'s intellectual center of gravity. The tapering head moderates the intensity of the first third, building progressively through one of the most structured smoking experiences in Cuban tobacco. Its construction demands skill from the torcedor — and rewards patience from the smoker.\r\n\r\nBolívar has always attracted a specific type of enthusiast. Not collectors drawn to rarity or investors tracking limited editions — but smokers who have tasted the full range of Cuban tobacco and chosen the most demanding option with full knowledge of what they were doing. The brand\'s devotees speak of it with a loyalty that approaches the evangelical. The rest of the market tends to describe it, somewhat resentfully, as an acquired taste — which is exactly what its creators intended.', `history_es` = 'Bolívar, fundada en 1902, es el cigarro de los rebeldes y filósofos. Nombrada en homenaje al Libertador Simón Bolívar, es la marca más robusta entre los grandes cubanos. Sus perfiles aromáticos evocan el bosque húmedo, la tierra tras la lluvia, el cuero viejo. El Royal Corona y los Belicosos Finos son sus dos tesoros.', `history_de` = 'Bolívar, 1902 gegründet, ist die Zigarre der Rebellen und Philosophen. Benannt nach dem Libertador Simón Bolívar, ist sie die kräftigste unter den großen kubanischen Marken. Die aromatischen Profile erinnern an feuchten Wald, Erde nach dem Regen, altes Leder.', `history_zh` = '创立于1902年的玻利瓦尔是叛逆者与哲学家的雪茄。以解放者西蒙·玻利瓦尔命名，是古巴主要品牌中最强劲的。其芳香轮廓令人联想到潮湿的森林、雨后的泥土和旧皮革。皇家科罗纳和贝利科索斯菲诺斯是其两大瑰宝。', `history_ar` = 'بوليفار، المؤسَّسة عام 1902، سيجار المتمردين والفلاسفة. سُمِّيت تكريمًا للمحرِّر سيمون بوليفار، وهي الأكثر قوةً بين الماركات الكوبية الكبرى. ملامحها العطرية تستحضر الغابة الرطبة والتربة بعد المطر والجلد القديم.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Belicosos Finos\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Belicosos format (52 x 140mm), pyramidal. The house\'s most powerful format. The conical shape concentrates Bolívar\'s earthy aromas into an almost medicinal intensity. Notes of damp soil, roasted coffee, long pepper. Only to be smoked after a hearty meal. Aging in the humidor is essential: three years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Belicosos Finos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Royal Corona\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Petit Corona (42 x 127mm). More accessible than the Belicosos but without compromise on character. The Royal Corona is the everyday Bolívar — for those whose \'everyday\' means full body without exception. Notes of dark wood, undergrowth, black spices.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Royal Corona\"]}, {\"name\": \"Coronas Gigantes\", \"color\": \"#4A235A\", \"story\": \"Double Corona (42 x 178mm). The longest Bolívar format — 90 minutes that travel through all the house\'s aromatic registers. Rare, barely distributed, sought by European collectors. The third hour of a Corona Gigantes is a journey in itself.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Coronas Gigantes\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Belicosos Finos\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Belicosos format (52 x 140mm), pyramidal. La most powerful format. The conical shape concentrates Bolívar\'s earthy aromas into an almost medicinal intensity. Notas de damp soil, tostado café, long pimienta. Only to be smoked after a hearty meal. Aging in the humidor is essential: three years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Belicosos Finos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Royal Corona\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Petit Corona (42 x 127mm). More accessible than the Belicosos but without compromise on character. The Royal Corona is the everyday Bolívar — for those whose \'everyday\' means full body without exception. Notas de dark wood, undergrowth, black especias.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Royal Corona\"]}, {\"name\": \"Coronas Gigantes\", \"color\": \"#4A235A\", \"story\": \"Double Corona (42 x 178mm). The longest Bolívar format — 90 minutos that travel through all la aromatic registers. Rare, barely distributed, sought by European coleccionistas. The third hour of a Corona Gigantes is a journey in itself.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Coronas Gigantes\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Belicosos Finos\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Belicosos format (52 x 140mm), pyramidal. The house\'s most powerful format. The conical shape concentrates Bolívar\'s earthy aromas into an almost medicinal intensity. Noten von damp soil, geröstet Kaffee, long Pfeffer. Only to be smoked after a hearty meal. Aging in the humidor is essential: three years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Belicosos Finos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Royal Corona\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Petit Corona (42 x 127mm). More accessible than the Belicosos but without compromise on character. The Royal Corona is the everyday Bolívar — for those whose \'everyday\' means full body without exception. Noten von dark wood, undergrowth, black Gewürze.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Royal Corona\"]}, {\"name\": \"Coronas Gigantes\", \"color\": \"#4A235A\", \"story\": \"Double Corona (42 x 178mm). The longest Bolívar format — 90 Minuten that travel through all the house\'s aromatic registers. Rare, barely distributed, sought by European collectors. The third hour of a Corona Gigantes is a journey in itself.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Coronas Gigantes\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Belicosos Finos\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Belicoso