D\", \"story\": \"Ecuadorian oscuro wrapper over Dominican. The middle range between Signature finesse and Nicaragua power. 风味： 榛子, café au lait, light 香料. The best-seller in European lounges — accessible, consistent, rewarding.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Toro\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Signature Series\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"The founding range — Anniversario No.1 and No.2, launched in Cuba in 1968. Since the Dominican transfer, these have become their own reference of finesse. نكهات:  white flowers, محمَّص grain, sandalwood. The incarnation of luxury without ostentation.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican\", \"vitolas\": [\"Anniversario No.1\", \"Anniversario No.2\", \"2000\", \"3000\", \"4000\", \"5000\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"أُطلقت عام 2013, tribute to the greatest smoker of the 20th century. Official collaboration with the Churchill family. Bolder than the classic Davidoff range — a major stylistic shift. نكهات:  جلد, smoky wood, oriental توابل. The Late Hour is the nocturnal, even more intense version.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"The Original\", \"The Late Hour\", \"The Statesman\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2022}]}, {\"name\": \"Nicaragua\", \"color\": \"#8B2500\", \"story\": \"Launched 2016, total stylistic break. Davidoff explores Nicaraguan tobacco — the boldest in its catalog. نكهات:  شوكولاتة داكنة, قهوة, tanned جلد. The Nicaragua range proves the Geneva house can navigate all intensities without sacrificing its demand for consistency.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan\", \"vitolas\": [\"Box Pressed Toro\", \"Box Pressed Robusto\", \"Box Pressed Torpedo\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Colorado\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Ecuadorian oscuro wrapper over Dominican. The middle range between Signature finesse and Nicaragua power. نكهات:  بندق, café au lait, light توابل. The best-seller in European lounges — accessible, consistent, rewarding.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Toro\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Zino Davidoff\", \"anecdote\": \"The legendary founder said: \'A cigar is an act of faith. You trust the planter, the fermenter, the torcedor, and time. If any one of them betrays their mission, everything is lost.\' He died in 1994, surrounded by his cigars, aged 88.\"}, {\"name\": \"Winston Churchill (tribute)\", \"anecdote\": \"The Churchill family gave official approval for the 2013 range after examining the cigars and meeting the Davidoff team. It is the only house to have received this posthumous authorization.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Zino Davidoff\", \"anecdote\": \"El fundador legendario said: \'A cigar is an act of faith. You trust the planter, the fermenter, the torcedor, and time. If any one of them betrays their mission, everything is lost.\' He died in 1994, surrounded by his cigars, aged 88.\"}, {\"name\": \"Winston Churchill (tribute)\", \"anecdote\": \"The Churchill family gave official approval for the 2013 range after examining the cigars and meeting the Davidoff team. It es el único house to have received this posthumous authorization.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Zino Davidoff\", \"anecdote\": \"Der legendäre Gründer said: \'A cigar is an act of faith. You trust the planter, the fermenter, the torcedor, and time. If any one of them betrays their mission, everything is lost.\' He died in 1994, surrounded by his cigars, aged 88.\"}, {\"name\": \"Winston Churchill (tribute)\", \"anecdote\": \"The Churchill family gave official approval for the 2013 range after examining the cigars and meeting the Davidoff team. It is the only house to have received this posthumous authorization.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Zino Davidoff\", \"anecdote\": \"传奇创始人 said: \'A cigar is an act of faith. You trust the planter, the fermenter, the torcedor, and time. If any one of them betrays their mission, everything is lost.\' He died in 1994, surrounded by his cigars, aged 88.\"}, {\"name\": \"Winston Churchill (tribute)\", \"anecdote\": \"The Churchill family gave official approval for the 2013 range after examining the cigars and meeting the Davidoff team. It 是唯一 house to have received this posthumous authorization.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Zino Davidoff\", \"anecdote\": \"المؤسِّس الأسطوري said: \'A cigar is an act of faith. You trust the planter, the fermenter, the torcedor, and time. If any one of them betrays their mission, everything is lost.\' He died in 1994, surrounded by his cigars, aged 88.\"}, {\"name\": \"Winston Churchill (tribute)\", \"anecdote\": \"The Churchill family gave official approval for the 2013 range after examining the cigars and meeting the Davidoff team. It هو الوحيد house to have received this posthumous authorization.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Champagne\", \"name\": \"Dom Pérignon 2013\", \"notes\": \"The finesse and complexity of Dom Pérignon accompany the lighter Davidoff ranges in a pairing of equal elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Dalmore King Alexander III\", \"notes\": \"The sherried richness of the Dalmore harmonizes with the Winston Churchill range — two tributes to British greatness.\"}, {\"type\": \"Water\", \"name\": \"Evian water\", \"notes\": \"Davidoff master tabacaleros officially recommend drinking pure water during the smoke to avoid altering the delicate notes. A rare sobriety advice in the cigar world.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Champán\", \"name\": \"Dom Pérignon 2013\", \"notes\": \"The finesse and complexity of Dom Pérignon accompany the lighter Davidoff ranges in a pairing of equal elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Dalmore King Alexander III\", \"notes\": \"The sherried richness of the Dalmore harmonizes with the Winston Churchill range — two tributes to British greatness.\"}, {\"type\": \"Water\", \"name\": \"Evian water\", \"notes\": \"Davidoff master tabacaleros officially recommend drinking pure water during the smoke to avoid altering the delicate notes. A rare sobriety advice in the cigar world.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Champagner\", \"name\": \"Dom Pérignon 2013\", \"notes\": \"The finesse and complexity of Dom Pérignon accompany the lighter Davidoff ranges in a pairing of equal elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Dalmore King Alexander III\", \"notes\": \"The sherried richness of the Dalmore harmonizes with the Winston Churchill range — two tributes to British greatness.\"}, {\"type\": \"Water\", \"name\": \"Evian water\", \"notes\": \"Davidoff master tabacaleros officially recommend drinking pure water during the smoke to avoid altering the delicate notes. A rare sobriety advice in the cigar world.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"香槟\", \"name\": \"Dom Pérignon 2013\", \"notes\": \"The finesse and complexity of Dom Pérignon accompany the lighter Davidoff ranges in a pairing of equal elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Dalmore King Alexander III\", \"notes\": \"The sherried richness of the Dalmore harmonizes with the Winston Churchill range — two tributes to British greatness.\"}, {\"type\": \"Water\", \"name\": \"Evian water\", \"notes\": \"Davidoff master tabacaleros officially recommend drinking pure water during the smoke to avoid altering the delicate notes. A rare sobriety advice in the cigar world.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الشامبانيا\", \"name\": \"Dom Pérignon 2013\", \"notes\": \"The finesse and complexity of Dom Pérignon accompany the lighter Davidoff ranges in a pairing of equal elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Dalmore King Alexander III\", \"notes\": \"The sherried richness of the Dalmore harmonizes with the Winston Churchill range — two tributes to British greatness.\"}, {\"type\": \"Water\", \"name\": \"Evian water\", \"notes\": \"Davidoff master tabacaleros officially recommend drinking pure water during the smoke to avoid altering the delicate notes. A rare sobriety advice in the cigar world.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Davidoff';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Jonathan Drew and Marvin Samuels founded Drew Estate in New York in 1996 with an idea the established cigar industry found somewhere between foolish and offensive: infuse cigars with aromatic compounds — coffee, vanilla, chocolate, rum — and sell them to people who had previously found cigars unapproachable. The ACID line that resulted from this approach was immediately successful in ways that the traditional industry could not fully account for. It sold cigars to people who did not smoke cigars. It sold premium-priced products to consumers who had never entered a cigar shop. It created a new segment where previously there had been a wall.\r\n\r\nThe purist reaction was predictable and partially valid. ACID cigars were not, in the traditional sense, expressions of tobacco terroir. The added aromatics dominated the wrapper, binder, and filler contributions in ways that made technical discussion of the blend largely irrelevant. Experienced tasters did not review ACID. The established trade press treated the brand as a separate category, implicitly acknowledging that the rules governing premium evaluation did not apply.\r\n\r\nDrew Estate\'s move to Estelí, Nicaragua in 2000 established the manufacturing base that allowed the company to scale ACID production while simultaneously developing the serious tobacco project that would become Liga Privada. The same factory that produced infused cigarillos was blending Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrappers over Nicaraguan ligero for a private label that Drew had no intention of commercializing. The two activities coexisted in the same building without apparent contradiction because Drew understood them as separate expressions of the same thing: a strong point of view about what a cigar should do.\r\n\r\nLiga Privada No.9\'s commercial breakthrough in 2008, and the critical recognition that followed, forced the market to revise its assessment of Drew Estate entirely. A house capable of producing the most critically acclaimed premium cigar of the year alongside the best-selling flavored cigar in the country occupies a position in the industry that no prior category could describe. Drew Estate\'s legacy, whatever it ultimately turns out to be, will be built on the fact that it expanded the category at both ends simultaneously.', `history_es` = 'Jonathan Drew y Marvin Samuels fundaron Drew Estate en Nueva York en 1996 con una idea herética: infundir cigarros con aromas de café, vainilla y chocolate. Los puristas se burlaron. Los ACID se vendieron por millones. Drew Estate domina hoy dos universos opuestos: cigarros infusionados ACID y la Liga Privada premium.', `history_de` = 'Jonathan Drew und Marvin Samuels gründeten Drew Estate 1996 in New York mit einer ketzerischen Idee: Zigarren mit Kaffee-, Vanille- und Schokoladenaromen zu infusieren. Die Puristen spotteten. Die ACID verkauften sich millionenfach. Drew Estate beherrscht heute zwei entgegengesetzte Universen: infusionierte ACID-Zigarren und die Premium-Liga-Privada.', `history_zh` = '乔纳森·德鲁和马文·塞缪尔斯于1996年在纽约创立Drew Estate，带着一个异端想法：将雪茄注入咖啡、香草和巧克力香气。纯粹主义者嘲笑。ACID卖出了数百万支。Drew Estate如今主宰两个截然相反的领域：ACID注香雪茄和高端私人联盟。', `history_ar` = 'أسّس جوناثان درو ومارفن سامويلز Drew Estate في نيويورك عام 1996 بفكرة هرطقية: نقع السيجار بعطور القهوة والفانيليا والشوكولاتة. سخر الأقحاح. بيعت ACID بالملايين. يسيطر Drew Estate اليوم على كونَين متضادَّين: سيجار ACID المنقوع وليغا بريفادا الفاخرة.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"ACID Kuba Kuba\", \"color\": \"#7B1FA2\", \"story\": \"The infused best-seller — aromas of tea, botanical herbs, floral essence. Robusto format (54 x 127mm). The cigar that introduced millions of Americans to cigars without intimidating them with traditional blend power. Indonesian wrapper over Drew Estate proprietary blend. Controversial among purists, adored by fans.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Kuba Kuba\", \"Blondie\", \"Dirty Rat\", \"Deep Dish\", \"Krush\"]}, {\"name\": \"Liga Privada No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Drew Estate\'s other face — the most serious, most sought-after. Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. Cigar Aficionado score 97. Notes of ristretto coffee, 90% cocoa, mulberry. The Flying Pig (short, stout Perfecto format) is the range\'s rarest and most expensive.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Undercrown\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Created by the torcedores themselves — factory workers who wanted a cigar as good as Liga Privada at an accessible price. Blend close to the No.9, less expensive Ecuadorian wrapper. Notes of chocolate, coffee, pepper. The most successful worker rebellion in the industry.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona Viva\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Shade\", \"Sun Grown\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"ACID Kuba Kuba\", \"color\": \"#7B1FA2\", \"story\": \"The infused best-seller — aromas of tea, botanical herbs, floral essence. Robusto format (54 x 127mm). The cigar that introduced millions of Americans to cigars without intimidating them with traditional blend power. Indonesian wrapper over Drew Estate proprietary blend. Controversial among purists, adored by fans.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Kuba Kuba\", \"Blondie\", \"Dirty Rat\", \"Deep Dish\", \"Krush\"]}, {\"name\": \"Liga Privada No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Drew Estate\'s other face — the most serious, most sought-after. Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 97. Notas de ristretto café, 90% cocoa, mulberry. The Flying Pig (short, stout Perfecto format) is the range\'s rarest and most expensive.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Undercrown\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Created by the torcedores themselves — factory workers who wanted a cigar as good as Liga Privada at an accessible price. Blend close to the No.9, less expensive Ecuadorian wrapper. Notas de chocolate, café, pimienta. The most successful worker rebellion in the industry.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona Viva\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Shade\", \"Sun Grown\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"ACID Kuba Kuba\", \"color\": \"#7B1FA2\", \"story\": \"The infused best-seller — aromas of tea, botanical herbs, floral essence. Robusto format (54 x 127mm). The cigar that introduced millions of Americans to cigars without intimidating them with traditional blend power. Indonesian wrapper over Drew Estate proprietary blend. Controversial among purists, adored by fans.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Kuba Kuba\", \"Blondie\", \"Dirty Rat\", \"Deep Dish\", \"Krush\"]}, {\"name\": \"Liga Privada No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Drew Estate\'s other face — the most serious, most sought-after. Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. Cigar Aficionado Score 97. Noten von ristretto Kaffee, 90% cocoa, mulberry. The Flying Pig (short, stout Perfecto format) is the range\'s rarest and most expensive.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Undercrown\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Created by the torcedores themselves — factory workers who wanted a cigar as good as Liga Privada at an accessible price. Blend close to the No.9, less expensive Ecuadorian wrapper. Noten von Schokolade, Kaffee, Pfeffer. The most successful worker rebellion in the industry.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona Viva\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Shade\", \"Sun Grown\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"ACID Kuba Kuba\", \"color\": \"#7B1FA2\", \"story\": \"The infused best-seller — aromas of tea, botanical herbs, floral essence. Robusto format (54 x 127mm). The cigar that introduced millions of Americans to cigars without intimidating them with traditional blend power. Indonesian wrapper over Drew Estate proprietary blend. Controversial among purists, adored by fans.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Kuba Kuba\", \"Blondie\", \"Dirty Rat\", \"Deep Dish\", \"Krush\"]}, {\"name\": \"Liga Privada No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Drew Estate\'s other face — the most serious, most sought-after. Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 97. 风味： 浓缩咖啡, 90% cocoa, mulberry. The Flying Pig (short, stout Perfecto format) is the range\'s rarest and most expensive.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Undercrown\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Created by the torcedores themselves — factory workers who wanted a cigar as good as Liga Privada at an accessible price. Blend close to the No.9, less expensive Ecuadorian wrapper. 风味： 巧克力, 咖啡, 胡椒. The most successful worker rebellion in the industry.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona Viva\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Shade\", \"Sun Grown\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"ACID Kuba Kuba\", \"color\": \"#7B1FA2\", \"story\": \"The infused best-seller — aromas of tea, botanical herbs, floral essence. Robusto format (54 x 127mm). The cigar that introduced millions of Americans to cigars without intimidating them with traditional blend power. Indonesian wrapper over Drew Estate proprietary blend. Controversial among purists, adored by fans.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Kuba Kuba\", \"Blondie\", \"Dirty Rat\", \"Deep Dish\", \"Krush\"]}, {\"name\": \"Liga Privada No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Drew Estate\'s other face — the most serious, most sought-after. Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. تقييم Cigar Aficionado 97. نكهات:  قهوة ريستريتو, 90% cocoa, mulberry. The Flying Pig (short, stout Perfecto format) is the range\'s rarest and most expensive.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Undercrown\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Created by the torcedores themselves — factory workers who wanted a cigar as good as Liga Privada at an accessible price. Blend close to the No.9, less expensive Ecuadorian wrapper. نكهات:  شوكولاتة, قهوة, فلفل. The most successful worker rebellion in the industry.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona Viva\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Shade\", \"Sun Grown\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Drew composes his blends in nocturnal sessions after midnight, usually to music. The Liga Privada No.9 was composed \'for fifteen friends\' — it has since been smoked by several million people. He still refuses to divulge the precise origins of the blend\'s tobaccos.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Drew composes his blends in nocturnal sessions after midnight, usually to music. The Liga Privada No.9 was composed \'for fifteen friends\' — it has since been fumaba by several million people. He still refuses to divulge the precise origins of the blend\'s tobaccos.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Drew composes his blends in nocturnal sessions after midnight, usually to music. The Liga Privada No.9 was composed \'for fifteen friends\' — it has since been rauchte by several million people. He still refuses to divulge the precise origins of the blend\'s tobaccos.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Drew composes his blends in nocturnal sessions after midnight, usually to music. The Liga Privada No.9 was composed \'for fifteen friends\' — it has since been smoked by several million people. He still refuses to divulge the precise origins of the blend\'s tobaccos.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Drew composes his blends in nocturnal sessions after midnight, usually to music. The Liga Privada No.9 was composed \'for fifteen friends\' — it has since been smoked by several million people. He still refuses to divulge the precise origins of the blend\'s tobaccos.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Beer\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Cerveza\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Bier\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"啤酒\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"波旁威士忌\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"البيرة\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"البوربون\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Drew Estate';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Ernesto Perez-Carrillo had already had an entire career when he founded the house that bears his initials. Born in Cuba, he had taken over the small family workshop in Miami, El Crédito, and revived a sleeping brand there: La Gloria Cubana. The success was such that production, which had started in a Little Havana workshop, had to move to the Dominican Republic, and the General Cigar group bought the whole thing at the end of the 1990s.\n\nHe could have stopped there. Past sixty, he left the group and started again, with his two children, in a new factory in Santiago. It is a rare case in this trade: a recognised blender starting from nothing, with no brand name to reuse, betting that his signature would be enough.\n\nThe style of the house is recognisable — a medium to full profile, very carefully constructed, where you feel the work on proportions more than any demonstration of strength. Output remains modest by the standards of the big groups, and that is deliberate.', `history_es` = 'Ernesto Perez-Carrillo ya había hecho una carrera entera cuando fundó la casa que lleva sus iniciales. Nacido en Cuba, había tomado en Miami la pequeña fábrica familiar, El Crédito, y había relanzado allí una marca dormida: La Gloria Cubana. El éxito fue tal que la producción, nacida en un taller de la Pequeña Habana, tuvo que trasladarse a la República Dominicana, y el grupo General Cigar compró el conjunto a finales de los años noventa.\n\nHabría podido detenerse ahí. Pasados los sesenta, dejó el grupo y volvió a empezar, con sus dos hijos, en una fábrica nueva de Santiago. Es un caso raro en este oficio: un ligador reconocido que parte de cero sin nombre de marca que reutilizar, apostando a que su firma bastará.\n\nEl estilo de la casa es reconocible — un medio a fuerte muy construido, donde se percibe el trabajo de proporciones antes que la demostración de fuerza. La producción sigue siendo modesta frente a los grandes grupos, y es deliberado.', `history_de` = 'Ernesto Perez-Carrillo hatte bereits eine ganze Laufbahn hinter sich, als er das Haus gründete, das seine Initialen trägt. In Kuba geboren, hatte er in Miami die kleine Familienfabrik El Crédito übernommen und dort eine schlafende Marke wiederbelebt: La Gloria Cubana. Der Erfolg war so groß, dass die Produktion, die in einer Werkstatt in Little Havana begonnen hatte, in die Dominikanische Republik verlegt werden musste — und der Konzern General Cigar Ende der 1990er Jahre das Ganze übernahm.\n\nEr hätte es dabei belassen können. Mit über sechzig verließ er den Konzern und begann noch einmal von vorn, mit seinen beiden Kindern, in einer neuen Manufaktur in Santiago. Ein seltener Fall in diesem Gewerbe: ein anerkannter Blender, der bei null beginnt, ohne wiederverwendbaren Markennamen, im Vertrauen darauf, dass seine Handschrift genügt.\n\nDer Stil des Hauses ist unverkennbar — ein sehr durchdachtes Medium bis Full, in dem man die Arbeit an den Proportionen stärker spürt als jede Kraftdemonstration. Die Produktion bleibt gemessen an den großen Konzernen bescheiden, und das ist gewollt.', `history_zh` = '创立这家以其名字缩写命名的企业时，埃内斯托·佩雷斯-卡里略已经走完了整整一段职业生涯。他生于古巴，在迈阿密接手了家族的小工厂「信用」，并在那里重振了一个沉睡的品牌：古巴荣耀。成功之大，使得原本始于小哈瓦那作坊的生产不得不迁往多米尼加共和国，而通用雪茄集团在九十年代末买下了整体。\n\n他本可以就此止步。年过六十，他离开集团，与两个孩子一起，在圣地亚哥一座新工厂里重新开始。这在业内极为罕见：一位公认的调配师从零起步，没有可沿用的品牌名，只赌自己的签名足够。\n\n这家的风格辨识度很高——中至浓的路子，结构极为讲究，你感受到的是比例的推敲，而非力度的炫示。相对于大集团，产量始终不大，而这是刻意的。', `history_ar` = 'كان إرنستو بيريز-كاريّو قد أنهى مسيرة كاملة حين أسّس الدار التي تحمل الأحرف الأولى من اسمه. وُلد في كوبا، وتسلّم في ميامي مصنع العائلة الصغير «إل كريديتو»، وأحيا فيه علامة نائمة: لا غلوريا كوبانا. وبلغ النجاح حدّاً اضطرّ معه الإنتاج، الذي بدأ في ورشة بهافانا الصغيرة، إلى الانتقال إلى الجمهورية الدومينيكية، فاشترت مجموعة «جنرال سيغار» المشروع كلّه في أواخر التسعينيات.\n\nكان بوسعه أن يتوقّف عند ذلك. لكنه، بعد الستين، غادر المجموعة وبدأ من جديد، مع ولديه، في مصنع حديث بسانتياغو. وهي حالة نادرة في هذه المهنة: خبير خلطات معترف به ينطلق من الصفر دون اسم علامة يعيد استخدامه، مراهناً على أن توقيعه يكفي.\n\nأسلوب الدار قابل للتمييز — طابع متوسط إلى قوي، شديد الإحكام، تشعر فيه بالعمل على النِّسب أكثر مما تشعر باستعراض القوّة. ويبقى الإنتاج متواضعاً بمقاييس المجموعات الكبرى، وهذا مقصود.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Encore\",\"color\":\"#8B1A1A\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"The name nods to a career begun again. A dense, tightly built blend in which the power serves the structure instead of replacing it.\"},{\"name\":\"New Wave Connecticut\",\"color\":\"#D2B48C\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"The gentle side of the house: pale wrapper, morning register, cream and almond. Proof that a blender known for strength also knows how to hold back.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Encore\",\"color\":\"#8B1A1A\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano de Ecuador\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"El nombre es un guiño a una carrera recomenzada. Liga densa y muy construida, donde la potencia sirve a la estructura en lugar de sustituirla.\"},{\"name\":\"New Wave Connecticut\",\"color\":\"#D2B48C\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"La vertiente suave de la casa: capa clara, registro matinal, crema y almendra. La demostración de que un ligador conocido por lo fuerte también sabe contenerse.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Encore\",\"color\":\"#8B1A1A\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano aus Ecuador\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Der Name spielt auf eine noch einmal begonnene Laufbahn an. Ein dichter, streng gebauter Blend, in dem die Kraft der Struktur dient, statt sie zu ersetzen.\"},{\"name\":\"New Wave Connecticut\",\"color\":\"#D2B48C\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"Die sanfte Seite des Hauses: helles Deckblatt, Morgenregister, Sahne und Mandel. Der Beweis, dass ein für Kraft bekannter Blender auch zurückhalten kann.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Encore\",\"color\":\"#8B1A1A\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"厄瓜多尔哈瓦那种\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"这个名字呼应一段重新开始的职业生涯。配方厚实而结构严谨，力度服务于结构，而非取代结构。\"},{\"name\":\"New Wave Connecticut\",\"color\":\"#D2B48C\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"这家柔和的一面：浅色茄衣，清晨的调子，奶油与杏仁。证明一位以浓郁著称的调配师同样懂得收手。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Encore\",\"color\":\"#8B1A1A\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"هابانو إكوادوري\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"الاسم إيماءة إلى مسيرة استُؤنفت. خلطة كثيفة محكمة البناء، تخدم فيها القوّةُ البنيةَ بدل أن تحلّ محلّها.\"},{\"name\":\"New Wave Connecticut\",\"color\":\"#D2B48C\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"الوجه اللطيف للدار: غلاف فاتح، ومزاج صباحي، وقشدة ولوز. دليل على أن خبير خلطات اشتُهر بالقوّة يعرف أيضاً كيف يكبح يده.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"Aged Dominican rum\",\"notes\":\"The candied fruit of the local rum answers the density of Encore.\"},{\"type\":\"Coffee\",\"name\":\"Café au lait\",\"notes\":\"On the New Wave, a long milky coffee extends the cream without covering it.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Ron dominicano añejo\",\"notes\":\"La fruta confitada del ron local responde a la densidad de Encore.\"},{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Café con leche\",\"notes\":\"Sobre el New Wave, un café largo y lácteo prolonga la crema sin taparla.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Alter dominikanischer Rum\",\"notes\":\"Die kandierte Frucht des einheimischen Rums antwortet auf die Dichte des Encore.\"},{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Milchkaffee\",\"notes\":\"Beim New Wave verlängert ein langer, milchiger Kaffee die Sahnigkeit, ohne sie zu überdecken.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"多米尼加陈年朗姆\",\"notes\":\"本地朗姆的蜜饯果香回应 Encore 的厚实。\"},{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"欧蕾咖啡\",\"notes\":\"配 New Wave 时，一杯淡而带奶的咖啡延长奶油感，却不掩盖它。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"روم دومينيكي معتَّق\",\"notes\":\"فاكهة الروم المحلّي المسكّرة تردّ على كثافة «إنكور».\"},{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة بالحليب\",\"notes\":\"مع «نيو ويڤ»، قهوة طويلة بالحليب تمدّ القشدة دون أن تغطّيها.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'E.P. Carrillo';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Excalibur was born from a collaboration that seems improbable on paper: a Swiss entrepreneur (Villiger Söhne), a genius Dominican blender (Hendrik Kelner), and Honduran plantations from the Eiroa family in the Jamastran valley.\r\n\r\nHeinrich Villiger initiated the project in the early 1980s, when the American market was searching for alternatives to the inaccessible Cuban cigars. Kelner — who would later become the driving force behind Davidoff Dominican, Santa Damiana, and a dozen other brands — assembled a Honduran blend exploiting the Corojo tobaccos of Jamastran. Its signature: earthy and deep like Honduras, but with a roundness and creaminess that bring the profile closer to accessible medium territory.\r\n\r\nExcalibur experienced a first period of glory in the 1980s-1990s on the American market, perceived as a quality proxy for forbidden Cuban cigars. Its Robusto earned Cigar Aficionado scores that placed it several times in annual top rankings.\r\n\r\nThe brand was sold to Altadis USA in the early 2000s, but Villiger retained the European rights — creating a dual-market situation comparable to the great Cuban brands under embargo. The Honduran version remains the reference: more earthy, more complex, with the Jamastran signature that distinguishes Honduras from other Central American terroirs. The construction, inherited from Kelner\'s standards, remains exemplary in its consistency.', `history_es` = 'Excalibur nació de una colaboración que sobre el papel parece improbable: un empresario suizo (Villiger Söhne), un genial maestro ligador dominicano (Hendrik Kelner) y las plantaciones hondureñas de la familia Eiroa en el valle de Jamastran.\n\nHeinrich Villiger puso en marcha el proyecto a principios de los años ochenta, cuando el mercado estadounidense buscaba alternativas a los inaccesibles puros cubanos. Kelner —que llegaría a ser el cerebro de Davidoff Dominican, Santa Damiana y una docena de marcas más— compuso una ligada hondureña que explotaba los tabacos Corojo de Jamastran. Su firma: terrosa y profunda como Honduras, pero con una redondez y una cremosidad que acercan el perfil al registro medio accesible.\n\nExcalibur vivió una primera época de gloria en los años ochenta y noventa en el mercado estadounidense, donde se le veía como un sustituto de calidad de los puros cubanos prohibidos. Su Robusto obtuvo puntuaciones de Cigar Aficionado que lo situaron varias veces en las listas anuales.\n\nLa marca se vendió a Altadis USA a principios de los años dos mil, pero Villiger conservó los derechos europeos, creando una doble comercialización comparable a la de las grandes marcas cubanas bajo embargo. La versión hondureña sigue siendo la referencia: más terrosa, más compleja, con la firma Jamastran que distingue a Honduras de los demás terruños centroamericanos. La construcción, heredada de los estándares de Kelner, sigue siendo ejemplar por su regularidad.', `history_de` = 'Excalibur entstand aus einer Zusammenarbeit, die auf dem Papier unwahrscheinlich wirkt: ein Schweizer Unternehmer (Villiger Söhne), ein genialer dominikanischer Blender (Hendrik Kelner) und die honduranischen Pflanzungen der Familie Eiroa im Jamastran-Tal.\n\nHeinrich Villiger stieß das Projekt Anfang der 1980er Jahre an, als der amerikanische Markt nach Alternativen zu den unerreichbaren kubanischen Zigarren suchte. Kelner — der später der Kopf hinter Davidoff Dominican, Santa Damiana und einem Dutzend weiterer Marken werden sollte — stellte eine honduranische Mischung aus den Corojo-Tabaken von Jamastran zusammen. Seine Handschrift: erdig und tief wie Honduras, doch mit einer Rundheit und Cremigkeit, die das Profil dem zugänglichen mittleren Register annähern.\n\nIn den 1980er und 1990er Jahren erlebte Excalibur auf dem amerikanischen Markt eine erste Blütezeit; man sah darin einen qualitativen Ersatz für die verbotenen kubanischen Zigarren. Sein Robusto erhielt von Cigar Aficionado Bewertungen, die ihn mehrfach in die Jahreslisten brachten.\n\nAnfang der 2000er Jahre wurde die Marke an Altadis USA verkauft, doch Villiger behielt die europäischen Rechte — eine doppelte Vermarktung, vergleichbar mit jener der großen kubanischen Marken unter dem Embargo. Die honduranische Version bleibt die Referenz: erdiger, komplexer, mit jener Jamastran-Handschrift, die Honduras von den übrigen mittelamerikanischen Terroirs unterscheidet. Die aus Kelners Maßstäben ererbte Machart bleibt in ihrer Gleichmäßigkeit vorbildlich.', `history_zh` = 'Excalibur 诞生于一次纸面上看来极不可能的合作：一位瑞士企业家（Villiger Söhne）、一位天才的多米尼加调配师（Hendrik Kelner），以及 Eiroa 家族在洪都拉斯 Jamastran 谷地的种植园。\n\n1980 年代初，正当美国市场寻找无法获得的古巴雪茄的替代品时，Heinrich Villiger 发起了这一项目。Kelner——日后成为 Davidoff Dominican、Santa Damiana 及十余个品牌背后的大脑——以 Jamastran 的 Corojo 烟叶配出了一款洪都拉斯配方。他的签名风格是：如洪都拉斯般厚土而深沉，却带着一份圆润与奶香，使整体口感靠近平易近人的中度区间。\n\n1980 至 1990 年代，Excalibur 在美国市场迎来第一个鼎盛期，被视为禁运下古巴雪茄的优质替代。其 Robusto 在《Cigar Aficionado》获得的评分数次让它进入年度榜单。\n\n2000 年代初，品牌被转售给 Altadis USA，但 Villiger 保留了欧洲权利——形成了与禁运下古巴大品牌相似的双重经营格局。洪都拉斯版仍是标杆：更厚土、更复杂，带着将洪都拉斯与其他中美洲风土区分开来的 Jamastran 印记。承袭 Kelner 标准的卷制工艺，其稳定一致至今堪称典范。', `history_ar` = 'وُلدت Excalibur من تعاون يبدو على الورق بعيد الاحتمال: رجل أعمال سويسري (Villiger Söhne)، وخبير خلطات دومينيكي بارع (Hendrik Kelner)، ومزارع هندوراسية تملكها عائلة Eiroa في وادي Jamastran.\n\nأطلق Heinrich Villiger المشروع في مطلع الثمانينيات، حين كانت السوق الأمريكية تبحث عن بدائل للسيجار الكوبي المتعذّر الحصول عليه. أما Kelner — الذي سيصبح العقل المدبّر وراء Davidoff Dominican وSanta Damiana وعشرات العلامات الأخرى — فقد ركّب خلطة هندوراسية تقوم على تبغ Corojo من Jamastran. وبصمته: ترابية عميقة كما هي هندوراس، لكن بامتلاء وقوام كريمي يقرّبان الطابع من المستوى المتوسط السهل.\n\nعرفت Excalibur فترة مجد أولى في الثمانينيات والتسعينيات في السوق الأمريكية، إذ نُظر إليها كبديل رصين للسيجار الكوبي المحظور. ونالت وحدتها من طراز Robusto درجات من Cigar Aficionado وضعتها مراراً في القوائم السنوية.\n\nبيعت العلامة إلى Altadis USA في مطلع الألفية، غير أن Villiger احتفظت بالحقوق الأوروبية، فنشأ ازدواج في التسويق يشبه ما تعرفه كبرى العلامات الكوبية تحت الحظر. وتظل النسخة الهندوراسية هي المرجع: أشدّ ترابية وأكثر تعقيداً، وتحمل بصمة Jamastran التي تميّز هندوراس عن سائر أراضي أمريكا الوسطى. أما الصناعة، الموروثة عن معايير Kelner، فتبقى مثالية في انتظامها.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Excalibur No. I\", \"color\": \"#5C3317\", \"story\": \"The Churchill (49×178mm) that established the brand\'s reputation. Notes of wet earth, white pepper, caramel, and cedar over 90 minutes. The complete demonstration of the Jamastran terroir in a format that reveals all its phases.\"}, {\"name\": \"Excalibur Robusto\", \"color\": \"#7A4520\", \"story\": \"The most popular format (50×124mm) — 45 minutes, immediate earthy and spiced profile. Regular Cigar Aficionado Top 25 appearances. The accessible Honduran reference for enthusiasts seeking body without extremism.\"}, {\"name\": \"Excalibur Dark Knight Maduro\", \"color\": \"#2C1A0E\", \"story\": \"Mexican San Andrés wrapper — dark chocolate, espresso, deep spice notes. Honduras\'s answer to the Maduro trend: less sweet than Cuban Maduros, more earthy, more direct.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Excalibur No. I\",\"color\":\"#5C3317\",\"story\":\"El Churchill (49×178 mm) que asentó la fama de la marca. Notas de tierra húmeda, pimienta blanca, caramelo y cedro a lo largo de 90 minutos. La demostración completa del terruño Jamastran en un formato que revela todas sus fases.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur Robusto\",\"color\":\"#7A4520\",\"story\":\"El formato más popular (50×124 mm): 45 minutos, perfil terroso y especiado desde la primera calada. Habitual en el Top 25 de Cigar Aficionado. El referente hondureño asequible para quienes buscan cuerpo sin extremismos.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur Dark Knight Maduro\",\"color\":\"#2C1A0E\",\"story\":\"Capa San Andrés mexicana fermentada: notas de chocolate negro, espresso y especias profundas. La respuesta hondureña a la moda Maduro: menos dulce que los Maduro cubanos, más terrosa, más directa.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Excalibur No. I\",\"color\":\"#5C3317\",\"story\":\"Der Churchill (49×178 mm), der den Ruf der Marke begründete. Noten von feuchter Erde, weißem Pfeffer, Karamell und Zeder über 90 Minuten. Die vollständige Vorführung des Jamastran-Terroirs in einem Format, das alle seine Phasen offenlegt.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur Robusto\",\"color\":\"#7A4520\",\"story\":\"Das beliebteste Format (50×124 mm) — 45 Minuten, erdiges und würziges Profil von der ersten Minute an. Regelmäßig in den Top 25 von Cigar Aficionado. Die erschwingliche honduranische Referenz für Liebhaber, die Körper ohne Übertreibung suchen.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur Dark Knight Maduro\",\"color\":\"#2C1A0E\",\"story\":\"Fermentiertes mexikanisches San-Andrés-Deckblatt — Noten von Zartbitterschokolade, Espresso und tiefen Gewürzen. Die honduranische Antwort auf die Maduro-Mode: weniger süß als kubanische Maduros, erdiger, direkter.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Excalibur No. I\",\"color\":\"#5C3317\",\"story\":\"奠定品牌声誉的 Churchill（49×178mm）。90 分钟里依次呈现湿润泥土、白胡椒、焦糖与雪松。这是 Jamastran 风土的完整演示，规格之长足以让每个阶段都显露出来。\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur Robusto\",\"color\":\"#7A4520\",\"story\":\"最受欢迎的规格（50×124mm）——45 分钟，一入口便是厚土与香料。常年入选《Cigar Aficionado》前 25 名。对于想要酒体却不要极端的爱好者，这是价格可亲的洪都拉斯标杆。\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur Dark Knight Maduro\",\"color\":\"#2C1A0E\",\"story\":\"经发酵的墨西哥 San Andrés 茄衣——黑巧克力、浓缩咖啡与深沉香料。这是洪都拉斯对 Maduro 潮流的回应：不如古巴 Maduro 那般甜，更厚土，也更直接。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Excalibur No. I\",\"color\":\"#5C3317\",\"story\":\"طراز Churchill (49×178 مم) الذي أرسى سمعة العلامة. لمسات من التراب الرطب والفلفل الأبيض والكراميل والأرز على مدى تسعين دقيقة. عرض كامل لأرض Jamastran في طراز يكشف كل أطوارها.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur Robusto\",\"color\":\"#7A4520\",\"story\":\"الطراز الأكثر رواجاً (50×124 مم) — خمس وأربعون دقيقة بطابع ترابي متبّل منذ النفَس الأول. يرد بانتظام في قائمة Top 25 لمجلة Cigar Aficionado. وهو المرجع الهندوراسي الميسور لمن يريد جسماً دون تطرّف.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur Dark Knight Maduro\",\"color\":\"#2C1A0E\",\"story\":\"غلاف San Andrés المكسيكي المخمَّر — لمسات من الشوكولاتة الداكنة والإسبريسو والتوابل العميقة. وهو الردّ الهندوراسي على موضة الـ Maduro: أقلّ حلاوة من الـ Maduro الكوبي، وأكثر ترابية ومباشرة.\"}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Hendrik Kelner\", \"anecdote\": \"Kelner describes Excalibur as \'the project that taught me what Honduras was truly capable of\'. The Jamastran valley was not yet recognized as a major production region in 1983. Excalibur helped establish its international reputation.\"}, {\"name\": \"Heinrich Villiger\", \"anecdote\": \"The Swiss patriarch considered Excalibur his greatest pride in premium cigars. He smoked it daily and categorically refused requests to reformulate the blend in order to reduce costs.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Hendrik Kelner\",\"anecdote\":\"Kelner habla de Excalibur como «el proyecto que me enseñó de lo que Honduras era realmente capaz». En 1983 el valle de Jamastrán aún no estaba reconocido como gran región productora; Excalibur contribuyó a construir su reputación internacional.\"},{\"name\":\"Heinrich Villiger\",\"anecdote\":\"El patriarca suizo consideraba Excalibur su mayor orgullo en el puro premium. La fumaba a diario y rechazaba de plano cualquier petición de reformular la mezcla para abaratar costes.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Hendrik Kelner\",\"anecdote\":\"Kelner nennt Excalibur „das Projekt, das mich gelehrt hat, was Honduras wirklich kann\\\". 1983 galt das Jamastran-Tal noch nicht als große Anbauregion; Excalibur trug dazu bei, seinen internationalen Ruf zu begründen.\"},{\"name\":\"Heinrich Villiger\",\"anecdote\":\"Der schweizerische Patriarch betrachtete Excalibur als seinen größten Stolz im Premiumsegment. Er rauchte sie täglich und lehnte jede Bitte, den Blend zur Kostensenkung zu ändern, kategorisch ab.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Hendrik Kelner\",\"anecdote\":\"凯尔纳称 Excalibur 是「让我明白洪都拉斯真正能耐的项目」。1983 年，哈马斯特兰谷尚未被视为重要产区，Excalibur 为它赢得国际声誉出了一份力。\"},{\"name\":\"Heinrich Villiger\",\"anecdote\":\"这位瑞士家族掌门视 Excalibur 为自己在高端雪茄上最大的骄傲。他每日抽它，并断然拒绝任何为压低成本而改动配方的提议。\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"هندريك كلنر\",\"anecdote\":\"يصف كلنر «إكسكاليبر» بأنه «المشروع الذي علّمني ما تقدر عليه هندوراس حقًا». في 1983 لم يكن وادي خاماستران معترفًا به بعد كمنطقة إنتاج كبرى، وقد أسهم إكسكاليبر في بناء سمعته الدولية.\"},{\"name\":\"هاينريش فيليغر\",\"anecdote\":\"كان شيخ العائلة السويسرية يعدّ «إكسكاليبر» أكبر مفخرة له في السيجار الفاخر. كان يدخّنه يوميًا، ورفض قطعًا كل طلب لتغيير الخلطة بهدف خفض التكاليف.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Martinique Aged Agricole Rum 12 Years\", \"notes\": \"The definitive terroir pairing — Martinique sugarcane against Jamastran tobacco, two tropical mountain agricultures. The vegetal richness of agricole rum amplifies the earthy depth of the Excalibur.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Honduras Marcala AOC Coffee\", \"notes\": \"Marcala coffee — one of Honduras\'s rare appellations of origin — shares the same volcanic terroir as the Jamastran tobacco. The ultimate Honduran terroir pairing.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilado\",\"name\":\"Rhum agricole de Martinica de 12 años\",\"notes\":\"El maridaje de terruño perfecto: caña de Martinica frente a tabaco de Jamastrán, dos agriculturas de montaña tropical. La riqueza vegetal del rhum agricole amplifica la profundidad terrosa del Excalibur.\"},{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Café de Honduras Marcala DO\",\"notes\":\"El café de Marcala —una de las pocas denominaciones de origen hondureñas— comparte el mismo terruño volcánico que el tabaco de Jamastrán. El maridaje definitivo de terruño hondureño.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituose\",\"name\":\"Rhum agricole aus Martinique, 12 Jahre\",\"notes\":\"Die perfekte Terroir-Kombination — Zuckerrohr aus Martinique gegen Tabak aus Jamastran, zwei tropische Bergkulturen. Der vegetale Reichtum des Rhum agricole verstärkt die erdige Tiefe der Excalibur.\"},{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Kaffee aus Marcala, Honduras (Ursprungsbezeichnung)\",\"notes\":\"Der Kaffee aus Marcala — eine der wenigen honduranischen Ursprungsbezeichnungen — teilt dasselbe vulkanische Terroir wie der Jamastran-Tabak. Die ultimative honduranische Terroir-Kombination.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"马提尼克 12 年农业型朗姆\",\"notes\":\"完美的风土搭配——马提尼克的甘蔗对话哈马斯特兰的烟叶，两者同属热带山地农业。农业型朗姆的植物丰盈感放大 Excalibur 的土壤深度。\"},{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"洪都拉斯马卡拉原产地咖啡\",\"notes\":\"马卡拉咖啡是洪都拉斯少有的原产地名称之一，与哈马斯特兰烟叶共享同一片火山风土。洪都拉斯风土搭配的极致。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروب روحي\",\"name\":\"روم زراعي من المارتينيك معتّق 12 عامًا\",\"notes\":\"مزاوجة التربة المثالية — قصب المارتينيك في مواجهة تبغ خاماستران، زراعتان جبليتان استوائيتان. الغنى النباتي في الروم الزراعي يُبرز العمق الترابي في «إكسكاليبر».\"},{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة هندوراس ماركالا بتسمية المنشأ\",\"notes\":\"قهوة ماركالا — إحدى تسميات المنشأ الهندوراسية القليلة — تتشارك التربة البركانية نفسها مع تبغ خاماستران. أقصى ما تبلغه مزاوجة التربة الهندوراسية.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Excalibur';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Maya Selva is Honduran, an engineer by training, and founded her house from Paris — an unusual arrangement in a trade where one rarely sets out from Europe to produce in Central America. Flor de Selva was built from the start for the French and European market, with a profile designed for a palate used to the Havana: medium, woody, without the sweet exuberance the American market favoured at the time.\n\nThe house is based in Danlí, in the Jamastran valley, one of the two great Honduran tobacco regions. It works there in measured runs and lays claim to a rare consistency of recipe — the blends move little from one year to the next, which, for an agricultural product, demands constant work on selection.\n\nIt is also one of the very few cigar houses founded and run by a woman, in a trade almost exclusively run by men. The fact deserves noting without being made an argument: the brand established itself on its blends.', `history_es` = 'Maya Selva es hondureña, ingeniera de formación, y fundó su casa desde París — una configuración poco habitual en un oficio en el que rara vez se parte de Europa para producir en América Central. Flor de Selva se construyó desde el principio para el mercado francés y europeo, con un perfil pensado para un paladar acostumbrado al habano: medio, amaderado, sin la exuberancia dulce que el mercado estadounidense apreciaba entonces.\n\nLa casa está instalada en Danlí, en el valle del Jamastrán, una de las dos grandes regiones tabacaleras hondureñas. Allí trabaja en series medidas y reivindica una continuidad de receta poco común — las ligas se mueven poco de un año a otro, lo que, tratándose de un producto agrícola, exige un trabajo constante de selección.\n\nEs también una de las poquísimas casas de cigarros fundadas y dirigidas por una mujer, en un oficio dirigido casi exclusivamente por hombres. El hecho merece señalarse sin convertirlo en argumento: la marca se impuso por sus ligas.', `history_de` = 'Maya Selva ist Honduranerin, gelernte Ingenieurin, und gründete ihr Haus von Paris aus — eine ungewöhnliche Konstellation in einem Gewerbe, in dem man selten von Europa aus aufbricht, um in Mittelamerika zu produzieren. Flor de Selva wurde von Anfang an für den französischen und europäischen Markt aufgebaut, mit einem Profil für Gaumen, die an die Havanna gewöhnt sind: medium, holzig, ohne die süße Üppigkeit, die der amerikanische Markt damals schätzte.\n\nDas Haus sitzt in Danlí, im Tal von Jamastran, einer der beiden großen honduranischen Tabakregionen. Es arbeitet dort in überschaubaren Mengen und beansprucht eine seltene Rezepturtreue — die Blends verändern sich von Jahr zu Jahr kaum, was bei einem landwirtschaftlichen Erzeugnis beständige Arbeit an der Selektion verlangt.\n\nEs ist zudem eines der ganz wenigen Zigarrenhäuser, das von einer Frau gegründet und geführt wird, in einem fast ausschließlich von Männern geführten Gewerbe. Das verdient erwähnt zu werden, ohne daraus ein Argument zu machen: Durchgesetzt hat sich die Marke über ihre Blends.', `history_zh` = '玛雅·塞尔瓦是洪都拉斯人，工程师出身，却在巴黎创立了自己的企业——在一个鲜有人从欧洲出发、到中美洲生产的行业里，这是不寻常的安排。「丛林之花」从一开始就是为法国和欧洲市场而建，其风格面向习惯哈瓦那雪茄的味蕾：中度、木质，没有当时美国市场偏爱的甜腻张扬。\n\n这家企业位于丹利，在哈马斯特兰山谷——洪都拉斯两大烟草产区之一。它在此以有节制的批量生产，并坚持一种罕见的配方连续性：配方逐年变动极小，而对一件农产品而言，这需要在选叶上持续下功夫。\n\n它也是极少数由女性创立并领导的雪茄企业之一，而这个行业几乎完全由男性主导。这一点值得指出，但不必当作卖点：这个品牌是靠配方立住的。', `history_ar` = 'مايا سِلڤا هندوراسية، مهندسة بالتكوين، وأسّست دارها انطلاقاً من باريس — ترتيب غير مألوف في مهنة نادراً ما ينطلق فيها المرء من أوروبا لينتج في أميركا الوسطى. بُنيت «فلور دي سِلڤا» منذ البداية للسوق الفرنسية والأوروبية، بطابع صُمِّم لذائقة اعتادت الهافانا: متوسط، خشبي، بلا ذلك الفيض الحلو الذي كانت السوق الأميركية تفضّله آنذاك.\n\nتقع الدار في دانلي، بوادي خاماستران، إحدى أكبر منطقتَي التبغ في هندوراس. تعمل هناك بكميات محسوبة وتدّعي ثباتاً نادراً في الوصفة — إذ تتغيّر الخلطات قليلاً من سنة إلى أخرى، وهو ما يتطلّب، في منتج زراعي، عملاً دائماً على الانتقاء.\n\nوهي أيضاً من البيوت القليلة جداً التي أسّستها وتديرها امرأة، في مهنة يديرها الرجال حصراً تقريباً. يستحق الأمر الذكر دون أن يصير حجّة: فالعلامة فرضت نفسها بخلطاتها.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Flor de Selva Classique\",\"color\":\"#8B7D6B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Honduran Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"The heart of the house, composed for a European palate: dry wood, hay, a touch of leather, and a year-to-year consistency that is itself a piece of work.\"},{\"name\":\"Cumpay\",\"color\":\"#5D4037\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"The full-bodied side, darker and earthier, where the house shows what Jamastran can give in power.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Flor de Selva Classique\",\"color\":\"#8B7D6B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano de Honduras\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"El corazón de la casa, compuesto para un paladar europeo: madera seca, heno, una pizca de cuero, y una constancia de un año a otro que ya es en sí un trabajo.\"},{\"name\":\"Cumpay\",\"color\":\"#5D4037\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"La vertiente fuerte, más oscura y más terrosa, donde la casa muestra lo que el Jamastrán puede dar en potencia.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Flor de Selva Classique\",\"color\":\"#8B7D6B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Honduranischer Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"Das Herzstück des Hauses, für europäische Gaumen komponiert: trockenes Holz, Heu, ein Hauch Leder — und eine Beständigkeit von Jahr zu Jahr, die für sich genommen bereits eine Leistung ist.\"},{\"name\":\"Cumpay\",\"color\":\"#5D4037\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Die kräftige Seite, dunkler und erdiger, in der das Haus zeigt, was Jamastran an Kraft hergibt.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Flor de Selva Classique\",\"color\":\"#8B7D6B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"洪都拉斯哈瓦那种\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"这家的核心，为欧洲味蕾而作：干木、干草，一点皮革，以及逐年不变的稳定——这本身就是一门功夫。\"},{\"name\":\"Cumpay\",\"color\":\"#5D4037\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"浓郁的一面，更深、更带土味，让这家展示哈马斯特兰在力度上能给出什么。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Flor de Selva Classique\",\"color\":\"#8B7D6B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"هابانو هندوراسي\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"قلب الدار، مؤلَّف لذائقة أوروبية: خشب جافّ وقشّ ولمسة جلد، وثبات من سنة إلى أخرى هو في ذاته صنعة.\"},{\"name\":\"Cumpay\",\"color\":\"#5D4037\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"الوجه القويّ، أدكن وأكثر ترابية، حيث تُظهر الدار ما يمكن لخاماستران أن يمنحه من قوّة.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"Armagnac\",\"notes\":\"The rancio of armagnac suits dry wood better than a fruitier cognac.\"},{\"type\":\"Coffee\",\"name\":\"Honduran coffee\",\"notes\":\"A pairing of country: Honduras is as much a coffee land as a tobacco one.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Armañac\",\"notes\":\"El rancio del armañac casa con la madera seca mejor que un coñac más afrutado.\"},{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Café hondureño\",\"notes\":\"Un acuerdo de país: Honduras es tanto tierra de café como de tabaco.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Armagnac\",\"notes\":\"Der Rancio des Armagnac passt besser zu trockenem Holz als ein fruchtigerer Cognac.\"},{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Honduranischer Kaffee\",\"notes\":\"Eine Verbindung des Landes: Honduras ist ebenso Kaffee- wie Tabakland.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"雅文邑\",\"notes\":\"雅文邑的陈化气息比果味更重的干邑更配干木。\"},{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"洪都拉斯咖啡\",\"notes\":\"同一个国度的呼应：洪都拉斯既是烟草之地，也是咖啡之地。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"أرمانياك\",\"notes\":\"نفحة «الرانسيو» في الأرمانياك تناسب الخشب الجافّ أكثر من كونياك أوفر فاكهية.\"},{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة هندوراسية\",\"notes\":\"تناغم بلد واحد: هندوراس أرض قهوة بقدر ما هي أرض تبغ.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Flor de Selva';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Nicholas Melillo spent some ten years choosing tobacco for one of the great houses of Estelí before founding his own. That background explains Foundation\'s positioning: the brand does not present itself as a collector\'s adventure but as the work of a man who has known the fields, the harvests and the fermentations from the inside.\n\nEl Güegüense, his founding blend, takes its name from a popular Nicaraguan play, a colonial satire passed down orally for centuries and inscribed as intangible heritage of humanity. The choice says something about the ambition of the house: to root a cigar in a culture, not merely in a terroir.\n\nCharter Oak, the other line, starts from the opposite end — the Connecticut valley, where Melillo grew up and where the most widely used wrapper in the trade is grown. A Nicaraguan house laying claim to a northern root: that is rare, and it is deliberate.', `history_es` = 'Nicholas Melillo pasó una decena de años eligiendo el tabaco de una de las grandes casas de Estelí antes de fundar la suya. Ese recorrido explica el posicionamiento de Foundation: la marca no se presenta como una aventura de coleccionista, sino como el trabajo de un hombre que conoce los campos, las cosechas y las fermentaciones desde dentro.\n\nEl Güegüense, su liga fundacional, lleva el nombre de una obra de teatro popular nicaragüense, sátira colonial transmitida oralmente durante siglos e inscrita en el patrimonio inmaterial de la humanidad. La elección dice algo de la ambición de la casa: anclar un cigarro en una cultura, no solo en un terruño.\n\nCharter Oak, la otra gama, parte del otro extremo — el valle del Connecticut, donde Melillo creció y donde se cultiva la capa estadounidense más utilizada del oficio. Una casa nicaragüense que reivindica una raíz del norte: es raro, y es asumido.', `history_de` = 'Nicholas Melillo wählte rund zehn Jahre lang den Tabak für eines der großen Häuser von Estelí aus, ehe er sein eigenes gründete. Dieser Werdegang erklärt die Positionierung von Foundation: Die Marke gibt sich nicht als Sammlerabenteuer, sondern als Arbeit eines Mannes, der Felder, Ernten und Fermentationen von innen kennt.\n\nEl Güegüense, sein Gründungsblend, trägt den Namen eines nicaraguanischen Volksstücks — einer kolonialen Satire, die über Jahrhunderte mündlich weitergegeben und ins immaterielle Kulturerbe der Menschheit aufgenommen wurde. Die Wahl sagt etwas über den Anspruch des Hauses: eine Zigarre in einer Kultur zu verwurzeln, nicht bloß in einem Terroir.\n\nCharter Oak, die andere Linie, setzt am entgegengesetzten Ende an — im Connecticut Valley, wo Melillo aufwuchs und wo das meistverwendete Deckblatt des Gewerbes wächst. Ein nicaraguanisches Haus, das eine nördliche Wurzel für sich beansprucht: Das ist selten, und es ist gewollt.', `history_zh` = '尼古拉斯·梅利洛在创立自己的企业之前，曾用约十年时间为埃斯特利的一家大厂挑选烟叶。这段经历解释了「基石」的定位：这个品牌并不以收藏家的冒险自居，而是一个从内部熟悉田地、采收与发酵的人的作品。\n\n其奠基配方「厄尔·圭圭恩塞」得名于一部尼加拉瓜民间戏剧——一出口口相传数百年的殖民时期讽刺剧，已列入人类非物质文化遗产。这一选择透露了这家的抱负：让一支雪茄扎根于一种文化，而不只是一方风土。\n\n另一系列「特许橡树」则从另一端出发——康涅狄格河谷，梅利洛在那里长大，那里也出产业内使用最广的茄衣。一家尼加拉瓜企业主张自己有一条北方的根：这很少见，而且是自觉的。', `history_ar` = 'أمضى نيكولاس ميليّو نحو عشر سنوات في انتقاء التبغ لأحد بيوت إستيلي الكبرى قبل أن يؤسّس بيته. وهذا المسار يفسّر موقع «فاونديشن»: فالعلامة لا تقدّم نفسها كمغامرة هاوٍ جامع، بل كعمل رجل عرف الحقول والمواسم والتخمير من الداخل.\n\nأمّا «إل غويغوينسي»، خلطته التأسيسية، فتحمل اسم مسرحية شعبية نيكاراغوية، هجائية من زمن الاستعمار تناقلتها الأفواه قروناً وأُدرجت في التراث الثقافي غير المادي للإنسانية. والاختيار يقول شيئاً عن طموح الدار: أن تُجذِّر سيجاراً في ثقافة، لا في تربة فحسب.\n\nوتنطلق «تشارتر أوك»، السلسلة الأخرى، من الطرف المقابل — وادي كونيتيكت، حيث نشأ ميليّو وحيث ينمو أكثر أغلفة المهنة استعمالاً. دار نيكاراغوية تدّعي جذراً شمالياً: أمر نادر، ومقصود.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"El Güegüense\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Jalapa Corojo 99\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"The founding blend, named after a colonial satire passed down orally for centuries. Wood, leather, a hint of brown sugar, and a clear evolution between the first and the last third.\"},{\"name\":\"Charter Oak\",\"color\":\"#3B2F2F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"The northern root of the house: Connecticut wrapper over Nicaraguan filler. Dark, earthy, without bitterness — and deliberately kept in an affordable price range.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"El Güegüense\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Corojo 99 de Jalapa\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"La liga fundacional, con el nombre de una sátira colonial transmitida oralmente durante siglos. Madera, cuero, una pizca de azúcar moreno, y una evolución neta entre el primer y el último tercio.\"},{\"name\":\"Charter Oak\",\"color\":\"#3B2F2F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"La raíz norte de la casa: capa del Connecticut sobre tripa nicaragüense. Oscuro, terroso, sin amargor — y situado a propósito en una gama de precios accesible.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"El Güegüense\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Corojo 99 aus Jalapa\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Der Gründungsblend, benannt nach einer kolonialen Satire, die über Jahrhunderte mündlich überliefert wurde. Holz, Leder, ein Anflug von braunem Zucker und eine klare Entwicklung zwischen erstem und letztem Drittel.\"},{\"name\":\"Charter Oak\",\"color\":\"#3B2F2F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"Die nördliche Wurzel des Hauses: Connecticut-Deckblatt über nicaraguanischer Einlage. Dunkel, erdig, ohne Bitterkeit — und bewusst in einer erschwinglichen Preislage gehalten.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"El Güegüense\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"哈拉帕可乐多99\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"奠基配方，得名于一出口传数百年的殖民时期讽刺剧。木质、皮革，一丝红糖，从第一段到最后一段有清晰的推进。\"},{\"name\":\"Charter Oak\",\"color\":\"#3B2F2F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"这家的北方之根：康涅狄格茄衣配尼加拉瓜茄芯。深色、带土味、不苦——并有意保持在可及的价位。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"El Güegüense\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"كوروخو 99 من خالابا\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"الخلطة التأسيسية، المسمّاة على هجائية استعمارية تناقلتها الأفواه قروناً. خشب وجلد ولمسة سكر بنّي، مع تطوّر واضح بين الثلث الأول والأخير.\"},{\"name\":\"Charter Oak\",\"color\":\"#3B2F2F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"الجذر الشمالي للدار: غلاف كونيتيكت على حشوة نيكاراغوية. داكن، ترابي، بلا مرارة — وموضوع عمداً في نطاق سعري في المتناول.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"Aged Central American rum\",\"notes\":\"The brown sugar of the blend finds a direct extension there.\"},{\"type\":\"Other\",\"name\":\"Dry farmhouse cider\",\"notes\":\"On Charter Oak, the acidity of the cider lightens the earthiness of the broadleaf wrapper.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Ron añejo de América Central\",\"notes\":\"El azúcar moreno de la liga encuentra ahí una prolongación directa.\"},{\"type\":\"Otro\",\"name\":\"Sidra seca de granja\",\"notes\":\"Sobre el Charter Oak, la acidez de la sidra aligera lo terroso de la capa broadleaf.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Alter mittelamerikanischer Rum\",\"notes\":\"Der braune Zucker des Blends findet darin eine direkte Fortsetzung.\"},{\"type\":\"Sonstiges\",\"name\":\"Trockener Bauernmost\",\"notes\":\"Beim Charter Oak nimmt die Säure des Ciders der Erdigkeit des Broadleaf-Deckblatts die Schwere.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"中美洲陈年朗姆\",\"notes\":\"配方中的红糖在这里得到直接的延续。\"},{\"type\":\"其他\",\"name\":\"干型农家苹果酒\",\"notes\":\"配特许橡树时，苹果酒的酸度减轻宽叶茄衣的土感。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"روم معتَّق من أميركا الوسطى\",\"notes\":\"يجد السكر البنّي في الخلطة امتداداً مباشراً هنا.\"},{\"type\":\"أخرى\",\"name\":\"سيدر ريفي جافّ\",\"notes\":\"مع «تشارتر أوك»، تخفّف حموضة السيدر ترابية غلاف البرودليف.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Foundation Cigar Company';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The General Cigar story begins in Tampa in 1906, in the cigar factories of Ybor City — the Cuban exile neighborhood that had made Tampa the American cigar capital in the 1880s. The original General Cigar Company was a consolidation vehicle from its first years, acquiring smaller Tampa manufacturers whose individual operations were increasingly uncompetitive against the larger houses. The pattern of growth through acquisition was established at the founding and has defined the company ever since.\r\n\r\nThe mid-century transformation moved General Cigar from Tampa manufacturer to national distributor and brand manager. The acquisition of Macanudo in the 1970s provided the brand that would drive the company through the cigar boom of the 1990s — a brand positioned for accessibility and consistency that became, by the early 1980s, the best-selling premium cigar in the United States. Macanudo\'s commercial success funded the acquisitions that followed.\r\n\r\nThe CAO acquisition in 2007 added the premium innovative brand that General Cigar\'s portfolio required. Where Macanudo sold reliability, CAO sold discovery — new formats, unexpected blends, releases that enthusiasts anticipated rather than took for granted. The two brands operate in the same general price tier but target different psychological needs, allowing General Cigar to capture a broader segment of the premium market than either brand could reach alone.\r\n\r\nThe company\'s portfolio now includes cigars under over twenty brand names, produced across manufacturing facilities in the Dominican Republic, Honduras, Jamaica, and Nicaragua. The management challenge — maintaining the distinctive identity and quality standard of each brand while pooling sourcing, logistics, and distribution resources — is the central operational problem of managing a multi-brand cigar company, and General Cigar\'s performance across decades suggests it has developed approaches to this problem that smaller competitors have not.\r\n\r\nThe Scandinavian Tobacco Group, which acquired General Cigar in 2016, added European distribution and manufacturing capabilities that have extended the company\'s reach into markets where American cigar brands had previously operated at a disadvantage.', `history_es` = 'General Cigar es el mayor éxito industrial de la historia del cigarro americano. Fundada en 1906 en Tampa — entonces capital mundial del cigarro — construida a través de adquisiciones sucesivas hasta convertirse en el mayor grupo cigarrero de EE.UU. Su catálogo incluye Macanudo, CAO, Punch, Partagás USA, y docenas más.', `history_de` = 'General Cigar ist der größte industrielle Erfolg der amerikanischen Zigarrengeschichte. 1906 in Tampa gegründet — damals die Welthauptstadt der Zigarre — durch sukzessive Übernahmen zur größten amerikanischen Zigarrengruppe gewachsen. Ihr Katalog umfasst Macanudo, CAO, Punch, Partagás USA und Dutzende mehr.', `history_zh` = '通用雪茄是美国雪茄史上最伟大的工业成就。1906年在坦帕创立——当时的世界雪茄之都——通过连续收购成长为美国最大雪茄集团。其产品目录包括Macanudo、CAO、Punch、美国帕特加斯等数十个品牌。', `history_ar` = 'جنرال سيغار هي أعظم نجاح صناعي في تاريخ السيجار الأمريكي. تأسست عام 1906 في تامبا — عاصمة السيجار العالمية آنذاك — ونمت عبر عمليات استحواذ متتالية لتصبح أكبر مجموعة سيجار أمريكية. كتالوجها يضم ماكانودو وكاو وبنش وعشرات سواها.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper, soft and creamy, over Dominican-Jamaican blend. Notes of cream, light cedar, hazelnut. The cigar of sunny terraces and unhurried afternoons. Consistent, accessible, never disappointing.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"CAO Flathead\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Series inspired by Harley-Davidson V-twin engines. Format names: V660 Carb, V554 Piston, V770 Engine. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. Full body, notes of motorcycle leather, black coffee, chocolate, engine oil (really). A cigar of the open road, freedom, deep America.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"V660 Carb\", \"V554 Piston\", \"V770 Engine\", \"V507 Spark\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch Upper Cut\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"The premium General Cigar range under the Punch label. Honduran maduro wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. Notes of dark chocolate, smoky wood, pepper. The dark side of Punch — powerful where the classic range is accessible.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper, soft and creamy, over Dominican-Jamaican blend. Notas de cream, light cedro, avellana. The cigar of sunny terraces and unhurried afternoons. Consistent, accessible, never disappointing.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"CAO Flathead\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Series inspired by Harley-Davidson V-twin engines. Format names: V660 Carb, V554 Piston, V770 Engine. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. Full body, notas de motorcycle cuero, black café, chocolate, engine oil (really). A cigar of the open road, freedom, deep America.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"V660 Carb\", \"V554 Piston\", \"V770 Engine\", \"V507 Spark\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch Upper Cut\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"The premium General Cigar range under the Punch label. Honduran maduro wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. Notas de chocolate negro, smoky wood, pimienta. The dark side of Punch — powerful where the classic range is accessible.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper, soft and creamy, over Dominican-Jamaican blend. Noten von cream, light Zeder, Haselnuss. The cigar of sunny terraces and unhurried afternoons. Consistent, accessible, never disappointing.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"CAO Flathead\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Series inspired by Harley-Davidson V-twin engines. Format names: V660 Carb, V554 Piston, V770 Engine. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. Full body, Noten von motorcycle Leder, black Kaffee, Schokolade, engine oil (really). A cigar of the open road, freedom, deep America.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"V660 Carb\", \"V554 Piston\", \"V770 Engine\", \"V507 Spark\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch Upper Cut\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"The premium General Cigar range under the Punch label. Honduran maduro wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. Noten von dunkle Schokolade, smoky wood, Pfeffer. The dark side of Punch — powerful where the classic range is accessible.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper, soft and creamy, over Dominican-Jamaican blend. 风味： cream, light 雪松木, 榛子. The cigar of sunny terraces and unhurried afternoons. Consistent, accessible, never disappointing.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"CAO Flathead\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Series inspired by Harley-Davidson V-twin engines. Format names: V660 Carb, V554 Piston, V770 Engine. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. Full body, 风味包括： motorcycle 皮革, black 咖啡, 巧克力, engine oil (really). A cigar of the open road, freedom, deep America.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"V660 Carb\", \"V554 Piston\", \"V770 Engine\", \"V507 Spark\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch Upper Cut\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"The premium General Cigar range under the Punch label. Honduran maduro wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. 风味： 黑巧克力, smoky wood, 胡椒. The dark side of Punch — powerful where the classic range is accessible.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper, soft and creamy, over Dominican-Jamaican blend. نكهات:  cream, light أرز, بندق. The cigar of sunny terraces and unhurried afternoons. Consistent, accessible, never disappointing.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"CAO Flathead\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Series inspired by Harley-Davidson V-twin engines. Format names: V660 Carb, V554 Piston, V770 Engine. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. Full body, نكهات:  motorcycle جلد, black قهوة, شوكولاتة, engine oil (really). A cigar of the open road, freedom, deep America.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"V660 Carb\", \"V554 Piston\", \"V770 Engine\", \"V507 Spark\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch Upper Cut\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"The premium General Cigar range under the Punch label. Honduran maduro wrapper over Nicaraguan-Honduran. نكهات:  شوكولاتة داكنة, smoky wood, فلفل. The dark side of Punch — powerful where the classic range is accessible.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Ybor City Community\", \"anecdote\": \"Tampa\'s Ybor City was the world\'s cigar capital in the 1920s. General Cigar employed up to 10,000 torcedores there. Readers would read Tolstoy, Marx, and Flaubert aloud during rolling hours — a living library in the smoke.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Ybor City Community\", \"anecdote\": \"Tampa\'s Ybor City was the world\'s cigar capital in the 1920s. General Cigar employed up to 10,000 torcedores there. Readers would read Tolstoy, Marx, and Flaubert aloud during rolling hours — a living library in the smoke.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Ybor City Community\", \"anecdote\": \"Tampa\'s Ybor City was the world\'s cigar capital in the 1920s. General Cigar employed up to 10,000 torcedores there. Readers would read Tolstoy, Marx, and Flaubert aloud during rolling hours — a living library in the smoke.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Ybor City Community\", \"anecdote\": \"Tampa\'s Ybor City was the world\'s cigar capital in the 1920s. General Cigar employed up to 10,000 torcedores there. Readers would read Tolstoy, Marx, and Flaubert aloud during rolling hours — a living library in the smoke.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Ybor City Community\", \"anecdote\": \"Tampa\'s Ybor City was the world\'s cigar capital in the 1920s. General Cigar employed up to 10,000 torcedores there. Readers would read Tolstoy, Marx, and Flaubert aloud during rolling hours — a living library in the smoke.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Wild Turkey 101\", \"notes\": \"The bold American bourbon pairs perfectly with the CAO Flathead\'s power. A deep America pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Beer\", \"name\": \"Samuel Adams Boston Lager\", \"notes\": \"The artisan American lager, malty and balanced, is the everyday companion of a Macanudo Café.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Wild Turkey 101\", \"notes\": \"The bold American bourbon pairs perfectly with the CAO Flathead\'s power. A deep America pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Cerveza\", \"name\": \"Samuel Adams Boston Lager\", \"notes\": \"The artisan American lager, malty and balanced, is the everyday companion of a Macanudo Café.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Wild Turkey 101\", \"notes\": \"The bold American bourbon pairs perfectly with the CAO Flathead\'s power. A deep America pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bier\", \"name\": \"Samuel Adams Boston Lager\", \"notes\": \"The artisan American lager, malty and balanced, is the everyday companion of a Macanudo Café.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"波旁威士忌\", \"name\": \"Wild Turkey 101\", \"notes\": \"The bold American bourbon pairs perfectly with the CAO Flathead\'s power. A deep America pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"啤酒\", \"name\": \"Samuel Adams Boston Lager\", \"notes\": \"The artisan American lager, malty and balanced, is the everyday companion of a Macanudo Café.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"البوربون\", \"name\": \"Wild Turkey 101\", \"notes\": \"The bold American bourbon pairs perfectly with the CAO Flathead\'s power. A deep America pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"البيرة\", \"name\": \"Samuel Adams Boston Lager\", \"notes\": \"The artisan American lager, malty and balanced, is the everyday companion of a Macanudo Café.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'General Cigar';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Hermann Dietrich Upmann arrived in Havana in 1844 as a representative of a Hamburg banking house. He was not a tobacco man by formation. He came to manage financial transactions for European clients who had interests in the sugar and tobacco trades. But Cuba in the 1840s — a colony at the peak of its commercial vitality, its plantations producing tobacco that European markets could not get enough of — changed his trajectory entirely. Within a year of his arrival, Upmann had opened a cigar factory alongside his counting house. The combination seemed eccentric. It was, in retrospect, a stroke of commercial genius.\r\n\r\nUpmann\'s banker\'s mind transformed how Cuban cigars were sold to Europe. He was the first manufacturer to ship his cigars in hermetically sealed aluminum tubes, preventing the humidity loss that destroyed quality during Atlantic crossings. He invented the practice of packing cigars in flat cedar boxes sealed with wax, which regulated humidity while simultaneously signaling exclusivity. He designed packaging that communicated, at every level, that what was inside was worth protecting. The luxury cigar presentation that the entire industry still uses 180 years later is largely his invention.\r\n\r\nThe factory flourished through the late nineteenth century, winning gold medals at international exhibitions and building a clientele that extended from Queen Victoria\'s court to the counting houses of Hamburg, Amsterdam, and New York. The Upmann family maintained personal control until 1922, when the banking operations collapsed under post-war financial pressure. J. Frankau & Co. of London acquired the brand and maintained its quality through the 1920s and 1930s. Menéndez y García — the same partnership that would later create Montecristo — took over in 1935 and immediately raised production standards.\r\n\r\nThe Cuban revolution of 1959 nationalized the factory without interrupting production. The workforce remained largely intact. The tobacco sourcing continued through the same Vuelta Abajo suppliers. What changed was the institutional knowledge concentrated in the Menéndez family, which departed for the Dominican Republic — where a second H. Upmann was eventually created under Altadis.\r\n\r\nThe Havana house today produces some of the most underrated cigars in the Cuban portfolio. The Magnum 46, a Toro measuring 46 x 155mm, delivers a mid-strength profile of extraordinary refinement — hazelnut, white cedar, light pepper, and a honey finish that lingers well past the last draw. The Sir Winston, named in tribute to Bolívar\'s greatest rival for Churchill\'s affection, is a massive Double Corona offering 90 minutes of stately complexity. The Connoisseur series, available by regional allocation, demonstrates that the factory can produce full-body cigars when it chooses — it simply prefers the more demanding art of elegance.', `history_es` = 'Hermann Dietrich Upmann, banquero hamburgués, fundó en 1844 en La Habana tanto una sucursal bancaria como una fábrica de cigarros. Introdujo el packaging de lujo — tubos de aluminio, cajas de cedro, lacre. Tras la quiebra bancaria de 1922, la marca fue renaciendo. La Magnum 46 y el Sir Winston son sus pilares modernos.', `history_de` = 'Hermann Dietrich Upmann, ein Hamburger Bankier, gründete 1844 in Havanna sowohl eine Bankfiliale als auch eine Zigarrenfabrik. Er erfand das Luxus-Packaging — Aluminiumtuben, Zedernholzboxen, Siegelwachs. Nach dem Bankrott 1922 wurde die Marke wiederbelebt. Magnum 46 und Sir Winston sind seine modernen Säulen.', `history_zh` = '汉堡银行家赫尔曼·迪特里希·厄普曼于1844年在哈瓦那创立了银行分行和雪茄工厂。他发明了奢华包装——铝管、雪松木盒、封蜡。1922年银行破产后，品牌历经复兴。Magnum 46和Sir Winston是其现代支柱。', `history_ar` = 'الحامبورغي هيرمان ديتريش أوبمان أسّس عام 1844 في هافانا فرعًا مصرفيًا ومصنع سيجار. ابتكر التغليف الفاخر — أنابيب الألومنيوم وصناديق الأرز والشمع. بعد إفلاس البنك عام 1922، أُعيد إحياء العلامة. ماغنوم 46 وسير ونستون ركيزتاها الحديثتان.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Sir Winston\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (47 x 178mm), named in 1954 for Churchill\'s 80th birthday — who smoked H. Upmann before switching to Romeo y Julieta. The Sir Winston is one of the few giant formats still regularly produced. 90 minutes of creamy, nutty, sandalwood complexity. Smoked correctly, it never disappoints. Cigar Aficionado score 95.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Sir Winston\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Magnum 46\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Robusto Extra (46 x 143mm). The modern house flagship vitola. Remarkable balance between complexity and accessibility. Notes of toasted hazelnut, soft leather, light vanilla. The Magnum 46 is often the first H. Upmann one tries — and it convinces immediately.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Magnum 46\"]}, {\"name\": \"Connoisseur No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Lonsdale (42 x 168mm). Long and elegant format, the house\'s signature. The length allows slow aromatic evolution — the first puffs are soft and creamy, the finish reveals unexpected spices. Appreciated by smokers who take their time.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Connoisseur No.1\", \"Connoisseur No.2\"]}, {\"name\": \"Half Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Mini format (44 x 94mm), 15 minutes. H. Upmann has always known how to adapt its character to small format without betraying it. The Half Corona is the coffee break cigar — intense, direct, honest. Ideal for discovering the house without committing an hour.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Half Corona\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Sir Winston\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (47 x 178mm), named in 1954 for Churchill\'s 80th birthday — who smoked H. Upmann before switching to Romeo y Julieta. The Sir Winston is one of the few giant formats still regularly produced. 90 minutos of creamy, nutty, sandalwood complexity. Smoked correctly, it never disappoints. Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 95.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Sir Winston\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Magnum 46\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Robusto Extra (46 x 143mm). The modern house flagship vitola. Remarkable balance between complexity and accessibility. Notas de tostado avellana, soft cuero, light vainilla. The Magnum 46 is often the first H. Upmann one tries — and it convinces immediately.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Magnum 46\"]}, {\"name\": \"Connoisseur No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Lonsdale (42 x 168mm). Long and elegant format, la signature. The length allows slow aromatic evolution — the first puffs are soft and creamy, the finish revela unexpected especias. Appreciated by smokers who take their time.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Connoisseur No.1\", \"Connoisseur No.2\"]}, {\"name\": \"Half Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Mini format (44 x 94mm), 15 minutes. H. Upmann has always known how to adapt its character to small format without betraying it. The Half Corona is the café break cigar — intense, direct, honest. Ideal for discovering the house without committing an hour.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Half Corona\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Sir Winston\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (47 x 178mm), named in 1954 for Churchill\'s 80th birthday — who smoked H. Upmann before switching to Romeo y Julieta. The Sir Winston is one of the few giant formats still regularly produced. 90 Minuten of creamy, nutty, sandalwood complexity. Smoked correctly, it never disappoints. Cigar Aficionado Score 95.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Sir Winston\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Magnum 46\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Robusto Extra (46 x 143mm). The modern house flagship vitola. Remarkable balance between complexity and accessibility. Noten von geröstet Haselnuss, soft Leder, light Vanille. The Magnum 46 is often the first H. Upmann one tries — and it convinces immediately.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Magnum 46\"]}, {\"name\": \"Connoisseur No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Lonsdale (42 x 168mm). Long and elegant format, the house\'s signature. The length allows slow aromatic evolution — the first puffs are soft and creamy, the finish reveals unexpected Gewürze. Appreciated by smokers who take their time.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Connoisseur No.1\", \"Connoisseur No.2\"]}, {\"name\": \"Half Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Mini format (44 x 94mm), 15 minutes. H. Upmann has always known how to adapt its character to small format without betraying it. The Half Corona is the Kaffee break cigar — intense, direct, honest. Ideal for discovering the house without committing an hour.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Half Corona\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Sir Winston\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (47 x 178mm), named in 1954 for Churchill\'s 80th birthday — who smoked H. Upmann before switching to Romeo y Julieta. The Sir Winston is one of the few giant formats still regularly produced. 90分钟 of creamy, nutty, sandalwood complexity. Smoked correctly, it never disappoints. 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 95.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Sir Winston\"], \"scores\": [{\"sourc