between complexity and accessibility. نكهات:  محمَّص بندق, soft جلد, light فانيليا. The Magnum 46 is often the first H. Upmann one tries — and it convinces immediately.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Magnum 46\"]}, {\"name\": \"Connoisseur No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Lonsdale (42 x 168mm). Long and elegant format, the house\'s signature. The length allows slow aromatic evolution — the first puffs are soft and creamy, the finish يكشف عن unexpected توابل. Appreciated by smokers who take their time.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Connoisseur No.1\", \"Connoisseur No.2\"]}, {\"name\": \"Half Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Mini format (44 x 94mm), 15 دقيقة. H. Upmann has always known how to adapt its character to small format without betraying it. The Half Corona is the قهوة break cigar — intense, direct, honest. Ideal for discovering the house without committing an hour.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Half Corona\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit notes of Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Vino\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit notas de Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Wein\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit Noten von Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"葡萄酒\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit 风味： Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"النبيذ\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit نكهات: Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'H. Upmann';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Henri Wintermans arrived in the cigar trade in 1904 with a manufacturer\'s instinct and a commercial ambition that fit the Dutch trading tradition precisely. Based in Eersel in the southern Netherlands — a region where cigar manufacturing had existed since the early nineteenth century, supplied by Dutch colonial networks that controlled significant portions of Sumatran and Javanese tobacco production — Wintermans built a factory that from its first years differentiated itself through the quality of its Indonesian leaf sourcing.\r\n\r\nThe Dutch connection to Indonesian tobacco was the structural advantage that defined the Wintermans business model for its first half-century. The Netherlands had governed the Dutch East Indies since the seventeenth century, and by the twentieth century the trading houses of Amsterdam had developed sophisticated mechanisms for selecting and aging Javanese and Sumatran tobacco that no other European market could match. Wintermans used this network to source wrapper and binder leaf of consistent quality for his small-format cigars and cigarillos — products aimed at the everyday European smoker rather than the luxury collector.\r\n\r\nThe Café Crème, introduced in 1958, became the house\'s defining product and one of the most recognized cigar formats in European history. A small, machine-made cigarillo with a mild coffee-tinged aroma derived partly from the Indonesian wrapper and partly from a light casing applied during production, it occupied a space in the market that no other product filled: accessible, consistent, affordable, and unmistakably a cigar experience rather than a cigarette compromise. By the 1970s, it was present in every café, bar, and restaurant across Western Europe. Its yellow packaging became a visual shorthand for after-dinner relaxation.\r\n\r\nBritish American Tobacco acquired the Wintermans business in the early 1970s as part of its systematic consolidation of the European cigar market. The Café Crème continued under the new ownership without significant reformulation — BAT understood that the product\'s appeal was built on consistency and that changing it would damage precisely what made it commercially valuable. Henri Wintermans cigars and cigarillos continue in production today, still using Indonesian-origin leaf, still sold under the name of a man who understood before most that accessible quality was its own kind of ambition.', `history_es` = 'Henri Wintermans fundó en 1904 en los Países Bajos su fábrica de cigarros. La casa se convirtió en una de las más importantes de Europa comercializando cigarros accesibles con tabacos de Java y Sumatra. El Café Crème (1958) es su creación más icónica. Hoy propiedad de British American Tobacco.', `history_de` = 'Henri Wintermans gründete 1904 in den Niederlanden seine Zigarrenfabrik. Das Haus wurde zu einem der wichtigsten Europas durch den Vertrieb zugänglicher Zigarren mit Java- und Sumatra-Tabaken. Das Café Crème (1958) ist seine ikonischste Kreation. Heute im Besitz von British American Tobacco.', `history_zh` = '亨利·温特曼斯于1904年在荷兰创立了雪茄工厂。该品牌通过销售使用爪哇和苏门答腊烟草的平价雪茄，成为欧洲最重要的品牌之一。咖啡奶油（1958年）是其最具标志性的创作。现为英美烟草公司所有。', `history_ar` = 'أسّس هنري وينترمانس عام 1904 في هولندا مصنع سيجاره. أصبحت الدار من أهم الأوروبية عبر تسويق سيجار ميسور الثمن بتبغ جاوة وسومطرة. الكافيه كريم (1958) أشهر إبداعاتها. تعود اليوم لمجموعة بريتيش أمريكان توباكو.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Henri Wintermans Café Crème\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"The historic product — coffee aroma over Java-Sumatra tobacco. 10 minutes, mini format. Notes of flavoured coffee and mild tobacco. Western Europe\'s universal introduction to the cigar since 1958. Millions of Europeans smoked their first cigar in this format.\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Indonesian Java-Sumatra\",\"vitolas\":[\"Café Crème\",\"Half Corona\",\"Corona De Luxe\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Henri Wintermans Café Crème\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"El producto histórico: aroma de café sobre tabaco de Java y Sumatra. 10 minutos, formato mini. Notas de café aromatizado y tabaco suave. La puerta de entrada universal al puro en Europa occidental desde 1958. Millones de europeos fumaron su primer puro en este formato.\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Indonesian Java-Sumatra\",\"vitolas\":[\"Café Crème\",\"Half Corona\",\"Corona De Luxe\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Henri Wintermans Café Crème\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Das historische Erzeugnis — Kaffeearoma auf Java-Sumatra-Tabak. 10 Minuten, Miniformat. Noten von aromatisiertem Kaffee und mildem Tabak. Seit 1958 der allgemeine Einstieg in die Zigarre in Westeuropa. Millionen Europäer rauchten ihre erste Zigarre in diesem Format.\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Indonesian Java-Sumatra\",\"vitolas\":[\"Café Crème\",\"Half Corona\",\"Corona De Luxe\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Henri Wintermans Café Crème\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"品牌的历史产品——咖啡香气，配爪哇与苏门答腊烟叶。10 分钟，迷你规格。调味咖啡与柔和烟草的气息。自 1958 年起，它就是西欧人认识雪茄的普遍入口。数百万欧洲人的第一支雪茄，正是这个规格。\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Indonesian Java-Sumatra\",\"vitolas\":[\"Café Crème\",\"Half Corona\",\"Corona De Luxe\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Henri Wintermans Café Crème\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"المنتج التاريخي — رائحة قهوة على تبغ جاوي سومطري. عشر دقائق بطراز صغير. لمسات من القهوة المنكَّهة والتبغ اللطيف. وهو المدخل العام إلى السيجار في أوروبا الغربية منذ 1958. وقد دخّن ملايين الأوروبيين أول سيجار لهم بهذا الطراز.\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Indonesian Java-Sumatra\",\"vitolas\":[\"Café Crème\",\"Half Corona\",\"Corona De Luxe\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'Henri Wintermans';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey takes its name from a genuine \"hoyo\" — a natural hollow in the hills of Vuelta Abajo, near San Juan y Martínez — long reputed to produce the softest and most aromatic tobacco in all of Cuba. José Gener, a Spanish manufacturer established in Havana, founded the brand in 1865 specifically to exploit this exceptional terroir.\r\n\r\nThe geographic peculiarity of the original hollow has been documented since the eighteenth century. The topographic depression creates a microclimate of slightly higher heat and humidity than the surrounding region, favoring slower leaf maturation and a remarkable concentration of aromatic oils. Farmers of the era reserved these plots for the wrappers of their finest cigars.\r\n\r\nAfter nationalization in 1960, Hoyo de Monterrey joined the Habanos portfolio and was positioned as the emblematic brand of the Cuban soft profile — an alternative to the power of Partagás or Bolívar for those seeking complexity without intensity. This positioning earned it particular success in the British and Scandinavian markets.\r\n\r\nThe Epicure line, introduced in the 1970s, became the house\'s most iconic series. Creamy, floral, with notes of white wood, hazelnut, and a slightly honeyed finish, the Epicures remain among the most celebrated Cuban cigars. The No.2 is the world reference for gentle Cuban robustos — a status it has maintained for five decades that no competitor has entirely dethroned.\r\n\r\nThe Série Epicure de Luxe, reserved for selected markets since 2005, uses leaves from the finest harvests of the original hoyo, aged two additional years before rolling. Connoisseurs who have had the opportunity to smoke it place it at the apex of the Cuban soft profile.', `history_es` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey debe su nombre a un auténtico «hoyo» —una hondonada natural en las lomas de Vuelta Abajo, no lejos de San Juan y Martínez— con fama de dar el tabaco más suave y aromático de toda Cuba. José Gener, fabricante español establecido en La Habana, fundó la marca en 1865 precisamente para explotar ese terruño excepcional.\n\nLa singularidad geográfica del hoyo original está documentada desde el siglo XVIII. El hundimiento del terreno crea un microclima algo más cálido y húmedo que el resto de la comarca, lo que favorece una maduración más lenta de las hojas y una notable concentración de aceites aromáticos. Los cultivadores de la época reservaban esas parcelas para las capas de sus mejores puros.\n\nTras la nacionalización de 1960, Hoyo de Monterrey pasó al catálogo de Habanos y se posicionó como la marca emblemática del perfil cubano suave: una alternativa a la potencia de Partagás o Bolívar para quienes buscan complejidad sin intensidad. Esa posición le valió un éxito particular en los mercados británico y escandinavo.\n\nLa gama Epicure, presentada en los años setenta, se convirtió en la serie más emblemática. Cremosos, florales, con notas de madera blanca y avellana y un final ligeramente melado, los Epicure siguen estando entre los puros cubanos más celebrados. El No.2 es el Robusto cubano suave de referencia mundial: una condición que conserva cinco décadas después y que ningún competidor le ha arrebatado del todo.\n\nLa Serie Epicure de Luxe, reservada a mercados seleccionados desde 2005, emplea hojas de las mejores cosechas del hoyo original, envejecidas dos años más antes del torcido. Los entendidos que han tenido la suerte de fumarla la sitúan en la cima del perfil suave cubano.', `history_de` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey verdankt seinen Namen einem echten „hoyo“ — einer natürlichen Senke in den Hügeln der Vuelta Abajo, unweit von San Juan y Martínez —, der nachgesagt wird, den mildesten und aromatischsten Tabak ganz Kubas hervorzubringen. José Gener, ein in Havanna niedergelassener spanischer Fabrikant, gründete die Marke 1865 eigens, um dieses außergewöhnliche Terroir zu nutzen.\n\nDie geografische Besonderheit des ursprünglichen Hoyo ist seit dem 18. Jahrhundert belegt. Die Geländesenke schafft ein Mikroklima mit etwas höherer Wärme und Feuchtigkeit als die übrige Region, was ein langsameres Reifen der Blätter und eine bemerkenswerte Konzentration aromatischer Öle begünstigt. Die Pflanzer jener Zeit behielten diese Parzellen den Deckblättern ihrer besten Zigarren vor.\n\nNach der Verstaatlichung von 1960 kam Hoyo de Monterrey ins Habanos-Portfolio und wurde als Aushängeschild des milden kubanischen Profils positioniert — eine Alternative zur Kraft von Partagás oder Bolívar für Liebhaber, die Komplexität ohne Intensität suchen. Diese Stellung brachte ihr auf dem britischen und dem skandinavischen Markt besonderen Erfolg.\n\nDie in den 1970er Jahren eingeführte Epicure-Linie wurde zur sinnbildlichen Serie. Cremig, blumig, mit Noten von hellem Holz und Haselnuss und einem leicht honigartigen Abgang, zählen die Epicure weiterhin zu den gefeiertsten kubanischen Zigarren. Die No.2 ist der weltweit maßgebliche milde kubanische Robusto — ein Rang, den sie nach fünf Jahrzehnten behauptet und den ihr kein Konkurrent je ganz streitig gemacht hat.\n\nDie Série Epicure de Luxe, seit 2005 ausgewählten Märkten vorbehalten, verwendet Blätter aus den besten Ernten des ursprünglichen Hoyo, die vor dem Rollen zwei weitere Jahre reifen. Kenner, die sie rauchen durften, stellen sie an die Spitze des milden kubanischen Profils.', `history_zh` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey 的名字源自一个真实的「hoyo」——Vuelta Abajo 丘陵间一处天然凹地，距 San Juan y Martínez 不远，素以出产全古巴最柔和、最芬芳的烟叶著称。定居哈瓦那的西班牙制造商 José Gener 于 1865 年创立该品牌，正是为了开发这片非凡的风土。\n\n这处原始凹地的地理特殊性自 18 世纪起便有记载。地势下陷造就了比周边稍暖稍湿的小气候，有利于烟叶更缓慢地成熟，并积聚出可观的芳香油脂。当时的种植者把这些地块专门留给最好雪茄的茄衣。\n\n1960 年国有化之后，Hoyo de Monterrey 并入 Habanos 旗下，被定位为古巴柔和风格的标志性品牌——为追求复杂度而不求强度的爱好者，提供 Partagás 或 Bolívar 之外的选择。这一定位使它在英国与北欧市场格外成功。\n\n1970 年代推出的 Epicure 系列成为最具代表性的一支。奶香、花香，带白木与榛果气息，收尾略带蜜甜，Epicure 至今仍是最受推崇的古巴雪茄之一。其中 No.2 是世界公认的古巴柔和型 Robusto 标杆——五十年过去，这一地位依旧无人能够完全撼动。\n\n自 2005 年起仅供特定市场的 Série Epicure de Luxe，取自原始凹地最佳年份的烟叶，卷制前再多陈化两年。有幸品尝过的行家，将其置于古巴柔和风格的顶端。', `history_ar` = 'يستمدّ Hoyo de Monterrey اسمه من «hoyo» حقيقي — منخفض طبيعي في تلال Vuelta Abajo، غير بعيد عن San Juan y Martínez — يُقال إنه ينتج أنعم تبغ في كوبا وأغناه عطراً. وقد أسّس José Gener، وهو صانع إسباني مقيم في هافانا، العلامة عام 1865 خصيصاً لاستثمار هذه الأرض الاستثنائية.\n\nخصوصية هذا المنخفض الجغرافية موثّقة منذ القرن الثامن عشر. فالانخفاض في التضاريس يخلق مناخاً محلياً أشدّ حرارة ورطوبة قليلاً من بقية المنطقة، ما يبطئ نضج الأوراق ويرفع تركيز زيوتها العطرية إلى حدّ لافت. وكان مزارعو ذلك العهد يخصّصون هذه القطع لأغلفة أفخر سيجارهم.\n\nبعد تأميم 1960، انضمّ Hoyo de Monterrey إلى محفظة Habanos ووُضع بوصفه العلامة الأبرز للطابع الكوبي الناعم — بديلاً عن قوة Partagás أو Bolívar لمن يبحث عن التعقيد دون الشدّة. وقد أكسبه هذا الموقع نجاحاً خاصاً في السوقين البريطانية والإسكندنافية.\n\nأما تشكيلة Epicure، التي ظهرت في السبعينيات، فصارت السلسلة الأكثر رمزية. كريمية زهرية، بلمسات من الخشب الفاتح والبندق ونهاية عسلية خفيفة، ولا تزال بين أكثر السيجار الكوبي احتفاءً. والطراز No.2 هو مرجع العالم في الروبوستو الكوبي الناعم — مكانة يحتفظ بها بعد خمسة عقود ولم ينتزعها منه أي منافس تماماً.\n\nوتستخدم Série Epicure de Luxe، المخصّصة لأسواق منتقاة منذ 2005، أوراقاً من أفضل مواسم المنخفض الأصلي، تُعتَّق سنتين إضافيتين قبل اللفّ. ومن حالفهم الحظّ بتدخينها من العارفين يضعونها في قمّة الطابع الكوبي الناعم.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Epicure No. 2\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"The world\'s best-selling Cuban Robusto (50×124mm). Thirty to forty minutes of creamy, floral complexity that defined the gentle Cuban style for a generation. The first serious Cuban cigar many discover — and the one to which they return indefinitely.\"}, {\"name\": \"Epicure No. 1\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Laguito No.5 format (38×175mm) — slender, almost delicate. Sixty minutes of rare subtlety: white flowers, sandalwood, a Darjeeling tea finish. For enthusiasts seeking the most delicate complexity in the Cuban portfolio.\"}, {\"name\": \"Double Epicure\", \"color\": \"#7B3F00\", \"story\": \"Generoso format (50×155mm) that gives the Epicure formula 60 minutes to reveal notes of aged cedar and white chocolate absent in shorter formats.\"}, {\"name\": \"Série Epicure de Luxe\", \"color\": \"#5C2800\", \"story\": \"Selective edition using leaves from the original hoyo aged two additional years. Very limited production. For those who have exhausted the pleasure of Epicure No.1 and No.2 and seek their ultimate expression.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Epicure No. 2\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"story\":\"El Robusto (50×124 mm) más vendido de Cuba. Treinta o cuarenta minutos de complejidad cremosa y floral que definieron el estilo suave cubano para toda una generación. El primer puro cubano serio que muchos descubren, y aquel al que vuelven indefinidamente.\"},{\"name\":\"Epicure No. 1\",\"color\":\"#A0522D\",\"story\":\"Formato Laguito No.5 (38×175 mm): esbelto, delicado. Sesenta minutos de una sutileza poco común: flores blancas, sándalo, final de té Darjeeling. Para quienes buscan la complejidad más ligera del catálogo cubano.\"},{\"name\":\"Double Epicure\",\"color\":\"#7B3F00\",\"story\":\"Formato Generoso (50×155 mm) que concede a la fórmula Epicure 60 minutos para revelar notas de cedro añejo y chocolate blanco ausentes en los formatos más cortos.\"},{\"name\":\"Série Epicure de Luxe\",\"color\":\"#5C2800\",\"story\":\"Edición selectiva con hojas del hoyo original envejecidas dos años más. Producción muy limitada. Para quienes han agotado el placer de los Epicure No.1 y No.2 y buscan su expresión definitiva.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Epicure No. 2\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"story\":\"Der meistverkaufte Robusto (50×124 mm) Kubas. Dreißig bis vierzig Minuten cremiger, blumiger Komplexität, die den milden kubanischen Stil für eine Generation geprägt haben. Für viele die erste ernsthafte kubanische Zigarre — und jene, zu der sie immer wieder zurückkehren.\"},{\"name\":\"Epicure No. 1\",\"color\":\"#A0522D\",\"story\":\"Format Laguito No.5 (38×175 mm) — schlank, zart. Sechzig Minuten von seltener Feinheit: weiße Blüten, Sandelholz, ein Abgang von Darjeeling-Tee. Für Liebhaber, die die leichteste Komplexität des kubanischen Portfolios suchen.\"},{\"name\":\"Double Epicure\",\"color\":\"#7B3F00\",\"story\":\"Format Generoso (50×155 mm), das der Epicure-Formel 60 Minuten Zeit gibt, um Noten von gealterter Zeder und weißer Schokolade zu entfalten, die in den kürzeren Formaten fehlen.\"},{\"name\":\"Série Epicure de Luxe\",\"color\":\"#5C2800\",\"story\":\"Ausgesuchte Edition mit Blättern des ursprünglichen Hoyo, zwei zusätzliche Jahre gereift. Sehr begrenzte Produktion. Für alle, die den Genuss der Epicure No.1 und No.2 ausgeschöpft haben und deren letzte Steigerung suchen.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Epicure No. 2\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"story\":\"古巴销量最高的 Robusto（50×124mm）。三四十分钟奶香与花香交织的层次，为整整一代人定义了古巴的柔和风格。许多人认真接触的第一支古巴雪茄，也是他们一再回头的那一支。\"},{\"name\":\"Epicure No. 1\",\"color\":\"#A0522D\",\"story\":\"Laguito No.5 规格（38×175mm）——修长而细腻。六十分钟的罕见微妙：白色花香、檀木，收尾带大吉岭红茶。适合追求古巴产品线中最轻盈那份复杂度的爱好者。\"},{\"name\":\"Double Epicure\",\"color\":\"#7B3F00\",\"story\":\"Generoso 规格（50×155mm），给了 Epicure 配方 60 分钟的时间，去释放短规格里不会出现的陈年雪松与白巧克力气息。\"},{\"name\":\"Série Epicure de Luxe\",\"color\":\"#5C2800\",\"story\":\"精选版本，取自原始凹地的烟叶再多陈化两年。产量极为有限。献给已把 Epicure No.1 与 No.2 的乐趣尝尽、还想寻其极致表达的人。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Epicure No. 2\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"story\":\"أكثر روبوستو (50×124 مم) مبيعاً في كوبا. ثلاثون إلى أربعون دقيقة من تعقيد كريمي زهري رسم الأسلوب الكوبي الناعم لجيل بأكمله. وهو أول سيجار كوبي جادّ يكتشفه كثيرون، والسيجار الذي يعودون إليه بلا انقطاع.\"},{\"name\":\"Epicure No. 1\",\"color\":\"#A0522D\",\"story\":\"طراز Laguito No.5 (38×175 مم) — نحيل ورهيف. ستون دقيقة من لطافة نادرة: زهور بيضاء وخشب الصندل ونهاية من شاي دارجيلنغ. لمن يبحث عن أخفّ تعقيد في المحفظة الكوبية.\"},{\"name\":\"Double Epicure\",\"color\":\"#7B3F00\",\"story\":\"طراز Generoso (50×155 مم) يمنح تركيبة Epicure ستين دقيقة لتكشف عن لمسات الأرز المعتَّق والشوكولاتة البيضاء الغائبة في الأطرزة الأقصر.\"},{\"name\":\"Série Epicure de Luxe\",\"color\":\"#5C2800\",\"story\":\"إصدار انتقائي بأوراق من المنخفض الأصلي مُعتَّقة سنتين إضافيتين. إنتاج محدود جداً. لمن استنفدوا متعة Epicure No.1 وNo.2 ويبحثون عن تعبيرها الأقصى.\"}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill officially preferred Romeo y Julieta — but his personal archives mention Hoyo as his \'secret second love\', particularly in the late afternoon during Parliamentary sessions.\"}, {\"name\": \"British and Scandinavian markets\", \"anecdote\": \"Hoyo de Monterrey is the preferred Cuban brand of British and Scandinavian smokers — markets that historically value soft complexity over direct power. Exports to these countries represent a disproportionate share of total production.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Winston Churchill\",\"anecdote\":\"Oficialmente Churchill prefería la Romeo y Julieta, pero sus archivos personales mencionan la Hoyo como su «segundo amor», sobre todo al final de la tarde en el Parlamento.\"},{\"name\":\"Mercados británico y escandinavo\",\"anecdote\":\"Hoyo de Monterrey es la marca cubana preferida de los fumadores británicos y escandinavos, mercados que históricamente valoran la complejidad suave por encima de la potencia directa. Las exportaciones a estos países representan una proporción desmesurada de la producción total.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Winston Churchill\",\"anecdote\":\"Offiziell bevorzugte Churchill die Romeo y Julieta — seine persönlichen Aufzeichnungen nennen die Hoyo jedoch als seine „zweite Liebe\\\", besonders am späten Nachmittag im Parlament.\"},{\"name\":\"Britischer und skandinavischer Markt\",\"anecdote\":\"Hoyo de Monterrey ist die Lieblingsmarke britischer und skandinavischer Raucher — Märkte, die traditionell milde Komplexität über unmittelbare Kraft stellen. Die Ausfuhren in diese Länder machen einen überproportionalen Anteil der Gesamtproduktion aus.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Winston Churchill\",\"anecdote\":\"丘吉尔在公开场合偏爱罗密欧与朱丽叶，但他的私人档案称好友蒙特雷为「第二挚爱」，尤其是在议会的傍晚时分。\"},{\"name\":\"英国与北欧市场\",\"anecdote\":\"好友蒙特雷是英国与北欧烟客最钟爱的古巴品牌——这些市场历来推崇柔和中的层次，而非直白的力量。销往这些国家的出口量在总产量中占比极高。\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"ونستون تشرشل\",\"anecdote\":\"كان تشرشل يعلن تفضيله «روميو إي جولييتا»، لكن أوراقه الخاصة تذكر «هويو» بوصفها حبّه الثاني، خصوصًا في أصيل النهار داخل البرلمان.\"},{\"name\":\"السوقان البريطانية والإسكندنافية\",\"anecdote\":\"«هويو دي مونتيري» هي العلامة الكوبية المفضّلة لدى المدخّنين البريطانيين والإسكندنافيين — أسواق تُقدّر تاريخيًا التركيب اللطيف المتعدّد الطبقات أكثر من القوة المباشرة. وتستأثر الصادرات إلى هذه البلدان بنسبة تفوق حجمها من الإنتاج الكلي.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Tea\", \"name\": \"Grand Cru Oolong\", \"notes\": \"The most unexpected and most successful pairing for the Cuban soft range. The light tannins of Oolong amplify the florality of the Epicure without ever overpowering it — a marriage of delicacies.\"}, {\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Calvados Pays d\'Auge XO\", \"notes\": \"Fermented apple plays in harmony with the fruity and honeyed notes of the Epicures. A surprising Norman-Cuban pairing of genuine elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Meursault Premier Cru\", \"notes\": \"Burgundy chardonnay in its creamiest form naturally accompanies the white wood and hazelnut notes. The winning pairing at discreet gastronomic tables.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Té\",\"name\":\"Oolong Grand Cru\",\"notes\":\"El maridaje más inesperado y más logrado de la gama suave cubana. Los taninos ligeros del oolong amplifican el carácter floral del Epicure sin aplastarlo jamás: un matrimonio de delicadezas.\"},{\"type\":\"Destilado\",\"name\":\"Calvados Pays d\'Auge XO\",\"notes\":\"La manzana fermentada armoniza con las notas frutales y melosas de los Epicure. Un maridaje normando-cubano de una elegancia sorprendente en las cenas gastronómicas.\"},{\"type\":\"Vino\",\"name\":\"Meursault Premier Cru\",\"notes\":\"El chardonnay borgoñón en su forma más cremosa acompaña con naturalidad las notas de madera blanca y avellana. El maridaje ganador de las mesas discretas.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Tee\",\"name\":\"Oolong Grand Cru\",\"notes\":\"Die überraschendste und gelungenste Kombination der milden kubanischen Linie. Die leichten Tannine des Oolong verstärken die Blumigkeit der Epicure, ohne sie je zu überdecken — eine Ehe zweier Zartheiten.\"},{\"type\":\"Spirituose\",\"name\":\"Calvados Pays d\'Auge XO\",\"notes\":\"Der fermentierte Apfel harmoniert mit den fruchtigen und honigartigen Noten der Epicure. Eine normannisch-kubanische Kombination von überraschender Eleganz bei Gourmetdinners.\"},{\"type\":\"Wein\",\"name\":\"Meursault Premier Cru\",\"notes\":\"Der burgundische Chardonnay in seiner cremigsten Form begleitet die Noten von Weißholz und Haselnuss auf natürliche Weise. Die Siegerkombination der diskreten Tafeln.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"茶\",\"name\":\"特级乌龙\",\"notes\":\"古巴柔和系列中最出人意料也最成功的搭配。乌龙的轻盈单宁放大 Epicure 的花香，却从不压过它——两种细腻的联姻。\"},{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"奥日地区 XO 卡尔瓦多斯\",\"notes\":\"发酵苹果的气息与 Epicure 的果香蜜韵相谐。一场诺曼底与古巴的搭配，在美食晚宴上优雅得令人意外。\"},{\"type\":\"葡萄酒\",\"name\":\"默尔索一级园\",\"notes\":\"勃艮第霞多丽最丰腴的形态，自然贴合白木与榛果的气息。低调餐桌上的必胜之选。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"شاي\",\"name\":\"أولونغ من الدرجة الأولى\",\"notes\":\"أكثر مزاوجات التشكيلة الكوبية اللطيفة مفاجأةً ونجاحًا. تانينات الأولونغ الخفيفة تُبرز الطابع الزهري في «إبيكور» دون أن تطغى عليه أبدًا — زواج بين رهافتين.\"},{\"type\":\"مشروب روحي\",\"name\":\"كالفادوس بايي دوج XO\",\"notes\":\"التفاح المخمّر يتناغم مع نفحات «إبيكور» الفاكهية والعسلية. مزاوجة نورماندية كوبية بأناقة مدهشة في عشاءات فنّ الطهو.\"},{\"type\":\"نبيذ\",\"name\":\"مورسو بريميه كرو\",\"notes\":\"شاردونيه بورغونيا في أكثر صوره كريميةً يرافق طبيعيًا نفحات الخشب الأبيض والبندق. المزاوجة الرابحة على الطاولات الهادئة.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey is a Cuban name — a brand of 1865, born in Vuelta Abajo. After 1960, as with Punch, Montecristo and Romeo y Julieta, the name was taken up outside Cuba, and its non-Cuban version has been made in Honduras ever since. The two cigars have nothing in common but the band.\n\nThe Honduran Hoyo even took the opposite tack from the Cuban. Where the Havana of that name is known for its mildness — it is the brand of the Épicure, of light, fine cigars — the Honduran version built its reputation on strength, to the point of becoming one of the references for full-bodied smoking on the American market.\n\nIts Excalibur line, already present in this atlas, is its best-known expression; it was long sold as a brand in its own right, so much so that many smokers do not know it belongs to Hoyo.', `history_es` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey es un nombre cubano — una marca de 1865, nacida en Vuelta Abajo. Después de 1960, como para Punch, Montecristo y Romeo y Julieta, el nombre fue retomado fuera de Cuba, y su versión no cubana se fabrica desde entonces en Honduras. Los dos cigarros no tienen nada en común salvo la vitola.\n\nEl Hoyo hondureño incluso hizo lo contrario del cubano. Allí donde el habano del mismo nombre es reputado por su suavidad — es la marca de los Épicure, de los cigarros ligeros y finos —, la versión hondureña construyó su reputación sobre la fuerza, hasta convertirse en una de las referencias de lo fuerte en el mercado estadounidense.\n\nSu gama Excalibur, ya presente en este atlas, es su expresión más conocida; se vendió durante mucho tiempo como una marca independiente, hasta el punto de que muchos fumadores ignoran que pertenece a Hoyo.', `history_de` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey ist ein kubanischer Name — eine Marke von 1865, entstanden in Vuelta Abajo. Nach 1960 wurde der Name, wie bei Punch, Montecristo und Romeo y Julieta, außerhalb Kubas wieder aufgenommen, und seine nichtkubanische Version wird seither in Honduras gefertigt. Die beiden Zigarren haben nichts gemein außer der Bauchbinde.\n\nDie honduranische Hoyo schlug sogar den Gegenkurs zur kubanischen ein. Wo die gleichnamige Havanna für ihre Milde bekannt ist — es ist die Marke der Épicure, der leichten, feinen Zigarren —, baute die honduranische Version ihren Ruf auf Kraft, bis sie zu einer der Referenzen für kräftiges Rauchen auf dem amerikanischen Markt wurde.\n\nIhre Linie Excalibur, in diesem Atlas bereits vertreten, ist ihr bekanntester Ausdruck; sie wurde lange als eigenständige Marke verkauft, so sehr, dass viele Raucher nicht wissen, dass sie zu Hoyo gehört.', `history_zh` = '蒙特雷之穴是个古巴名字——一个1865年诞生于阿巴霍谷的品牌。1960年之后，如同潘趣、蒙特克里斯托与罗密欧与朱丽叶，这个名字在古巴之外被重新启用，其非古巴版本自此在洪都拉斯生产。两支雪茄除了烟标之外别无共同之处。\n\n洪都拉斯的蒙特雷之穴甚至走了与古巴版相反的路。同名的哈瓦那雪茄以柔和著称——它是「享乐者」的品牌，是轻盈细致之作——而洪都拉斯版却把声誉建立在力度之上，直至成为美国市场浓郁风格的标杆之一。\n\n它的「王者之剑」系列已收录于本图册，是它最广为人知的表达；这一系列长期被当作独立品牌销售，以致许多烟客并不知道它隶属于蒙特雷之穴。', `history_ar` = '«هويو دي مونتيري» اسم كوبي — علامة من 1865، وُلدت في ڤويلتا أباخو. وبعد 1960، كما جرى مع بانش ومونتيكريستو وروميو إي خولييتا، استُؤنف الاسم خارج كوبا، وصارت نسخته غير الكوبية تُصنع في هندوراس منذ ذلك الحين. ولا يجمع السيجارين شيء سوى الشريط.\n\nبل إن «هويو» الهندوراسي سلك عكس مسار الكوبي تماماً. فحيث يشتهر الهافانا بالاسم نفسه بلطفه — إنها علامة «إبيكور»، علامة السيجار الخفيف الرفيع — بنت النسخة الهندوراسية سمعتها على القوّة، حتى صارت من مراجع الطابع القويّ في السوق الأميركية.\n\nأمّا سلسلتها «إكسكاليبور»، الحاضرة أصلاً في هذا الأطلس، فهي تعبيرها الأشهر؛ وقد بِيعت طويلاً كعلامة قائمة بذاتها، حتى إن كثيراً من المدخّنين يجهلون أنها تابعة لـ«هويو».', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Hoyo de Monterrey Honduras\",\"color\":\"#6B4226\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"The exact opposite of the Havana of the same name: where the Cuban cultivates lightness, the Honduran built its reputation on strength. Earth, pepper, leather.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur\",\"color\":\"#C9A227\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"The line that outgrew its house: many take it for a brand of its own. Pale wrapper, a more restrained register, and a consistency of manufacture remarkable at these volumes.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Hoyo de Monterrey Honduras\",\"color\":\"#6B4226\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Lo contrario exacto del habano del mismo nombre: allí donde el cubano cultiva la ligereza, el hondureño construyó su reputación sobre la fuerza. Tierra, pimienta, cuero.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur\",\"color\":\"#C9A227\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"La gama que superó a su casa: muchos la toman por una marca aparte. Capa clara, registro más contenido, y una regularidad de fabricación notable para estos volúmenes.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Hoyo de Monterrey Honduras\",\"color\":\"#6B4226\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Das genaue Gegenteil der gleichnamigen Havanna: Wo die Kubanerin die Leichtigkeit pflegt, gründete die Honduranerin ihren Ruf auf Kraft. Erde, Pfeffer, Leder.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur\",\"color\":\"#C9A227\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"Die Linie, die ihr Haus überflügelte: Viele halten sie für eine eigene Marke. Helles Deckblatt, zurückhaltenderes Register und eine für diese Mengen bemerkenswerte Fertigungskonstanz.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Hoyo de Monterrey Honduras\",\"color\":\"#6B4226\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"与同名哈瓦那雪茄恰恰相反：古巴那一支经营轻盈，洪都拉斯这一支却以力度立名。泥土、胡椒、皮革。\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur\",\"color\":\"#C9A227\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"这个系列盖过了它所属的品牌：许多人把它当作独立品牌。浅色茄衣，调子更为收敛，而在这样的产量下，其制作的稳定性相当可观。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Hoyo de Monterrey Honduras\",\"color\":\"#6B4226\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"النقيض التامّ للهافانا ذات الاسم نفسه: حيث يزرع الكوبي الخفّة، بنى الهندوراسي سمعته على القوّة. تراب وفلفل وجلد.\"},{\"name\":\"Excalibur\",\"color\":\"#C9A227\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"السلسلة التي تجاوزت دارها: كثيرون يحسبونها علامة مستقلة. غلاف فاتح، ومزاج أكثر تحفّظاً، وانتظام تصنيع لافت عند هذه الكميات.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"Bourbon\",\"notes\":\"The vanilla of the bourbon softens a deliberately rough blend.\"},{\"type\":\"Coffee\",\"name\":\"Strong black coffee\",\"notes\":\"On Excalibur, the roast lifts the pale wrapper.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Bourbon\",\"notes\":\"La vainilla del bourbon suaviza una liga deliberadamente ruda.\"},{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Café solo fuerte\",\"notes\":\"Sobre el Excalibur, el tueste realza la capa clara.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Bourbon\",\"notes\":\"Die Vanille des Bourbon mildert einen bewusst rauen Blend.\"},{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Kräftiger schwarzer Kaffee\",\"notes\":\"Beim Excalibur hebt die Röstung das helle Deckblatt.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"波本威士忌\",\"notes\":\"波本的香草柔化了这款有意粗犷的配方。\"},{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"浓黑咖啡\",\"notes\":\"配王者之剑时，烘焙感提起了浅色茄衣。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"بوربون\",\"notes\":\"فانيليا البوربون تلطّف خلطة خشنة عن قصد.\"},{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة سوداء قوية\",\"notes\":\"مع «إكسكاليبور»، يرفع التحميصُ الغلافَ الفاتح.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey Honduras';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Dion Giolito ran a shop in Nevada and felt that the cigars of his time were all heading in the same direction: stronger, fatter, sweeter. Illusione was born of that disagreement. The brand seeks a profile it readily calls old-fashioned — dry, woody, spicy, without the sweet roundness that had become the Nicaraguan norm — and finds it in the tobaccos of the Jalapa valley, finer and more nervous than those of Estelí.\n\nThe bands of the house are covered in symbols, numbers and esoteric references, and the names of its cigars are often numerals. It is a game, but a game consistent with the point: the brand addresses smokers who read bands, compare formats and argue about blends.\n\nIt changed the landscape lastingly on one precise point: it made the small format respectable again. At a time when the market was growing in ring gauge, Illusione defended coronas and lanceros, arguing that a slender cigar concentrates a blend instead of diluting it.', `history_es` = 'Dion Giolito tenía una tienda en Nevada y le parecía que los cigarros de su tiempo iban todos en la misma dirección: más fuertes, más gruesos, más dulces. Illusione nació de ese desacuerdo. La marca busca un perfil que ella misma llama de antes — seco, amaderado, especiado, sin la redondez dulce convertida en norma nicaragüense — y lo encuentra en los tabacos del valle de Jalapa, más finos y más nerviosos que los de Estelí.\n\nLas vitolas de la casa están cubiertas de símbolos, cifras y referencias esotéricas, y los nombres de sus cigarros son a menudo números. Es un juego, pero coherente con el propósito: la marca se dirige a fumadores que leen las vitolas, comparan formatos y discuten las ligas.\n\nModificó el paisaje de forma duradera en un punto preciso: devolvió el respeto al formato pequeño. En una época en que el mercado subía de cepo, Illusione defendió las coronas y los lanceros, sosteniendo que un cigarro fino concentra la liga en lugar de diluirla.', `history_de` = 'Dion Giolito führte ein Geschäft in Nevada und fand, dass die Zigarren seiner Zeit alle in dieselbe Richtung gingen: stärker, dicker, süßer. Illusione entstand aus diesem Widerspruch. Die Marke sucht ein Profil, das sie gern altmodisch nennt — trocken, holzig, würzig, ohne jene süße Rundheit, die zur nicaraguanischen Norm geworden war — und findet es in den Tabaken des Jalapa-Tals, feiner und nervöser als die von Estelí.\n\nDie Bauchbinden des Hauses sind mit Symbolen, Zahlen und esoterischen Anspielungen bedeckt, und die Namen seiner Zigarren sind oft Zahlen. Ein Spiel, aber eines, das zum Anliegen passt: Die Marke wendet sich an Raucher, die Bauchbinden lesen, Formate vergleichen und über Blends streiten.\n\nIn einem Punkt hat sie die Landschaft dauerhaft verändert: Sie machte das kleine Format wieder salonfähig. Als der Markt im Ringmaß wuchs, verteidigte Illusione Coronas und Lanceros mit dem Argument, eine schlanke Zigarre konzentriere den Blend, statt ihn zu verdünnen.', `history_zh` = '迪翁·焦利托在内华达开店，他觉得当时的雪茄都在往同一个方向走：更浓、更粗、更甜。「幻象」正诞生于这份不认同。这个品牌追求一种它乐于称为「旧式」的风格——干、木质、带辛香，没有那种已成尼加拉瓜常态的甜润——并在哈拉帕山谷的烟叶中找到了它：比埃斯特利的更细致、更紧张。\n\n这家的烟标上布满符号、数字和隐晦的指涉，雪茄的名字往往就是数字。这是游戏，却与其主张一致：这个品牌面向的是会读烟标、比较尺寸、争论配方的烟客。\n\n它在一个具体的点上长久地改变了格局：它让小尺寸重新体面起来。在市场一路加粗的年代，「幻象」为皇冠与长矛辩护，主张细身雪茄浓缩配方，而非稀释配方。', `history_ar` = 'كان ديون جوليتو يدير متجراً في نيڤادا، ورأى أن سيجار زمنه يسير كلّه في الاتجاه ذاته: أقوى، أضخم، أحلى. من هذا الخلاف وُلدت «إلوزيوني». تبحث العلامة عن طابع تسمّيه بلا تردّد «قديم» — جافّ، خشبي، متبَّل، بلا تلك الاستدارة الحلوة التي صارت عُرفاً نيكاراغوياً — وتجده في تبغ وادي خالابا، الأدقّ والأكثر توتّراً من تبغ إستيلي.\n\nأشرطة الدار مغطّاة بالرموز والأرقام والإحالات الباطنية، وأسماء سيجارها كثيراً ما تكون أعداداً. إنها لعبة، لكنها متّسقة مع المقصد: العلامة تخاطب مدخّنين يقرأون الأشرطة، ويقارنون المقاسات، ويتجادلون في الخلطات.\n\nوقد غيّرت المشهد على نحو دائم في نقطة واحدة بعينها: أعادت الاعتبار للمقاس الصغير. ففي زمن كانت السوق ترفع فيه سماكة السيجار، دافعت «إلوزيوني» عن الكورونا واللانسيرو، بحجّة أن السيجار النحيل يركّز الخلطة بدل أن يخفّفها.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Epernay\",\"color\":\"#C2B280\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Jalapa Corojo\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"The creamy side of the house, named after the champagne town. Toasted bread, butter, hay — a midday cigar whose slenderness makes it longer on the palate than its size suggests.\"},{\"name\":\"Illusione Original Documents\",\"color\":\"#8B7355\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Corojo 99\",\"vitolas\":[\"Lancero\"],\"story\":\"The slender format the brand defended while the whole market grew fatter. Dry, peppery, uncompromising: the proof that thinness concentrates instead of diluting.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Epernay\",\"color\":\"#C2B280\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Corojo de Jalapa\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"La vertiente cremosa de la casa, con el nombre de la ciudad del champán. Pan tostado, mantequilla, heno — un cigarro de media jornada cuya finura lo hace más largo en boca de lo que su calibre haría pensar.\"},{\"name\":\"Illusione Original Documents\",\"color\":\"#8B7355\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Corojo 99\",\"vitolas\":[\"Lancero\"],\"story\":\"El formato fino defendido por la marca cuando todo el mercado subía de cepo. Seco, apimentado, sin concesiones: la demostración de que la finura concentra en lugar de diluir.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Epernay\",\"color\":\"#C2B280\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Corojo aus Jalapa\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"Die cremige Seite des Hauses, benannt nach der Champagnerstadt. Röstbrot, Butter, Heu — eine Zigarre für die Tagesmitte, deren Schlankheit sie länger am Gaumen macht, als ihr Format vermuten lässt.\"},{\"name\":\"Illusione Original Documents\",\"color\":\"#8B7355\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Corojo 99\",\"vitolas\":[\"Lancero\"],\"story\":\"Das schlanke Format, das die Marke verteidigte, während der ganze Markt dicker wurde. Trocken, pfeffrig, kompromisslos: der Beweis, dass Schlankheit konzentriert statt verdünnt.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Epernay\",\"color\":\"#C2B280\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"哈拉帕可乐多\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"这家奶润的一面，以香槟之城命名。烤面包、黄油、干草——一支午间的雪茄，其纤细令余味比尺寸所暗示的更长。\"},{\"name\":\"Illusione Original Documents\",\"color\":\"#8B7355\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Corojo 99\",\"vitolas\":[\"Lancero\"],\"story\":\"在整个市场一路加粗时，这个品牌所捍卫的细身尺寸。干、带胡椒、毫不妥协：细身浓缩而非稀释的明证。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Epernay\",\"color\":\"#C2B280\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"كوروخو خالابا\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"الوجه القشدي للدار، مسمّى على اسم مدينة الشمبانيا. خبز محمّص وزبدة وقشّ — سيجار منتصف النهار، تجعله نحافته أطول في الفم مما يوحي به حجمه.\"},{\"name\":\"Illusione Original Documents\",\"color\":\"#8B7355\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Corojo 99\",\"vitolas\":[\"Lancero\"],\"story\":\"المقاس النحيل الذي دافعت عنه العلامة بينما كانت السوق كلّها تزداد سماكة. جافّ، فلفلي، بلا مساومة: برهان على أن النحافة تركّز ولا تخفّف.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"Brut champagne\",\"notes\":\"The name is no accident: the bubbles cut the fat and bring the toasted bread back.\"},{\"type\":\"Other\",\"name\":\"Smoked black tea\",\"notes\":\"The green edge of the tea extends the dryness of Jalapa, where a sweet spirit would flatten it.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Champán brut\",\"notes\":\"El nombre no es casual: las burbujas limpian la grasa y relanzan el pan tostado.\"},{\"type\":\"Otro\",\"name\":\"Té negro ahumado\",\"notes\":\"El lado vegetal del té prolonga la sequedad de Jalapa, allí donde un alcohol dulce la aplastaría.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Champagner brut\",\"notes\":\"Der Name kommt nicht von ungefähr: Die Perlage schneidet das Fett und holt das Röstbrot zurück.\"},{\"type\":\"Sonstiges\",\"name\":\"Gerauchter Schwarztee\",\"notes\":\"Die grüne Seite des Tees verlängert die Trockenheit von Jalapa, wo ein süßer Alkohol sie erdrücken würde.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"干型香槟\",\"notes\":\"名字并非偶然：气泡切开油脂，把烤面包的味道重新带出来。\"},{\"type\":\"其他\",\"name\":\"烟熏红茶\",\"notes\":\"茶的草本感延续哈拉帕的干爽，而甜味酒会把它压垮。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"شمبانيا بروت\",\"notes\":\"الاسم ليس مصادفة: الفقاعات تقطع الدسم وتعيد الخبز المحمّص إلى الواجهة.\"},{\"type\":\"أخرى\",\"name\":\"شاي أسود مدخّن\",\"notes\":\"عشبية الشاي تمدّ جفاف خالابا، حيث يسحقه أيّ كحول حلو.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Illusione';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The origin story of Joya de Nicaragua contains an irony that the company\'s historians note with evident relish: Nicaragua\'s most celebrated cigar brand was created by the government most American administrations of the era were supporting. Anastasio Somoza, whose regime Washington backed as a bulwark against communist influence in Central America, founded Joya de Nicaragua in 1968 as a state enterprise intended to develop the country\'s tobacco industry for export.\r\n\r\nThe timing was excellent. American cigar culture in the late 1960s was entering a period of expansion and premiumization, and the US trade embargo against Cuba had created demand for alternatives to Havana that the existing production centers — the Dominican Republic, Honduras — could not fully satisfy. Nicaraguan tobacco from the Jalapa and Jalapa Valleys offered a distinct flavor profile: earthier and more peppery than Dominican, with a specific intensity that experienced tasters recognized as a different expression of New World tobacco.\r\n\r\nJoya de Nicaragua supplied the Nixon, Ford, and Carter administrations. Presidential preferences were known and supplied accordingly. The brand briefly occupied a diplomatic role — a respectable Nicaraguan cigar that American officials could accept and smoke without political difficulty.\r\n\r\nThe Sandinista revolution of 1979 ended that chapter. The factory was nationalized, the management dispersed, and the 1980s brought economic crisis, American embargo, and civil war to a country trying simultaneously to grow tobacco and survive. The factory operated intermittently on reduced capacity, maintaining continuity through conditions that would have destroyed most manufacturing operations.\r\n\r\nPrivate investment returned in 1994. The reconstruction was gradual and deliberate — the new management understood that the brand\'s identity had to be reclaimed through product quality rather than historical narrative. The Antaño 1970, a blend designed to replicate the formula of the original 1970 production using 6-year-aged Nicaraguan tobaccos, announced the renaissance with precision. The Dark Corojo that followed became the most extreme expression of Nicaraguan intensity in commercial production — routinely described by reviewers as the most demanding smoke they had experienced.', `history_es` = 'Fundada en 1968 por el propio presidente Somoza, Joya de Nicaragua fue la primera fábrica premium de Nicaragua. Nixon, Carter y Ford la fumaban. La revolución sandinista la nacionalizó en 1979. Tras años de caos, fue privatizada en 1994. El Antaño 1970 es su renacimiento — y el Dark Corojo se describe habitualmente como el cigarro más fuerte del mundo.', `history_de` = '1968 vom Präsidenten Somoza selbst gegründet, war Joya de Nicaragua die erste Premium-Zigarrenfabrik Nicaraguas. Nixon, Carter und Ford rauchten sie. Die sandinistische Revolution verstaatlichte sie 1979. Nach Jahren des Chaos wurde sie 1994 privatisiert. Der Antaño 1970 ist ihre Wiedergeburt — und der Dark Corojo gilt weithin als die stärkste Zigarre der Welt.', `history_zh` = '1968年由索摩萨总统本人创立，尼加拉瓜之珠是尼加拉瓜第一家高端雪茄工厂。尼克松、卡特和福特都抽过它。桑地诺革命于1979年将其国有化。经历多年混乱后，1994年被私有化。Antaño 1970是其重生之作——Dark Corojo常被描述为世界最强雪茄。', `history_ar` = 'تأسست عام 1968 على يد الرئيس سوموزا نفسه، وكانت جويا دي نيكاراغوا أول مصنع سيجار فاخر في نيكاراغوا. دخّنها نيكسون وكارتر وفورد. قامت الثورة الساندينية بتأميمها عام 1979. بعد سنوات من الفوضى، خُصِّصت عام 1994. الأنتانيو 1970 بعثها من جديد.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tobacco aged 6 years minimum. Notes of leather, black licorice, sugarless coffee, long pepper. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular Cigar Aficionado score 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). The house\'s most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. Notes of dark cocoa, cinnamon, undergrowth, coffee. Annual production strictly limited.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. Notes of hazelnut, milk chocolate, white pepper. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tabaco añejado 6 years minimum. Notas de cuero, black regaliz, sugarless café, long pimienta. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). La most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. Notas de dark cocoa, canela, undergrowth, café. Producción anual estrictamente limitada.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. Notas de avellana, milk chocolate, white pimienta. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tobacco aged 6 years minimum. Noten von Leder, black licorice, sugarless Kaffee, long Pfeffer. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular Cigar Aficionado Score 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). The house\'s most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. Noten von dark cocoa, cinnamon, undergrowth, Kaffee. Annual production strictly limited.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. Noten von Haselnuss, milk Schokolade, white Pfeffer. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tobacco aged 6 years minimum. 风味： 皮革, black 甘草, sugarless 咖啡, long 胡椒. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). The house\'s most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. 风味： dark cocoa, 肉桂, undergrowth, 咖啡. Annual production strictly limited.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. 风味： 榛子, milk 巧克力, white 胡椒. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tobacco aged 6 years minimum. نكهات:  جلد, black عرق السوس, sugarless قهوة, long فلفل. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular تقييم Cigar Aficionado 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). The house\'s most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. نكهات:  dark cocoa, قرفة, undergrowth, قهوة. Annual production strictly limited.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. نكهات:  بندق, milk شوكولاتة, white فلفل. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly smoked Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly fumaba Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly rauchte Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly smoked Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly smoked Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Ron\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"朗姆酒\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الروم\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Joya de Nicaragua';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Philippine tobacco story is one of the oldest and least told in the premium cigar world. The Spanish colonial administration recognized the quality of Cagayan Valley leaf as early as the seventeenth century and established a tobacco monopoly — the Real Compañía de Filipinas — that controlled production, pricing, and export for over a century. By the time this monopoly was dissolved in 1881, Philippine tobacco had supplied the Spanish market for generations and had developed, in the island\'s traditional farming communities, cultivation techniques adapted specifically to Cagayan soil and climate.\r\n\r\nLa Flor de la Isabela was created in 1881, simultaneously with Tabacalera, as a sister brand intended to occupy a different position in the market. Where Tabacalera would develop toward the fuller expressions of Philippine tobacco, La Flor de la Isabela was conceived as the range that showcased the most delicate characteristics of Cagayan and Ilocos leaf — the florality and herbaceous lightness that distinguishes Philippine tobacco from every other major growing region.\r\n\r\nThe name honors Queen Isabella II of Spain — the monarch under whose reign the tobacco monopoly was reorganized and during whose era the Philippines represented the crown\'s most productive colonial tobacco operation. It is a historical acknowledgment embedded in every band.\r\n\r\nThe leaf sourced from Cagayan and Ilocos for La Flor de la Isabela is selected specifically for its floral qualities — the slightly mentholated, herbaceous character that appears in the retrohale and the extended finish of the best Philippine cigars. This is a flavor dimension that appears in no other major tobacco-growing region at comparable concentration. Cuban tobacco is earthy; Nicaraguan is peppery; Honduran is heavy; Dominican is neutral and refined. Philippine tobacco is uniquely floral — an aromatic register that appeals strongly to smokers whose palate preferences run toward green tea, fresh cedar, and light spice rather than dark earth and cocoa. La Flor de la Isabela is the most complete expression of that profile currently available in the international market.', `history_es` = 'Fundada en 1881 simultáneamente con Tabacalera, La Flor de la Isabela fue nombrada en homenaje a la reina Isabel II de España. Marca hermana de Tabacalera, usa los mismos tabacos Cagayan e Ilocos pero con un perfil más floral y ligero. La expresión más delicada del tabaco filipino.', `history_de` = '1881 gleichzeitig mit Tabacalera gegründet, wurde La Flor de la Isabela zu Ehren von Königin Isabella II. von Spanien benannt. Als Schwestermarke von Tabacalera verwendet sie dieselben Cagayan- und Ilocos-Tabake, aber mit einem blumigeren, leichteren Profil. Der zarteste Ausdruck des philippinischen Tabaks.', `history_zh` = '1881年与烟草公司同时创立，以西班牙女王伊莎贝拉二世命名。作为烟草公司的姊妹品牌，使用相同的卡加延和伊罗戈烟草，但轮廓更加花香清淡。菲律宾烟草最细腻的表达。', `history_ar` = 'تأسست عام 1881 في آنٍ واحد مع تاباكاليرا، وسُمِّيت تكريمًا للملكة إيزابيلا الثانية. علامة شقيقة لتاباكاليرا، تستخدم تبغ كاغايان وإيلوكوس ذاته لكن بملف أكثر زهورية وخفةً. أرق تعبير للتبغ الفلبيني.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"La Flor de la Isabela\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Ilocos wrapper over Cagayan filler. Floral notes, fresh herbs, a hint of mint. Very approachable light. The Philippines\' most delicate range — ideal for discovering Asian tobacco terroir without intimidation.\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Philippine Ilocos\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Panetela\",\"Cigarito\",\"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"La Flor de la Isabela\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Capa Ilocos sobre tripa de Cagayán. Notas florales, hierbas frescas y un ligero toque de menta. Ligero muy accesible. La gama más delicada de Filipinas: ideal para descubrir el terruño asiático del tabaco sin intimidación.\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Philippine Ilocos\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Panetela\",\"Cigarito\",\"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"La Flor de la Isabela\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Ilocos-Deckblatt über Cagayan-Einlage. Blumige Noten, frische Kräuter, ein Hauch Minze. Sehr zugänglich leicht. Die zarteste Linie der Philippinen — ideal, um das asiatische Tabakterroir ohne Scheu zu entdecken.\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Philippine Ilocos\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Panetela\",\"Cigarito\",\"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"La Flor de la Isabela\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Ilocos 茄衣，配 Cagayan 填充。花香、鲜草本，带一丝薄荷。轻度，极易入口。这是菲律宾最细腻的一条产品线——适合毫无压力地认识亚洲烟草风土。\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Philippine Ilocos\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Panetela\",\"Cigarito\",\"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"La Flor de la Isabela\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"غلاف Ilocos على حشوة Cagayan. لمسات زهرية وأعشاب طرية ونعناع خفيف. خفيف وسهل التناول جداً. وهي أرقّ تشكيلات الفلبين — ومثالية لاكتشاف أرض التبغ الآسيوية دون رهبة.\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Philippine Ilocos\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\",\"Panetela\",\"Cigarito\",\"Churchill\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'La Flor de la Isabela';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'José \'Jochy\' Blanco established La Flor Dominicana in Santiago, Dominican Republic in 1996 with a remit he has maintained consistently since: do what others won\'t. In an industry that often rewards the incremental — the slight adjustment to an established blend, the familiar format in a new wrapper — Blanco built his reputation on genuine experimentation and the willingness to make production decisions that most manufacturers would reject on practical grounds.\r\n\r\nThe Double Ligero format — a Double Torpedo measuring 75 x 184mm, making it the largest commercially produced cigar in the world — is the clearest expression of this philosophy. The engineering challenge alone is formidable: the format requires a mold of such specific dimensions that La Flor Dominicana commissioned it exclusively. No other factory possesses the equipment to produce it at scale. The smoking experience it creates — three hours minimum, five distinct aromatic phases that range from light cedar in the first third to deep earth and dark chocolate in the final half-hour — has no equivalent in the commercial market.\r\n\r\nBeyond the headline format, Blanco\'s technical contributions to Dominican cigar production are substantial. He introduced extended fermentation protocols for Dominican ligero leaves that the island\'s other manufacturers later adopted. His sourcing of \'Mystery Ligero\' tobaccos — leaves from undisclosed origins, deliberately unnamed, added to several blends to create a specific character that analytical reviewers cannot fully attribute to known growing regions — is either marketing genius or genuine terroir philosophy depending on your perspective.\r\n\r\nThe Santiago factory produces a catalog that ranges from everyday Dominican mild cigars to the extreme expressions of the Double Ligero. Blanco\'s range of production is unusual for a house of his size — most boutique manufacturers find their register and stay in it. La Flor Dominicana moves across the entire aromatic spectrum, demonstrating that the Dominican Republic, properly pushed, can produce tobacco experiences as demanding as anything Nicaragua or Honduras offers.', `history_es` = 'José \'Jochy\' Blanco es el gran experimentador del cigarro dominicano. Desde 1996, su casa ha sido el laboratorio más activo de la industria. Su obra maestra: el Double Ligero (75x184mm), el cigarro más grande producido en serie en el mundo. Tres horas de fumada, evolución aromática en cinco actos. Solo una fábrica posee el molde.', `history_de` = 'José \'Jochy\' Blanco ist der große Experimentator der dominikanischen Zigarre. Seit 1996 ist sein Haus das aktivste Labor der Branche. Sein Meisterwerk: der Double Ligero (75x184mm), die weltweit größte Serienzigarre. Drei Stunden Rauchdauer, aromatische Entwicklung in fünf Akten. Nur eine Fabrik besitzt die Form.', `history_zh` = '何塞·\'乔奇\'·布兰科是多米尼加雪茄的伟大实验家。自1996年以来，他的工厂是行业最活跃的实验室。他的杰作：双利加罗（75×184mm），全球量产最大的雪茄。三小时吸食时间，五幕式芳香演变。只有一家工厂拥有这个模具。', `history_ar` = 'خوسيه \'خوتشي\' بلانكو هو المجرِّب العظيم للسيجار الدومينيكاني. منذ 1996 كان مصنعه أنشط مختبر في الصناعة. تحفته: الدبل ليغيرو (75×184ملم)، أكبر سيجار تسلسلي في العالم. ثلاث ساعات تدخين، تطور عطري في خمسة فصول.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Ligero\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Chisel format (75 x 184mm) — the world\'s largest production cigar. Minimum three hours of smoke. Notes that evolve through five distinct phases: fresh herbs, spices, coffee, chocolate, interminable peppery finish. Only one manufacturer possesses the mold. Each box is numbered.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Chisel\", \"Missile\", \"Torpedo\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Air Bender\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2015, Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over Dominican. Notes of gingerbread, cardamom, Indonesian coffee. Robusto format (52 x 127mm). Regular score 95+. The Air Bender is considered the house\'s best value-for-money.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Chisel\", \"Lancero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2015}]}, {\"name\": \"Colorado Claro\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Middle range — Colorado wrapper over aged Dominican. Notes of hazelnut, cedar, light vanilla. Medium-full, balanced. The LFD entry point for enthusiasts hesitant before the Double Ligero\'s power.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Ligero\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Chisel format (75 x 184mm) — the world\'s largest production cigar. Minimum three hours of smoke. Notes that evolve through five distinct phases: fresh herbs, especias, café, chocolate, interminable pimientay finish. Solo un fabricante posee el molde. Each box is numbered.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Chisel\", \"Missile\", \"Torpedo\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Air Bender\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2015, Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over Dominican. Notas de gingerbread, cardamom, Indonesian café. Robusto format (52 x 127mm). Puntuación regular 95+. The Air Bender is considerado la best value-for-money.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Chisel\", \"Lancero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2015}]}, {\"name\": \"Colorado Claro\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Middle range — Colorado wrapper over aged Dominican. Notas de avellana, cedro, light vainilla. Medium-full, balanced. The LFD entry point for aficionados hesitant before the Double Ligero\'s power.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Ligero\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Chisel format (75 x 184mm) — the world\'s largest production cigar. Minimum three hours of smoke. Notes that evolve through five distinct phases: fresh herbs, Gewürze, Kaffee, Schokolade, interminable Pfeffery finish. Nur ein Hersteller besitzt die Form. Each box is numbered.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Chisel\", \"Missile\", \"Torpedo\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Air Bender\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2015, Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over Dominican. Noten von gingerbread, cardamom, Indonesian Kaffee. Robusto format (52 x 127mm). Regular score 95+. The Air Bender is considered the house\'s best value-for-money.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Chisel\", \"Lancero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2015}]}, {\"name\": \"Colorado Claro\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Middle range — Colorado wrapper over aged Dominican. Noten von Haselnuss, Zeder, light Vanille. Medium-full, balanced. The LFD entry point for enthusiasts hesitant before the Double Ligero\'s power.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Ligero\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Chisel format (75 x 184mm) — the world\'s largest production cigar. Minimum three hours of smoke. Notes that evolve through five distinct phases: fresh herbs, 香料, 咖啡, 巧克力, interminable 胡椒y finish. 只有一家制造商拥有此模具. Each box is numbered.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Chisel\", \"Missile\", \"Torpedo\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Air Bender\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2015, Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over Dominican. 风味： gingerbread, cardamom, Indonesian 咖啡. Robusto format (52 x 127mm). Regular score 95+. The Air Bender is considered the house\'s best value-for-money.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Chisel\", \"Lancero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2015}]}, {\"name\": \"Colorado Claro\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Middle range — Colorado wrapper over aged Dominican. 风味： 榛子, 雪松木, light 香草. Medium-full, balanced. The LFD entry point for 爱好者 hesitant before the Double Ligero\'s power.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Ligero\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Chisel format (75 x 184mm) — the world\'s largest production cigar. Minimum three hours of smoke. Notes that evolve through five distinct phases: fresh herbs, توابل, قهوة, شوكولاتة, interminable فلفلy finish. دار واحدة فقط تمتلك القالب. Each box is numbered.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Chisel\", \"Missile\", \"Torpedo\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Air Bender\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2015, Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over Dominican. نكهات:  gingerbread, cardamom, Indonesian قهوة. Robusto format (52 x 127mm). Regular score 95+. The Air Bender is considered the house\'s best value-for-money.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Chisel\", \"Lancero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2015}]}, {\"name\": \"Colorado Claro\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Middle range — Colorado wrapper over aged Dominican. نكهات:  بندق, أرز, light فانيليا. Medium-full, balanced. The LFD entry point for المتحمسون hesitant before the Double Ligero\'s power.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"José Blanco\", \"anecdote\": \"Blanco creates each new cigar blindly — he doesn\'t know which tobacco is in the test cigar he\'s smoking. \'If you know what you\'re smoking, you no longer evaluate the cigar. You evaluate your expectations.\'\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"José Blanco\", \"anecdote\": \"Blanco creates each new cigar blindly — he doesn\'t know which tobacco is in the test cigar he\'s smoking. \'If you know what you\'re smoking, you no longer evaluate the cigar. You evaluate your expectations.\'\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"José Blanco\", \"anecdote\": \"Blanco creates each new cigar blindly — he doesn\'t know which tobacco is in the test cigar he\'s smoking. \'If you know what you\'re smoking, you no longer evaluate the cigar. You evaluate your expectations.\'\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"José Blanco\", \"anecdote\": \"Blanco creates each new cigar blindly — he doesn\'t know which tobacco is in the test cigar he\'s smoking. \'If you know what you\'re smoking, you no longer evaluate the cigar. You evaluate your expectations.\'\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"José Blanco\", \"anecdote\": \"Blanco creates each new cigar blindly — he doesn\'t know which tobacco is in the test cigar he\'s smoking. \'If you know what you\'re smoking, you no longer evaluate the cigar. You evaluate your expectations.\'\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Brugal 1888\", \"notes\": \"The prestige Dominican rum naturally accompanies Blanco\'s Dominican creations. Shared dried fruit notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Santo Domingo coffee\", \"notes\": \"The Dominican coffee, soft and lightly chocolaty, is the daily pairing of Santiago\'s torcedores.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Ron\", \"name\": \"Brugal 1888\", \"notes\": \"The prestige Dominican rum acompaña naturalmente Blanco\'s Dominican creations. Shared dried fruit notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Santo Domingo coffee\", \"notes\": \"The Dominican coffee, soft and lightly chocolaty, is the daily pairing of Santiago\'s torcedores.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Brugal 1888\", \"notes\": \"The prestige Dominican rum naturally accompanies Blanco\'s Dominican creations. Shared dried fruit notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Santo Domingo coffee\", \"notes\": \"The Dominican coffee, soft and lightly chocolaty, is the daily pairing of Santiago\'s torcedores.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"朗姆酒\", \"name\": \"Brugal 1888\", \"notes\": \"The prestige Dominican rum naturally accompanies Blanco\'s Dominican creations. Shared dried fruit notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Santo Domingo coffee\", \"notes\": \"The Dominican coffee, soft and lightly chocolaty, is the daily pairing of Santiago\'s torcedores.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الروم\", \"name\": \"Brugal 1888\", \"notes\": \"The prestige Dominican rum naturally accompanies Blanco\'s Dominican creations. Shared dried fruit notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Santo Domingo coffee\", \"notes\": \"The Dominican coffee, soft and lightly chocolaty, is the daily pairing of Santiago\'s torcedores.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'La Flor Dominicana';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The name is a declaration of intent. Liga privada — private blend — is the vocabulary of someone creating something for himself rather than for a market. Jonathan Drew, who founded Drew Estate in 1996 and built it into a significant manufacturing operation on the back of the ACID infused cigar line, had always maintained a personal interest in serious premium tobacco that existed alongside the commercial work. The Liga Privada blends were his private project — tobaccos he selected for his own pleasure and that of a small group of people whose judgment he respected.\r\n\r\nThe No.9 blend combined a Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper — grown in the Hartford Valley, fermented for three years before rolling, producing a leaf of near-black color and distinctive oily richness — with a Nicaraguan blend from Estelí and Jalapa tobaccos that Drew had been developing for years. The T52 used a slightly different wrapper from the same source. Both blends were rolled in Drew Estate\'s Estelí factory in small quantities.\r\n\r\nWhen a few American retailers received samples for evaluation in 2008, the No.9 sold out within 45 minutes of its first appearance. The waiting list that formed around subsequent allocations stretched to six months in some markets. Cigar Aficionado reviewed the No.9 and awarded it 95 points. The T52 earned comparable scores. Retailers reported that customers were offering premiums above list price to secure allocations.\r\n\r\nThe paradox of Liga Privada\'s success is that it validated, through the most demanding segment of the market, a house whose commercial identity was built on flavored cigars. Drew Estate\'s ACID line had been treated by traditional enthusiasts as a separate and lesser category. Liga Privada forced a reassessment — a house with that blending and manufacturing capability could not be dismissed on aesthetic grounds.\r\n\r\nProduction remains deliberately constrained. Drew Estate has not expanded Liga Privada to meet demand. The annual release cycle, the regional allocations, the waiting lists at authorized retailers — these are not artificial scarcity management but the consequence of genuine capacity limits. You cannot make more Liga Privada without growing more of the specific wrapper leaf, and that takes three years from planting to rolling.', `history_es` = 'Liga Privada nació para 15 amigos de Jonathan Drew. El No.9 se agotó en 45 minutos en su primer punto de venta. La lista de espera que siguió — a veces 6-12 meses — transformó un cigarro confidencial en fenómeno cultural. El envolvente Connecticut Broadleaf Habano, fermentado 3 años antes del lanzamiento, es la firma de la marca: oscuro, aceitoso, dulzura paradójica sobre máxima potencia nicaragüense.', `history_de` = 'Liga Privada wurde für 15 Freunde von Jonathan Drew geschaffen. Die No.9 war beim ersten Händler in 45 Minuten ausverkauft. Die darauf folgende Warteliste — manchmal 6-12 Monate — verwandelte eine vertrauliche Zigarre in ein Kulturphänomen. Der Connecticut Broadleaf Habano Wrapper, 3 Jahre vor dem Rollen fermentiert, ist die Markensignatur: dunkel, ölig, paradoxe Süße über maximaler nicaraguanischer Kraft.', `history_zh` = '私人联盟诞生于乔纳森·德鲁的15位朋友之间。No.9在第一家零售商处45分钟内售罄。随之而来的等候名单——有时长达6-12个月——将一支私密雪茄转变为文化现象。康涅狄格宽叶哈瓦那茄衣在卷制前陈化3年，是品牌的标志：深色、油润，在最强尼加拉瓜劲道之上呈现矛盾的甜美。', `history_ar` = 'وُلدت ليغا بريفادا لـ15 صديقًا لجوناثان درو. نفدت No.9 في 45 دقيقة من أول نقطة بيع. قائمة الانتظار التي تلت — أحيانًا 6-12 شهرًا — حوّلت سيجارة سرية إلى ظاهرة ثقافية. الغلافة Connecticut Broadleaf Habano، المخمَّرة 3 سنوات قبل اللف، هي بصمة العلامة.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"The original blend — Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. Notes of ristretto espresso, 90% cocoa, crushed blackberry, saddle leather. The Toro (52 x 152mm) is the canonical format. Cigar Aficionado score 97. First lot sold in 45 minutes at a Denver shop.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2022}]}, {\"name\": \"T52\", \"color\": \"#2D0A00\", \"story\": \"\'T\' for Toro, \'52\' for ring gauge. Even more selectively chosen Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper than the No.9. Slightly different profile — more chocolaty, less coffee, more fruity (fig, date). The T52 is often preferred by smokers seeking more fruit complexity. Even more limited availability.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Toro\", \"Unico Serie\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Unico Serie\", \"color\": \"#3D1C00\", \"story\": \"Ultra-limited editions — a different blend each year for a different format. The Unico Serie Papas Fritas (tiny 38 x 89mm format) became legendary: 100% aged Nicaraguan, pocket size, maximum intensity. Each Unico edition sells out before even reaching shelves.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable per edition\", \"vitolas\": [\"Papas Fritas\", \"Unico Serie annual\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"The original blend — Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. Notas de ristretto espresso, 90% cocoa, crushed blackberry, saddle cuero. The Toro (52 x 152mm) is the canonical format. Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 97. First lot sold in 45 minutes at a Denver shop.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2022}]}, {\"name\": \"T52\", \"color\": \"#2D0A00\", \"story\": \"\'T\' for Toro, \'52\' for ring gauge. Even more selectively chosen Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper than the No.9. Slightly different profile — more chocolaty, less café, more fruity (fig, date). The T52 is often preferred by smokers seeking more fruit complexity. Even more limited availability.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Toro\", \"Unico Serie\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Unico Serie\", \"color\": \"#3D1C00\", \"story\": \"Ultra-limited editions — a different blend each year for a different format. The Unico Serie Papas Fritas (tiny 38 x 89mm format) became legendary: 100% aged Nicaraguan, pocket size, maximum intensity. Each Unico edition sells out before even reaching shelves.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable per edition\", \"vitolas\": [\"Papas Fritas\", \"Unico Serie annual\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"The original blend — Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. Noten von ristretto espresso, 90% cocoa, crushed blackberry, saddle Leder. The Toro (52 x 152mm) is the canonical format. Cigar Aficionado Score 97. First lot sold in 45 minutes at a Denver shop.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2022}]}, {\"name\": \"T52\", \"color\": \"#2D0A00\", \"story\": \"\'T\' for Toro, \'52\' for ring gauge. Even more selectively chosen Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper than the No.9. Slightly different profile — more chocolaty, less Kaffee, more fruity (fig, date). The T52 is often preferred by smokers seeking more fruit complexity. Even more limited availability.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Toro\", \"Unico Serie\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Unico Serie\", \"color\": \"#3D1C00\", \"story\": \"Ultra-limited editions — a different blend each year for a different format. The Unico Serie Papas Fritas (tiny 38 x 89mm format) became legendary: 100% aged Nicaraguan, pocket size, maximum intensity. Each Unico edition sells out before even reaching shelves.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable per edition\", \"vitolas\": [\"Papas Fritas\", \"Unico Serie annual\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"The original blend — Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. 风味： ristretto espresso, 90% cocoa, crushed blackberry, saddle 皮革. The Toro (52 x 152mm) is the canonical format. 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 97. First lot sold in 45 分钟 at a Denver shop.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2022}]}, {\"name\": \"T52\", \"color\": \"#2D0A00\", \"story\": \"\'T\' for Toro, \'52\' for ring gauge. Even more selectively chosen Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper than the No.9. Slightly different profile — more chocolaty, less 咖啡, more fruity (fig, date). The T52 is often preferred by smokers seeking more fruit complexity. Even more limited availability.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Toro\", \"Unico Serie\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Unico Serie\", \"color\": \"#3D1C00\", \"story\": \"Ultra-limited editions — a different blend each year for a different format. The Unico Serie Papas Fritas (tiny 38 x 89mm format) became legendary: 100% aged Nicaraguan, pocket size, maximum intensity. Each Unico edition sells out before even reaching shelves.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable per edition\", \"vitolas\": [\"Papas Fritas\", \"Unico Serie annual\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"No.9\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"The original blend — Connecticut Broadleaf Habano wrapper over triple Nicaraguan ligero. نكهات:  ristretto espresso, 90% cocoa, crushed blackberry, saddle جلد. The Toro (52 x 152mm) is the canonical format. تقييم Cigar Aficionado 97. First lot sold in 45 دقيقة at a Denver shop.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Lancero\", \"No.9 Perfecto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2018}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2022}]}, {\"name\": \"T52\", \"color\": \"#2D0A00\", \"story\": \"\'T\' for Toro, \'52\' for ring gauge. Even more selectively chosen Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper than the No.9. Slightly different profile — more chocolaty, less قهوة, more fruity (fig, date). The T52 is often preferred by smokers seeking more fruit complexity. Even more limited availability.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Flying Pig\", \"Petit Toro\", \"Unico Serie\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Unico Serie\", \"color\": \"#3D1C00\", \"story\": \"Ultra-limited editions — a different blend each year for a different format. The Unico Serie Papas Fritas (tiny 38 x 89mm format) became legendary: 100% aged Nicaraguan, pocket size, maximum intensity. Each Unico edition sells out before even reaching shelves.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable per edition\", \"vitolas\": [\"Papas Fritas\", \"Unico Serie annual\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Eccentric Drew Estate founder, Drew is as much artist as tobacologist. He composes his blends in nocturnal sessions, often after midnight, listening to jazz. The No.9 was composed in one night \'to impress fifteen friends.\' He has since impressed several million.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Eccentric Drew Estate founder, Drew is as much artist as tobacologist. He composes his blends in nocturnal sessions, often after midnight, listening to jazz. The No.9 was composed in one night \'to impress fifteen friends.\' He has since impressed several million.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Eccentric Drew Estate founder, Drew is as much artist as tobacologist. He composes his blends in nocturnal sessions, often after midnight, listening to jazz. The No.9 was composed in one night \'to impress fifteen friends.\' He has since impressed several million.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Eccentric Drew Estate founder, Drew is as much artist as tobacologist. He composes his blends in nocturnal sessions, often after midnight, listening to jazz. The No.9 was composed in one night \'to impress fifteen friends.\' He has since impressed several million.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Jonathan Drew\", \"anecdote\": \"Eccentric Drew Estate founder, Drew is as much artist as tobacologist. He composes his blends in nocturnal sessions, often after midnight, listening to jazz. The No.9 was composed in one night \'to impress fifteen friends.\' He has since impressed several million.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Beer\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s American pairing.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Cerveza\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s American pairing.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Bier\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s American pairing.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"啤酒\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"波旁威士忌\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s American pairing.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"البيرة\", \"name\": \"Brooklyn Black Chocolate Stout\", \"notes\": \"The chocolaty New York stout from the founders\' city — a cultural terroir pairing. Twin cocoa notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"البوربون\", \"name\": \"Woodford Reserve\", \"notes\": \"The elegant Kentucky bourbon accompanies the Liga Privada No.9 while highlighting vanilla and oak notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"18-hour cold brew\", \"notes\": \"Cold brew reveals fruity notes in the No.9 that espresso masks. A connoisseur\'s American pairing.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Liga Privada';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Macanudo\'s origins are Caribbean and distinctly complicated. The brand was founded in Jamaica in 1868 under the name Temple Hall, using Jamaican-grown tobacco that offered something genuinely unusual in the mid-nineteenth century premium market: a light, creamy profile with minimal strength and maximum accessibility. Jamaica\'s soils and climate produced a tobacco character that was more like Connecticut shade than Cuban Vuelta Abajo — smooth, gentle, and forgiving for smokers who found the intensity of Havana\'s great brands demanding.\r\n\r\nThe migration to New York in the 1960s under Edgar M. Cullman Sr. transformed Macanudo from a Caribbean specialty into an American phenomenon. Cullman understood that the wealthy American smoker of the postwar decades wanted luxury without challenge — a cigar that communicated refinement without demanding expertise or physical tolerance. He repositioned Macanudo around Connecticut shade wrappers and Dominican fillers, eliminating the Jamaican tobacco\'s residual earthiness and producing a profile of pure cream, mild cedar, and approachable strength that no other brand was delivering with the same consistency.\r\n\r\nThe strategy worked beyond any commercial projection. Through the 1980s and into the 1990s, Macanudo Café was the best-selling premium cigar in the United States — a position it held for over twenty consecutive years. Every airport newsstand, every hotel gift shop, every restaurant bar with a cigar program stocked Macanudo Café as the default premium option. The yellow bands became a signal of accessible luxury that crossed demographic lines.\r\n\r\nGeneral Cigar, which acquired the brand, recognized by the 2010s that Macanudo\'s extraordinary market position had become a liability as much as an asset. Smokers who had grown up with the Café were now experienced enough to want something more demanding. The Inspirado range — using fuller-bodied Nicaraguan blends under modified Connecticut-style wrappers — was designed to retain this audience while attracting the younger enthusiast who associated Macanudo with their parents\' generation rather than their own. The strategy has produced mixed but largely positive results, with several Inspirado releases earning scores above 90 from specialist publications.', `history_es` = 'Macanudo nació en Kingston, Jamaica en 1868 y migró a Nueva York en los años 60 bajo Edgar M. Cullman Sr. Durante los 80 y 90, fue la marca más vendida de EE.UU. durante más de dos décadas. Hoy propiedad de General Cigar, relanzó su reputación con la gama Inspirado — más robusta, más nicaragüense.', `history_de` = 'Macanudo wurde 1868 in Kingston, Jamaica geboren und in den 1960er Jahren von Edgar M. Cullman Sr. nach New York verlegt. In den 80er und 90er Jahren war es über zwei Jahrzehnte die meistverkaufte Marke der USA. Heute im Besitz von General Cigar, erneuerte es seinen Ruf mit der Inspirado-Linie — kräftiger, nicaraguanischer.', `history_zh` = '马卡努多于1868年在牙买加金斯敦诞生，20世纪60年代在埃德加·卡尔曼的主导下迁至纽约。在80和90年代，连续逾二十年是美国最畅销的品牌。如今隶属通用雪茄，以Inspirado系列重塑声誉——更强劲，更具尼加拉瓜风格。', `history_ar` = 'وُلدت ماكانودو في كينغستون، جامايكا عام 1868، وانتقلت إلى نيويورك في الستينيات تحت قيادة إدغار كالمان الأب. خلال الثمانينيات والتسعينيات كانت العلامة الأكثر مبيعًا في أمريكا لأكثر من عقدين. تعود اليوم لجنرال سيغار، وأحيت سمعتها مع تشكيلة إنسبيرادو.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican-Jamaican blend. Notes of cream, light cedar, white hazelnut. The cigar of golf terraces and prestigious waiting rooms. Consistent, accessible, predictable — and that\'s exactly what its millions of fans seek.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Ascot\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"Inspirado\", \"color\": \"#8B2500\", \"story\": \"Launched 2014, major stylistic shift. Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian oscuro wrapper. Notes of coffee, dark chocolate, spices. Full body — the opposite of the Café. General Cigar wanted to prove Macanudo could play with the big boys. Successful bet: regular scores 93–95 since launch.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\", \"White Robusto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Gold Label\", \"color\": \"#DAA520\", \"story\": \"The premium Macanudo range. Selected Connecticut Shade wrapper, aged Dominican. Notes of rich cream, buttery bread, toasted hazelnut. The house at its best — always soft but with a complexity the standard Café never reaches.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"Corona\", \"Prince of Wales\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican-Jamaican blend. Notas de cream, light cedro, white avellana. The cigar of golf terraces and prestigious waiting rooms. Consistent, accessible, predictable — and that\'s exactly what its millions of fans seek.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Ascot\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"Inspirado\", \"color\": \"#8B2500\", \"story\": \"Launched 2014, major stylistic shift. Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian oscuro wrapper. Notas de café, chocolate negro, especias. Full body — the opposite of the Café. General Cigar wanted to prove Macanudo could play with the big boys. Successful bet: regular puntuacións 93–95 since launch.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\", \"White Robusto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Gold Label\", \"color\": \"#DAA520\", \"story\": \"The premium Macanudo range. Selected Connecticut Shade wrapper, aged Dominican. Notas de rich cream, buttery bread, tostado avellana. The house at its best — always soft but with a complexity the standard Café never reaches.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"Corona\", \"Prince of Wales\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican-Jamaican blend. Noten von cream, light Zeder, white Haselnuss. The cigar of golf terraces and prestigious waiting rooms. Consistent, accessible, predictable — and that\'s exactly what its millions of fans seek.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Ascot\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"Inspirado\", \"color\": \"#8B2500\", \"story\": \"Launched 2014, major stylistic shift. Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian oscuro wrapper. Noten von Kaffee, dunkle Schokolade, Gewürze. Full body — the opposite of the Café. General Cigar wanted to prove Macanudo could play with the big boys. Successful bet: regular scores 93–95 since launch.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\", \"White Robusto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Gold Label\", \"color\": \"#DAA520\", \"story\": \"The premium Macanudo range. Selected Connecticut Shade wrapper, aged Dominican. Noten von rich cream, buttery bread, geröstet Haselnuss. The house at its best — always soft but with a complexity the standard Café never reaches.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"Corona\", \"Prince of Wales\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican-Jamaican blend. 风味： cream, light 雪松木, white 榛子. The cigar of golf terraces and prestigious waiting rooms. Consistent, accessible, predictable — and that\'s exactly what its millions of fans seek.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Ascot\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"Inspirado\", \"color\": \"#8B2500\", \"story\": \"Launched 2014, major stylistic shift. Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian oscuro wrapper. 风味： 咖啡, 黑巧克力, 香料. Full body — the opposite of the Café. General Cigar wanted to prove Macanudo could play with the big boys. Successful bet: regular scores 93–95 since launch.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\", \"White Robusto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Gold Label\", \"color\": \"#DAA520\", \"story\": \"The premium Macanudo range. Selected Connecticut Shade wrapper, aged Dominican. 风味： rich cream, buttery bread, 烘烤 榛子. The house at its best — always soft but with a complexity the standard Café never reaches.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"Corona\", \"Prince of Wales\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Macanudo Café\", \"color\": \"#C9A96E\", \"story\": \"America\'s best-seller for 30 years. Connecticut Shade wrapper over Dominican-Jamaican blend. نكهات:  cream, light أرز, white بندق. The cigar of golf terraces and prestigious waiting rooms. Consistent, accessible, predictable — and that\'s exactly what its millions of fans seek.\", \"force\": \"Light-Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Café\", \"Ascot\", \"Baron de Rothschild\", \"Hampton Court\", \"Hyde Park\", \"Prince Philip\"]}, {\"name\": \"Inspirado\", \"color\": \"#8B2500\", \"story\": \"Launched 2014, major stylistic shift. Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian oscuro wrapper. نكهات:  قهوة, شوكولاتة داكنة, توابل. Full body — the opposite of the Café. General Cigar wanted to prove Macanudo could play with the big boys. Successful bet: regular scores 93–95 since launch.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\", \"White Robusto\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Gold Label\", \"color\": \"#DAA520\", \"story\": \"The premium Macanudo range. Selected Connecticut Shade wrapper, aged Dominican. نكهات:  rich cream, buttery bread, محمَّص بندق. The house at its best — always soft but with a complexity the standard Café never reaches.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"Corona\", \"Prince of Wales\", \"Robusto\", \"Toro\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Edgar M. Cullman Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Cullman transformed Macanudo into an American national brand in the 1960s-70s. He distributed boxes of Café at Wall Street cocktail parties — the cigar became the symbol of moderate American success.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Edgar M. Cullman Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Cullman transformed Macanudo into an American national brand in the 1960s-70s. He distributed boxes of Café at Wall Street cocktail parties — the cigar became the symbol of moderate American success.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Edgar M. Cullman Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Cullman transformed Macanudo into an American national brand in the 1960s-70s. He distributed boxes of Café at Wall Street cocktail parties — the cigar became the symbol of moderate American success.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Edgar M. Cullman Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Cullman transformed Macanudo into an American national brand in the 1960s-70s. He distributed boxes of Café at Wall Street cocktail parties — the cigar became the symbol of moderate American success.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Edgar M. Cullman Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Cullman transformed Macanudo into an American national brand in the 1960s-70s. He distributed boxes of Café at Wall Street cocktail parties — the cigar became the symbol of moderate American success.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Scotch\", \"name\": \"Johnnie Walker Black\", \"notes\": \"The classic boardroom pairing of American offices in the 1990s — both products share accessible premium status.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Light roast drip coffee\", \"notes\": \"Macanudo Café with a light roast American coffee — an office, terrace, quiet Sunday morning pairing without pretension.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Scotch\", \"name\": \"Johnnie Walker Black\", \"notes\": \"The classic boardroom pairing of American offices in the 1990s — both products share accessible premium status.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Light roast drip coffee\", \"notes\": \"Macanudo Café with a light roast American coffee — an office, terrace, quiet Sunday morning pairing without pretension.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Scotch\", \"name\": \"Johnnie Walker Black\", \"notes\": \"The classic boardroom pairing of American offices in the 1990s — both products share accessible premium status.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Light roast drip coffee\", \"notes\": \"Macanudo Café with a light roast American coffee — an office, terrace, quiet Sunday morning pairing without pretension.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"Scotch\", \"name\": \"Johnnie Walker Black\", \"notes\": \"The classic boardroom pairing of American offices in the 1990s — both products share accessible premium status.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Light roast drip coffee\", \"notes\": \"Macanudo Café with a light roast American coffee — an office, terrace, quiet Sunday morning pairing without pretension.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"Scotch\", \"name\": \"Johnnie Walker Black\", \"notes\": \"The classic boardroom pairing of American offices in the 1990s — both products share accessible premium status.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Light roast drip coffee\", \"notes\": \"Macanudo Café with a light roast American coffee — an office, terrace, quiet Sunday morning pairing without pretension.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Macanudo';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Almost every Nicaraguan factory is in Estelí, in the tobacco-growing north. Mombacho made the opposite choice and settled in Granada, the colonial city on the shore of Lake Nicaragua, at the foot of the volcano that gives it its name. That is no small point of geography: the house rolls where travellers pass, in an old mansion open to visitors, and has made that accessibility part of its argument.\n\nThe tobacco itself comes from the north like everyone else\'s — there is no tobacco terroir around Granada. What the house lays claim to lies elsewhere: short runs, a factory on a human scale, and a direct relationship between smoker and workshop, against the grain of a trade in which one almost never visits the place where the cigar was born.\n\nIt is, in this atlas, the clearest example of a house whose interest lies as much in the place as in the product.', `history_es` = 'Casi todas las fábricas nicaragüenses están en Estelí, en el norte tabacalero. Mombacho eligió lo contrario y se instaló en Granada, ciudad colonial a orillas del lago Nicaragua, al pie del volcán que le da nombre. No es un detalle de geografía: la casa lía allí donde pasan los viajeros, en una casona antigua abierta a los visitantes, y ha hecho de esa accesibilidad parte de su propósito.\n\nEl tabaco, en cambio, viene del norte como el de los demás — no hay terruño tabacalero alrededor de Granada. Lo que la casa reivindica está en otra parte: series cortas, una fábrica a escala humana, y una relación directa entre el fumador y el taller, a contracorriente de un oficio en el que casi nunca se visita el lugar donde nació el cigarro.\n\nEs, en este atlas, el ejemplo más claro de una casa cuyo interés reside tanto en el lugar como en el producto.', `history_de` = 'Fast alle nicaraguanischen Manufakturen liegen in Estelí, im Tabakanbau-Norden. Mombacho traf die entgegengesetzte Wahl und ließ sich in Granada nieder, der Kolonialstadt am Ufer des Nicaraguasees, am Fuß des Vulkans, der ihr den Namen gibt. Das ist keine geografische Nebensache: Das Haus rollt dort, wo die Reisenden vorbeikommen, in einem alten Herrenhaus, das Besuchern offensteht, und hat diese Zugänglichkeit zu einem Teil seines Anliegens gemacht.\n\nDer Tabak kommt wie bei allen anderen aus dem Norden — rund um Granada gibt es kein Tabakterroir. Worauf sich das Haus beruft, liegt anderswo: kurze Serien, eine Manufaktur in menschlichem Maßstab und eine direkte Beziehung zwischen Raucher und Werkstatt, gegen den Strich eines Gewerbes, in dem man den Ort, an dem die Zigarre entstand, so gut wie nie besucht.\n\nEs ist in diesem Atlas das deutlichste Beispiel eines Hauses, dessen Reiz ebenso im Ort wie im Produkt liegt.', `history_zh` = '尼加拉瓜几乎所有的雪茄厂都在北部烟草产区埃斯特利。蒙巴乔却反其道而行，落户于格拉纳达——尼加拉瓜湖畔的殖民古城，坐落在赋予它名字的火山脚下。这不是无关紧要的地理细节：这家企业在旅人往来之处卷制雪茄，厂址是一栋对访客开放的老宅，而它把这份可亲近性当作自身主张的一部分。\n\n烟叶本身则和别家一样来自北方——格拉纳达周边没有烟草风土。这家企业所主张的在别处：短批量、人本尺度的作坊，以及烟客与工坊之间的直接关系——在这个几乎从不让人参观雪茄诞生之地的行业里，这是逆流而行。\n\n在本图册中，它是最鲜明的例子：一家企业的价值，既在产品，也在地点。', `history_ar` = 'تكاد كل مصانع نيكاراغوا تكون في إستيلي، في الشمال التبغي. أمّا «مومباتشو» فاختارت العكس واستقرّت في غرناطة، المدينة الاستعمارية على ضفة بحيرة نيكاراغوا، عند سفح البركان الذي منحها اسمها. وليست هذه تفصيلة جغرافية: فالدار تلفّ حيث يمرّ المسافرون، في منزل قديم مفتوح للزوار، وقد جعلت من هذا الانفتاح جزءاً من خطابها.\n\nأمّا التبغ فيأتي من الشمال كما عند الجميع — إذ لا أرض تبغية حول غرناطة. وما تدّعيه الدار في مكان آخر: دفعات قصيرة، ومصنع بمقياس إنساني، وعلاقة مباشرة بين المدخّن والورشة، على عكس مهنة لا يزور فيها المرء تقريباً المكان الذي وُلد فيه سيجاره.\n\nوهي في هذا الأطلس المثال الأوضح على دارٍ تكمن أهمّيتها في المكان بقدر ما تكمن في المنتج.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Liga Maestro\",\"color\":\"#6F4E37\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Jalapa Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"The top line of the house, in short runs. Full-bodied, earthy, with the density that reduced production volumes allow.\"},{\"name\":\"Cosecha\",\"color\":\"#A67B5B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"A vintage blend that changes with the harvest. The exact opposite of industrial consistency — and that is the point.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Liga Maestro\",\"color\":\"#6F4E37\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano de Jalapa\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"La gama alta de la casa, en series cortas. Fuerte, terroso, con la densidad que permiten unos volúmenes de producción reducidos.\"},{\"name\":\"Cosecha\",\"color\":\"#A67B5B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Una liga de añada, que cambia con la cosecha. Lo contrario exacto de la constancia industrial — y ese es el asunto.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Liga Maestro\",\"color\":\"#6F4E37\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano aus Jalapa\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"Die Spitzenlinie des Hauses, in kurzen Serien. Kräftig, erdig, mit jener Dichte, die geringe Produktionsmengen erlauben.\"},{\"name\":\"Cosecha\",\"color\":\"#A67B5B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Ein Jahrgangsblend, der sich mit der Ernte ändert. Das genaue Gegenteil industrieller Beständigkeit — und genau darum geht es.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Liga Maestro\",\"color\":\"#6F4E37\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"哈拉帕哈瓦那种\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"这家的高端系列，短批量生产。浓郁、带土味，具备小产量才允许的密度。\"},{\"name\":\"Cosecha\",\"color\":\"#A67B5B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"一款随年份而变的配方。与工业化的恒定恰恰相反——而这正是重点。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Liga Maestro\",\"color\":\"#6F4E37\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"هابانو خالابا\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"السلسلة العليا للدار، بدفعات قصيرة. قويّة، ترابية، بكثافة لا تتيحها إلا الكميات المحدودة.\"},{\"name\":\"Cosecha\",\"color\":\"#A67B5B\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"خلطة سنوية تتبدّل مع الموسم. النقيض التامّ للثبات الصناعي — وهذا هو المقصد.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"Granada rum\",\"notes\":\"A local pairing in the strict sense: the city, the lake, the volcano and the cask.\"},{\"type\":\"Coffee\",\"name\":\"High-altitude Nicaraguan coffee\",\"notes\":\"The acidity of a high-grown coffee lifts the earth of the filler.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Ron de Granada\",\"notes\":\"Un acuerdo local en sentido estricto: la ciudad, el lago, el volcán y la barrica.\"},{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Café nicaragüense de altura\",\"notes\":\"La acidez de un café de altura realza la tierra de la tripa.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Rum aus Granada\",\"notes\":\"Eine lokale Verbindung im strengen Sinne: die Stadt, der See, der Vulkan und das Fass.\"},{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Nicaraguanischer Höhenkaffee\",\"notes\":\"Die Säure eines Höhenkaffees hebt die Erdigkeit der Einlage.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"格拉纳达朗姆\",\"notes\":\"严格意义上的在地呼应：城市、湖泊、火山与酒桶。\"},{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"尼加拉瓜高海拔咖啡\",\"notes\":\"高海拔咖啡的酸度提起茄芯的土壤气息。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"روم غرناطة\",\"notes\":\"تناغم محليّ بالمعنى الحرفي: المدينة والبحيرة والبركان والبرميل.\"},{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة نيكاراغوية مرتفعة\",\"notes\":\"حموضة قهوة المرتفعات ترفع ترابية الحشوة.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Mombacho';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Montecristo was born inside the legendary H. Upmann factory in 1935, created by Alonso Menéndez and Pepe García from the finest tobaccos of Vuelta Abajo. The name was chosen by the torcedors themselves: during rolling sessions, a reader — the lector — would read aloud to the workers, and by consensus the favorite novel was Alexandre Dumas\' The Count of Monte Cristo. The choice revealed something about who made these cigars and what they aspired to: an epic of justice, wealth, and resurrection. The name stuck, the band was designed, and one of tobacco history\'s great dynasties began.\r\n\r\nThe early Montecristo garnered immediate attention in Britain, where the Dunhill and Hunters & Frankau networks distributed it to London\'s finest clubs. By the late 1940s, the No.4 — a Petit Corona measuring 42 x 129mm — had become the benchmark for what a daily cigar should be: not too powerful, not too delicate, impeccably constructed, and consistent across every single box. It is today the world\'s best-selling cigar, a distinction it has held for decades.\r\n\r\nThe Cuban revolution of 1959 fractured the brand into two permanent dynasties. Alonso Menéndez departed with his seeds, his master torcedores, and his institutional knowledge. He eventually settled in the Dominican Republic, where a Montecristo was created under conditions as close to the original as he could engineer. Two houses, one name, different terroir — and decades of legal disputes over the American market where the Cuban brand could not be sold due to the trade embargo.\r\n\r\nIn Havana, Montecristo continued under state ownership at the Romeo y Julieta factory. The quality recovered, the prestige deepened. The No.2, in Torpedo pyramidal format, emerged as the brand\'s intellectual masterpiece: the tapered head concentrates heat and directs aromas through the palate in a crescendo that peaks at mid-smoke before unfolding into cedar, black spice, and an impossibly long finish. Cigar Aficionado awarded it 96 points in 2022 — the highest score ever given to a regular production Cuban cigar in that publication\'s history.\r\n\r\nThe Montecristo Edmundo, launched in 2004, added a rounder, more immediate profile to the collection. The Open series brought the brand to younger smokers who found the classics slightly demanding. The Línea 1492, created for the 500th anniversary of Columbus\'s voyage in 1992, produced the Sublimes — a Double Corona of haunting complexity that connoisseurs compare to great Burgundy in the way it evolves differently in every box.\r\n\r\nWhat unites all Montecristos across formats and decades is a shared architectural philosophy: balance above all else. These are not cigars that announce themselves with power. They seduce through precision. They reward patience. And they have never stopped being the reference against which every other premium cigar is measured.', `history_es` = 'Montecristo nació en la legendaria fábrica H. Upmann en 1935. El nombre fue elegido por los propios torcedores: el lector en las galeras leía El Conde de Montecristo de Dumas — favorito de todos. El No.4 Petit Corona (42x129mm) es hoy el cigarro más vendido del mundo.\r\n\r\nTras la revolución de 1959, Menéndez fundó Montecristo en República Dominicana — dos dinastías paralelas con el mismo nombre glorioso.\r\n\r\nEl No.2 torpedo piramidal es considerado el cigarro cubano más perfectamente equilibrado jamás lanzado.', `history_de` = 'Montecristo wurde 1935 in der legendären H. Upmann Fabrik geboren. Den Namen wählten die Torcedors selbst: der Vorleser in den Galeras las Dumas\' Der Graf von Monte Christo — aller Lieblingsroman. Die No.4 Petit Corona (42x129mm) ist die meistverkaufte Zigarre der Welt.\r\n\r\nNach der Revolution 1959 gründete Menéndez Montecristo in der Dominikanischen Republik — zwei Dynastien mit demselben Namen.\r\n\r\nDie No.2 Torpedo gilt als die ausgewogenste kubanische Zigarre aller Zeiten.', `history_zh` = '蒙特克里斯托于1935年在H·厄普曼工厂诞生。卷制师们以大仲马的《基督山伯爵》命名——那是工场朗读时人人最爱的小说。No.4小皇冠（42×129mm）是全球销量最高的雪茄。\r\n\r\n1959年革命后，梅嫩德斯在多米尼加共和国创立了蒙特克里斯托——两个平行王朝共用同一荣耀名称。\r\n\r\nNo.2锥形托尔佩多被行家视为有史以来最完美平衡的古巴雪茄。', `history_ar` = 'وُلدت مونتيكريستو عام 1935 في مصنع H. Upmann الأسطوري. اختار الاسم الملفِّفون أنفسهم: كان القارئ في قاعات اللف يجهر برواية دوما الكونت دي مونتي كريستو — المفضلة لدى الجميع. No.4 بيتي كورونا (42×129ملم) هو أكثر السيجار مبيعًا في العالم.\r\n\r\nبعد ثورة 1959، أسّس مينينديث مونتيكريستو في جمهورية الدومينيكان — سلالتان متوازيتان بالاسم ذاته.\r\n\r\nالـ No.2 التوربيدو يُعدّ في نظر المتذوقين أكثر السيجار الكوبي توازنًا على الإطلاق.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"No.2 — The Torpedo\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Torpedo format (52 x 162mm) — the most perfectly balanced Cuban cigar according to many experts. The pyramidal shape creates a progressive aroma build. Dominant notes of cedar, toasted hazelnut, soft spices. Duration: 90 minutes. Cigar Aficionado score 96/100.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.2\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2022}]}, {\"name\": \"No.4 — The Classic\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Petit Corona (42 x 129mm), the world\'s best-selling cigar. Accessible, balanced, perfect for both novice and expert. Notes of toast, cashew, white pepper.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.4\"]}, {\"name\": \"Línea 1935\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Created for the 80th anniversary in 2015. A tribute to the origins — using Vuelta Abajo leaves selected per 1935 criteria. Spicier and fuller-bodied than the classic range. Permanent edition, limited production.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Dumas\", \"Edmundo\", \"Maltes\"]}, {\"name\": \"Supremos EL\", \"color\": \"#4A235A\", \"story\": \"Spanish regional edition, Supremos format (54 x 185mm). One of the most sought-after cigars among European collectors. Annual production under 5,000 boxes. Smoking time exceeds two hours.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Supremos\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"No.2 — El Torpedo\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"story\":\"Torpedo format (52 x 162mm) — the most perfectly balanced Cuban cigar according to many experts. The pyramidal shape creates a progressive aroma build. Notas dominantes de cedro, tostado avellana, soft especias. Duración: 90 minutos. Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 96/100.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.2\"],\"scores\":[{\"source\":\"Cigar Aficionado\",\"score\":96,\"year\":2022}]},{\"name\":\"No.4 — El Clásico\",\"color\":\"#A0522D\",\"story\":\"Petit Corona (42 x 129mm), el cigarro más vendido del mundo. Accesible, equilibrado, perfecto tanto para principiantes como para expertos. Notas de toast, cashew, white pimienta.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.4\"]},{\"name\":\"Línea 1935\",\"color\":\"#722F37\",\"story\":\"Creada para el 80º aniversario en 2015. A tribute to the origins — using Vuelta Abajo leaves selected per 1935 criteria. Spicier and fuller-bodied than the classic range. Permanent edition, limited production.\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Dumas\",\"Edmundo\",\"Maltes\"]},{\"name\":\"Supremos EL\",\"color\":\"#4A235A\",\"story\":\"Spanish regional edition, Supremos format (54 x 185mm). One of el más codiciado cigars among European coleccionistas. Producción anual inferior a 5.000 cajas. El tiempo de fumada supera las dos horas.\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado Oscuro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Supremos\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"No.2 — Der Torpedo\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"story\":\"Torpedo format (52 x 162mm) — the most perfectly balanced Cuban cigar according to many experts. The pyramidal shape creates a progressive aroma build. Dominante Noten von Zeder, geröstet Haselnuss, soft Gewürze. Dauer: 90 Minuten. Cigar Aficionado Score 96/100.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.2\"],\"scores\":[{\"source\":\"Cigar Aficionado\",\"score\":96,\"year\":2022}]},{\"name\":\"No.4 — Der Klassiker\",\"color\":\"#A0522D\",\"story\":\"Petit Corona (42 x 129mm), die meistverkaufte Zigarre der Welt. Zugänglich, ausgewogen, perfekt für Anfänger und Experten gleichermaßen. Noten von toast, cashew, white Pfeffer.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.4\"]},{\"name\":\"Línea 1935\",\"color\":\"#722F37\",\"story\":\"Zum 80. Jubiläum 2015 lanciert. A tribute to the origins — using Vuelta Abajo leaves selected per 1935 criteria. Spicier and fuller-bodied than the classic range. Permanent edition, limited production.\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Dumas\",\"Edmundo\",\"Maltes\"]},{\"name\":\"Supremos EL\",\"color\":\"#4A235A\",\"story\":\"Spanish regional edition, Supremos format (54 x 185mm). One of die begehrteste cigars among European collectors. Jahresproduktion unter 5.000 Kisten. Rauchdauer überschreitet zwei Stunden.\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado Oscuro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Supremos\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"No.2 — 鱼雷\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"story\":\"Torpedo format (52 x 162mm) — the most perfectly balanced Cuban cigar according to many experts. The pyramidal shape creates a progressive aroma build. 主导风味： 雪松木, 烘烤 榛子, soft 香料. 吸食时长：90分钟. 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 96/100.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.2\"],\"scores\":[{\"source\":\"Cigar Aficionado\",\"score\":96,\"year\":2022}]},{\"name\":\"No.4 — 经典款\",\"color\":\"#A0522D\",\"story\":\"Petit Corona (42 x 129mm), 全球销量最高的雪茄. 易入门，平衡，完美 适合新手和专家. 风味： toast, cashew, white 胡椒.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.4\"]},{\"name\":\"Línea 1935\",\"color\":\"#722F37\",\"story\":\"2015年为80周年推出. A tribute to the origins — using Vuelta Abajo leaves selected per 1935 criteria. Spicier and fuller-bodied than the classic range. Permanent edition, limited production.\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Dumas\",\"Edmundo\",\"Maltes\"]},{\"name\":\"Supremos EL\",\"color\":\"#4A235A\",\"story\":\"Spanish regional edition, Supremos format (54 x 185mm). One of 最受追捧的 cigars among European 收藏家. 年产量不足5000盒. 吸食时间超过两小时.\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado Oscuro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Supremos\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"No.2 — التوربيدو\",\"color\":\"#8B4513\",\"story\":\"Torpedo format (52 x 162mm) — the most perfectly balanced Cuban cigar according to many experts. The pyramidal shape creates a progressive aroma build. النكهات المهيمنة:  أرز, محمَّص بندق, soft توابل. مدة التدخين: 90 دقيقة. تقييم Cigar Aficionado 96/100.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.2\"],\"scores\":[{\"source\":\"Cigar Aficionado\",\"score\":96,\"year\":2022}]},{\"name\":\"No.4 — الكلاسيكي\",\"color\":\"#A0522D\",\"story\":\"Petit Corona (42 x 129mm), أكثر السيجار مبيعًا في العالم. سهل الوصول، متوازن، مثالي للمبتدئ والخبير على حدٍّ سواء. نكهات:  toast, cashew, white فلفل.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.4\"]},{\"name\":\"Línea 1935\",\"color\":\"#722F37\",\"story\":\"أُبدعت للذكرى الثمانين عام 2015. A tribute to the origins — using Vuelta Abajo leaves selected per 1935 criteria. Spicier and fuller-bodied than the classic range. Permanent edition, limited production.\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Dumas\",\"Edmundo\",\"Maltes\"]},{\"name\":\"Supremos EL\",\"color\":\"#4A235A\",\"story\":\"Spanish regional edition, Supremos format (54 x 185mm). One of الأكثر طلبًا cigars among European الجامعون. الإنتاج السنوي أقل من 5000 علبة. تتجاوز مدة التدخين ساعتين.\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado Oscuro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Supremos\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Alexandre Dumas\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of The Count of Monte Cristo never smoked these cigars — he died in 1870 — but his novel directly inspired the brand name. The Havana torcedors who read his work during rolling sessions inadvertently perpetuate his memory.\"}, {\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"The night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962, Kennedy sent his press secretary to buy 1,200 H. Upmann cigars. He signed the embargo the next day with his supply secure.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Alexandre Dumas\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of The Count of Monte Cristo never fumaba these cigars — he died in 1870 — but his novel directly inspired the brand name. The Havana torcedors who read his work during rolling sessions inadvertently perpetuate his memory.\"}, {\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"The night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962, Kennedy sent his press secretary to buy 1,200 H. Upmann cigars. He signed the embargo the next day with his supply secure.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Alexandre Dumas\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of The Count of Monte Cristo never rauchte these cigars — he died in 1870 — but his novel directly inspired the brand name. The Havana torcedors who read his work during rolling sessions inadvertently perpetuate his memory.\"}, {\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"The night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962, Kennedy sent his press secretary to buy 1,200 H. Upmann cigars. He signed the embargo the next day with his supply secure.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Alexandre Dumas\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of The Count of Monte Cristo never smoked these cigars — he died in 1870 — but his novel directly inspired the brand name. The Havana torcedors who read his work during rolling sessions inadvertently perpetuate his memory.\"}, {\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"The night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962, Kennedy sent his press secretary to buy 1,200 H. Upmann cigars. He signed the embargo the next day with his supply secure.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Alexandre Dumas\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of The Count of Monte Cristo never smoked these cigars — he died in 1870 — but his novel directly inspired the brand name. The Havana torcedors who read his work during rolling sessions inadvertently perpetuate his memory.\"}, {\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"The night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962, Kennedy sent his press secretary to buy 1,200 H. Upmann cigars. He signed the embargo the next day with his supply secure.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Rioja Gran Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The tannin of aged Rioja embraces the complexity of the No.2 in an Ibero-Cuban symphony.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenfarclas 25 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit notes find a perfect echo in the No.4. A pairing for great occasions.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Ristretto espresso\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of a ristretto highlights the spiced length of the No.2.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Vino\", \"name\": \"Rioja Gran Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The tannin of aged Rioja embraces the complexity of the No.2 in an Ibero-Cuban symphony.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenfarclas 25 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit notes find a perfect echo in the No.4. A pairing for great occasions.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Ristretto espresso\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of a ristretto highlights the spiced length of the No.2.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Wein\", \"name\": \"Rioja Gran Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The tannin of aged Rioja embraces the complexity of the No.2 in an Ibero-Cuban symphony.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenfarclas 25 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit notes find a perfect echo in the No.4. A pairing for great occasions.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Ristretto espresso\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of a ristretto highlights the spiced length of the No.2.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"葡萄酒\", \"name\": \"Rioja Gran Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The tannin of aged Rioja embraces the complexity of the No.2 in an Ibero-Cuban symphony.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Glenfarclas 25 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit notes find a perfect echo in the No.4. A pairing for great occasions.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Ristretto espresso\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of a ristretto highlights the spiced length of the No.2.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"النبيذ\", \"name\": \"Rioja Gran Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The tannin of aged Rioja embraces the complexity of the No.2 in an Ibero-Cuban symphony.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Glenfarclas 25 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit notes find a perfect echo in the No.4. A pairing for great occasions.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Ristretto espresso\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of a ristretto highlights the spiced length of the No.2.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Montecristo';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'There are two Montecristos, and many smokers do not know it. The brand, born in Havana in 1935, was nationalised in 1960; its owners left the island and took up the name outside Cuba. Since then a Cuban Montecristo and a non-Cuban Montecristo have coexisted, sold in different markets — the first everywhere except the United States, the second in the United States. Same name, near-identical band, two unrelated cigars.\n\nThe non-Cuban Montecristo is rolled in La Romana, in the largest premium cigar factory in the world. The scale changes everything: where a boutique house makes a few hundred thousand cigars a year, this plant counts them in tens of millions, with a consistency of manufacture that is in itself a technical feat.\n\nThe profile follows the Dominican tradition — light to medium, creamy, pale wrapper — where the Cuban is fuller and earthier. It is not a failed copy: it is another reading of the same name, made for another palate.', `history_es` = 'Existen dos Montecristo, y muchos fumadores lo ignoran. La marca, nacida en La Habana en 1935, fue nacionalizada en 1960; sus propietarios dejaron la isla y retomaron el nombre fuera de Cuba. Desde entonces conviven un Montecristo cubano y otro no cubano, vendidos en mercados distintos — el primero en todas partes salvo Estados Unidos, el segundo en Estados Unidos. Mismo nombre, vitola casi idéntica, dos cigarros sin relación.\n\nEl Montecristo no cubano se lía en La Romana, en la mayor fábrica de cigarros premium del mundo. La escala lo cambia todo: donde una casa boutique produce unos cientos de miles de cigarros al año, esta planta los cuenta por decenas de millones, con una regularidad de fabricación que es en sí una proeza técnica.\n\nEl perfil sigue la tradición dominicana — suave a medio, cremoso, capa clara — allí donde el cubano es más fuerte y más terroso. No es una copia fallida: es otra lectura del mismo nombre, hecha para otro paladar.', `history_de` = 'Es gibt zwei Montecristo, und viele Raucher wissen das nicht. Die 1935 in Havanna entstandene Marke wurde 1960 verstaatlicht; ihre Eigentümer verließen die Insel und nahmen den Namen außerhalb Kubas wieder auf. Seither bestehen ein kubanischer und ein nichtkubanischer Montecristo nebeneinander, verkauft auf verschiedenen Märkten — der erste überall außer in den Vereinigten Staaten, der zweite in den Vereinigten Staaten. Gleicher Name, nahezu gleiche Bauchbinde, zwei Zigarren ohne Verwandtschaft.\n\nDer nichtkubanische Montecristo wird in La Romana gerollt, in der größten Premium-Zigarrenmanufaktur der Welt. Der Maßstab verändert alles: Wo ein Boutique-Haus einige hunderttausend Zigarren im Jahr herstellt, zählt dieses Werk sie in Dutzenden Millionen — bei einer Fertigungskonstanz, die für sich genommen eine technische Leistung ist.\n\nDas Profil folgt der dominikanischen Tradition — leicht bis medium, cremig, helles Deckblatt — dort, wo die Kubanerin kräftiger und erdiger ist. Es ist keine missratene Kopie: Es ist eine andere Lesart desselben Namens, für einen anderen Gaumen gemacht.', `history_zh` = '世上有两个蒙特克里斯托，而许多烟客并不知道。这个1935年诞生于哈瓦那的品牌在1960年被国有化；其所有者离开该岛，在古巴之外重启了这个名字。此后，古巴的蒙特克里斯托与非古巴的蒙特克里斯托并存，在不同市场销售——前者行销除美国以外的各地，后者行销美国。同样的名字，几乎相同的烟标，两支毫无关系的雪茄。\n\n非古巴版的蒙特克里斯托在拉罗马纳卷制，那是世界上最大的优质雪茄工厂。规模改变了一切：精品厂一年产几十万支，而这座工厂以千万计，其制作的稳定性本身就是一项技术成就。\n\n其风格遵循多米尼加传统——轻至中度、奶润、浅色茄衣——而古巴那一支更浓、更带土味。这不是失败的仿制：这是同一个名字的另一种读法，为另一种味蕾而作。', `history_ar` = 'هناك مونتيكريستو اثنان، ولا يدري كثير من المدخّنين بذلك. فالعلامة التي وُلدت في هافانا سنة 1935 جرى تأميمها سنة 1960؛ فغادر أصحابها الجزيرة واستأنفوا الاسم خارج كوبا. ومنذ ذلك الحين يتعايش مونتيكريستو كوبي وآخر غير كوبي، يُباعان في سوقين مختلفتين — الأول في كل مكان عدا الولايات المتحدة، والثاني في الولايات المتحدة. الاسم نفسه، والشريط يكاد يكون نفسه، وسيجاران لا صلة بينهما.\n\nيُلفّ المونتيكريستو غير الكوبي في لا رومانا، داخل أكبر مصنع للسيجار الفاخر في العالم. والحجم يغيّر كل شيء: فحيث ينتج بيت صغير بضع مئات الآلاف سنوياً، يعدّها هذا المصنع بعشرات الملايين، بانتظام تصنيعٍ هو بحدّ ذاته إنجاز تقني.\n\nأمّا الطابع فيتبع التقليد الدومينيكي — خفيف إلى متوسط، قشدي، بغلاف فاتح — حيث الكوبي أقوى وأكثر ترابية. وليست هذه نسخة فاشلة: بل قراءة أخرى للاسم نفسه، صُنعت لذائقة أخرى.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Montecristo Classic\",\"color\":\"#D9C7A7\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Pale Connecticut wrapper, Dominican filler: cream, almond, cedar. The gentle profile that made the reputation of the Dominican cigar in the United States.\"},{\"name\":\"Montecristo White\",\"color\":\"#EFE6D5\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"Gentler still, almost milky. The morning cigar, or the one you hand to somebody who is starting out.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Montecristo Classic\",\"color\":\"#D9C7A7\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Capa clara del Connecticut, tripa dominicana: crema, almendra, cedro. El perfil suave que dio fama al cigarro dominicano en Estados Unidos.\"},{\"name\":\"Montecristo White\",\"color\":\"#EFE6D5\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade de Ecuador\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"Aún más suave, casi lácteo. El cigarro de la mañana, o el que se ofrece a quien empieza.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Montecristo Classic\",\"color\":\"#D9C7A7\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Helles Connecticut-Deckblatt, dominikanische Einlage: Sahne, Mandel, Zedernholz. Das sanfte Profil, das den Ruf der dominikanischen Zigarre in den Vereinigten Staaten begründete.\"},{\"name\":\"Montecristo White\",\"color\":\"#EFE6D5\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade aus Ecuador\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"Noch sanfter, fast milchig. Die Zigarre für den Morgen — oder die, die man jemandem reicht, der anfängt.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Montecristo Classic\",\"color\":\"#D9C7A7\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"浅色康涅狄格茄衣，多米尼加茄芯：奶油、杏仁、雪松。正是这种柔和风格让多米尼加雪茄在美国声名鹊起。\"},{\"name\":\"Montecristo White\",\"color\":\"#EFE6D5\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"厄瓜多尔 Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"更柔和，近乎奶感。清晨的雪茄，或是递给初入门者的那一支。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Montecristo Classic\",\"color\":\"#D9C7A7\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"غلاف كونيتيكت فاتح وحشوة دومينيكية: قشدة ولوز وأرز. الطابع اللطيف الذي صنع سمعة السيجار الدومينيكي في الولايات المتحدة.\"},{\"name\":\"Montecristo White\",\"color\":\"#EFE6D5\",\"force\":\"Light\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Shade إكوادوري\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona\"],\"story\":\"ألطف بعد، يكاد يكون حليبياً. سيجار الصباح، أو ذاك الذي تقدّمه لمن يبدأ للتوّ.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Coffee\",\"name\":\"Mild filter coffee\",\"notes\":\"A light coffee does not cover the cream and lets it settle.\"},{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"White agricole rum\",\"notes\":\"Its green nerve avoids the slack effect a sweet rum produces on an already gentle cigar.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Café de filtro suave\",\"notes\":\"Un café ligero no tapa la crema y la deja instalarse.\"},{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Ron blanco agrícola\",\"notes\":\"Su nervio vegetal evita el efecto blando que produce un ron dulce sobre un cigarro ya suave.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Milder Filterkaffee\",\"notes\":\"Ein leichter Kaffee überdeckt die Sahnigkeit nicht und lässt sie sich entfalten.\"},{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Weißer Rhum agricole\",\"notes\":\"Sein grüner Nerv verhindert jene Weichheit, die ein süßer Rum bei einer ohnehin sanften Zigarre erzeugt.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"清淡滤泡咖啡\",\"notes\":\"清淡的咖啡不会盖住奶油感，反而让它安顿下来。\"},{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"农业型白朗姆\",\"notes\":\"它的草本筋骨避免了甜朗姆在本已柔和的雪茄上造成的松垮。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة مرشَّحة خفيفة\",\"notes\":\"القهوة الخفيفة لا تغطّي القشدة بل تتيح لها أن تستقرّ.\"},{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"روم زراعي أبيض\",\"notes\":\"عصبه العشبي يتجنّب الترهّل الذي يُحدثه روم حلو على سيجار لطيف أصلاً.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Montecristo Dominicain';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'José \'Pepin\' García is the figure through whom Cuban tobacco knowledge entered Nicaraguan production at the highest level. He grew up in Cuba, trained in the rolling rooms of Havana\'s great factories during the era when Cuban cigars were still the uncontested standard, and developed a palate and a blending instinct that would have made him a master blender for any Cuban house.\r\n\r\nHe left Cuba in 2003, arriving in Miami in circumstances he has never discussed in detail. He set up a small rolling operation called El Rey de los Habanos with equipment that barely fit the available space. Word spread immediately among Miami\'s cigar community that a Cuban master was producing cigars by hand, available directly from the workshop. The enthusiasm was not nostalgia for Cuba — it was recognition that someone with a specific set of skills was suddenly, unexpectedly, available.\r\n\r\nIn 2008, Pepin moved with his son Jaime to Estelí in Nicaragua, where they established My Father Cigars. The name was Jaime\'s choice — a tribute made public in commercial form. The house launched its first production that year, and the result was immediate and unprecedented: My Father Le Bijou 1922 earned the #1 Cigar of the Year from Cigar Aficionado, the highest ranking a publication with that readership can bestow. No house in the magazine\'s history had achieved it in its first year of operation.\r\n\r\nIn 2012, the El Centurion Robusto repeated the feat. Two number-one rankings in four years, from a two-person operation based in a building Pepin and Jaime had constructed themselves.\r\n\r\nThe technical explanation for this record is straightforward to describe and impossible to fully replicate: Pepin García rolls the prototype vitolas himself. He does not write down formulas. He blends by demonstration, by adjustment, by his hands\' memory of what correct density and draw feel like. Every My Father vitola in commercial production was personally approved through Pepin\'s hands before anyone else touched it. The cigars carry his craft in the most literal sense possible.', `history_es` = 'José \'Pepin\' García, el torcedor más celebrado de su generación, abandonó Cuba en 2003. En 2008 lanzó My Father Cigars en Estelí con su hijo Jaime. Ese mismo año obtuvo el #1 Cigarro del Año de Cigar Aficionado — un logro sin precedentes para una casa menor de un año. En 2012 repitió el feat. Dos #1 en cuatro años para una empresa de dos hombres.', `history_de` = 'José \'Pepin\' García, der gefeierte Torcedor seiner Generation, verließ Kuba 2003. 2008 gründete er mit seinem Sohn Jaime My Father Cigars in Estelí. Im selben Jahr gewann er die #1 Zigarre des Jahres im Cigar Aficionado — ein beispielloses Ergebnis für ein unter einjähriges Haus. 2012 wiederholte er das Kunststück.', `history_zh` = '何塞·\'佩平\'·加西亚，他那一代最受赞誉的卷制师，于2003年离开古巴。2008年与儿子海梅在埃斯特利创立了我的父亲雪茄。同年获得雪茄爱好者年度第一名——对于一个不满一岁的品牌来说前所未有。2012年再度夺冠。四年内两次第一，只有两个人的公司。', `history_ar` = 'خوسيه \'بيبين\' غارسيا، أبرز ملفِّف في جيله، غادر كوبا عام 2003. عام 2008 أسّس مع ابنه خايمي ماي فاذر سيغار في إستيلي. في العام ذاته فاز بجائزة السيجار رقم 1 من Cigar Aficionado — إنجاز غير مسبوق لدار عمرها أقل من عام. كرّر الأمر عام 2012.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Le Bijou 1922\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Cigar of the Year #1 Cigar Aficionado 2012. Torpedo (52 x 152mm). Complex Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Habano oscuro wrapper. Notes of red cedar, macchiato coffee, cubebs pepper. The house\'s absolute reference — each lot is awaited like a Bordeaux vintage.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Petit Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Magnum\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2013}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"My Father No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2008, inaugural cigar. Score 96 at launch. Ecuadorian Connecticut natural wrapper over Nicaraguan. Notes of cream, hazelnut, light spices. Despite its \'first cigar\' status, the No.1 has remained in the top 10 annually for 15 years — proof that Pepin had it right from the start.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Belicoso\", \"Churchill\", \"Juniors\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2008}]}, {\"name\": \"La Antiguedad\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Tribute to pre-revolution Cuban factories. Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over aged Nicaraguan. Notes of dark chocolate, cold coffee, molasses. Sweeter than Le Bijou, more accessible, equally remarkable. The Maduro entry point into the My Father universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Le Bijou 1922\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Cigar of the Year #1 Cigar Aficionado 2012. Torpedo (52 x 152mm). Complex Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Habano oscuro wrapper. Notas de red cedro, macchiato café, cubebs pimienta. La referencia absoluta de la casa — cada lote se espera como una añada de Burdeos.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Petit Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Magnum\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2013}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"My Father No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2008, inaugural cigar. Score 96 at launch. Ecuadorian Connecticut natural wrapper over Nicaraguan. Notas de cream, avellana, light especias. Despite its \'first cigar\' status, the No.1 has remained in the top 10 annually for 15 years — proof that Pepin had it right from the start.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Belicoso\", \"Churchill\", \"Juniors\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2008}]}, {\"name\": \"La Antiguedad\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Tribute to pre-revolution Cuban factories. Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over aged Nicaraguan. Notas de chocolate negro, cold café, molasses. Sweeter than Le Bijou, more accessible, equally remarkable. The Maduro entry point into the My Father universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Le Bijou 1922\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Cigar of the Year #1 Cigar Aficionado 2012. Torpedo (52 x 152mm). Complex Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Habano oscuro wrapper. Noten von red Zeder, macchiato Kaffee, cubebs Pfeffer. The house\'s absolute reference — each lot is awaited like a Bordeaux vintage.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Petit Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Magnum\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2013}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"My Father No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2008, inaugural cigar. Score 96 at launch. Ecuadorian Connecticut natural wrapper over Nicaraguan. Noten von cream, Haselnuss, light Gewürze. Despite its \'first cigar\' status, the No.1 has remained in the top 10 annually for 15 years — proof that Pepin had it right from the start.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Belicoso\", \"Churchill\", \"Juniors\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2008}]}, {\"name\": \"La Antiguedad\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Tribute to pre-revolution Cuban factories. Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over aged Nicaraguan. Noten von dunkle Schokolade, cold Kaffee, molasses. Sweeter than Le Bijou, more accessible, equally remarkable. The Maduro entry point into the My Father universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Le Bijou 1922\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Cigar of the Year #1 Cigar Aficionado 2012. Torpedo (52 x 152mm). Complex Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Habano oscuro wrapper. 风味： red 雪松木, macchiato 咖啡, cubebs 胡椒. The house\'s absolute reference — 每批次都像波尔多年份酒一样被期待.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Petit Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Magnum\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2013}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"My Father No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2008, inaugural cigar. Score 96 at launch. Ecuadorian Connecticut natural wrapper over Nicaraguan. 风味： cream, 榛子, light 香料. Despite its \'first cigar\' status, the No.1 has remained in the top 10 annually for 15 years — proof that Pepin had it right from the start.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Belicoso\", \"Churchill\", \"Juniors\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2008}]}, {\"name\": \"La Antiguedad\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Tribute to pre-revolution Cuban factories. Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over aged Nicaraguan. 风味： 黑巧克力, cold 咖啡, molasses. Sweeter than Le Bijou, more accessible, equally remarkable. The Maduro entry point into the My Father universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Le Bijou 1922\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Cigar of the Year #1 Cigar Aficionado 2012. Torpedo (52 x 152mm). Complex Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Habano oscuro wrapper. نكهات:  red أرز, macchiato قهوة, cubebs فلفل. The house\'s absolute reference — كل دُفعة مُنتَظَرة كأنها منتج بوردو المميَّز.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Petit Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Magnum\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2013}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"My Father No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2008, inaugural cigar. Score 96 at launch. Ecuadorian Connecticut natural wrapper over Nicaraguan. نكهات:  cream, بندق, light توابل. Despite its \'first cigar\' status, the No.1 has remained in the top 10 annually for 15 years — proof that Pepin had it right from the start.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Belicoso\", \"Churchill\", \"Juniors\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2008}]}, {\"name\": \"La Antiguedad\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Tribute to pre-revolution Cuban factories. Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over aged Nicaraguan. نكهات:  شوكولاتة داكنة, cold قهوة, molasses. Sweeter than Le Bijou, more accessible, equally remarkable. The Maduro entry point into the My Father universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"José \'Pepin\' García\", \"anecdote\": \"Pepin is the only torcedor in the world to have founded two houses that each earned the #1 Cigar of the Year — El Rey de los Habanos with Don Pepin García Blue Label in 2007, then My Father in 2012. His son Jaime now runs operations while Pepin, past 70, continues rolling prototypes.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"José \'Pepin\' García\", \"anecdote\": \"Pepin es el único torcedor in the world to have founded two houses that each earned the #1 Cigar of the Year — El Rey de los Habanos with Don Pepin García Blue Label in 2007, then My Father in 2012. His son Jaime now runs operations while Pepin, past 70, continues rolling prototypes.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"José \'Pepin\' García\", \"anecdote\": \"Pepin is the only torcedor in the world to have founded two houses that each earned the #1 Cigar of the Year — El Rey de los Habanos with Don Pepin García Blue Label in 2007, then My Father in 2012. His son Jaime now runs operations while Pepin, past 70, continues rolling prototypes.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"José \'Pepin\' García\", \"anecdote\": \"Pepin 是唯一 torcedor 在世界上 to have founded two houses that each earned the #1 Cigar of the Year — El Rey de los Habanos with Don Pepin García Blue Label in 2007, then My Father in 2012. His son Jaime now runs operations while Pepin, past 70, continues rolling prototypes.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"José \'Pepin\' García\", \"anecdote\": \"Pepin هو الوحيد torcedor في العالم to have founded two houses that each earned the #1 Cigar of the Year — El Rey de los Habanos with Don Pepin García Blue Label in 2007, then My Father in 2012. His son Jaime now runs operations while Pepin, past 70, continues rolling prototypes.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña Centenario 25 years\", \"notes\": \"25-year-aged Nicaraguan rum meets 4-year-aged Nicaraguan tobacco blend. Terroir pairing, shared depth of cocoa and cane.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Jinotega single origin\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same Estelí hills. Twin notes of dark fruit and cocoa found identically in Le Bijou.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Ron\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña Centenario 25 years\", \"notes\": \"25-year-aged Nicaraguan rum meets 4-year-aged Nicaraguan tobacco blend. Maridaje de terroir, shared depth of cocoa and cane.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Jinotega single origin\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same Estelí hills. Twin notas de dark fruit and cocoa found identically in Le Bijou.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña Centenario 25 years\", \"notes\": \"25-year-aged Nicaraguan rum meets 4-year-aged Nicaraguan tobacco blend. Terroir-Paarung, shared depth of cocoa and cane.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Jinotega single origin\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same Estelí hills. Twin Noten von dark fruit and cocoa found identically in Le Bijou.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"朗姆酒\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña Centenario 25 years\", \"notes\": \"25-year-aged Nicaraguan rum meets 4-year-aged Nicaraguan tobacco blend. 风土搭配, shared depth of cocoa and cane.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Jinotega single origin\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same Estelí hills. Twin 风味： dark fruit and cocoa found identically in Le Bijou.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الروم\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña Centenario 25 years\", \"notes\": \"25-year-aged Nicaraguan rum meets 4-year-aged Nicaraguan tobacco blend. مقارنة التربة, shared depth of cocoa and cane.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Jinotega single origin\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same Estelí hills. Twin نكهات: dark fruit and cocoa found identically in Le Bijou.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'My Father';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Oliva family story begins in Pinar del Río Province, Cuba, in 1886 — when the family first planted tobacco in the western end of the island that would eventually become recognized as Vuelta Abajo, the world\'s most celebrated tobacco-growing region. For over sixty years, the Olivas grew tobacco in that red soil, developing the cultivation knowledge that their descendants would carry into exile.\r\n\r\nWhen Oswaldo Oliva left Cuba after the revolution, he brought seeds, agricultural knowledge, and the understanding that good tobacco required specific conditions to express its quality. After periods in Honduras and Miami, he established plantations in Nicaragua\'s Jalapa Valley in 1968 — a growing region where the combination of volcanic soil, altitude, and consistent humidity creates conditions that experienced tasters recognize as the closest analog to Vuelta Abajo outside Cuba.\r\n\r\nFor nearly three decades, Oliva was the industry\'s best-kept open secret. If you smoked a premium Nicaraguan or Honduran cigar between 1970 and 1995, there was a reasonable probability that the leaf in your hand had been grown on Oliva land and sold to the manufacturer who put their name on the band. Davidoff, Padrón, Ashton, and dozens of others sourced Oliva leaf. The family sold it without complaint and without publicity. They were growers, not brand builders.\r\n\r\nThe third generation changed that calculation. In 1995, convinced that the family\'s leaf quality deserved its own identity, they launched Oliva Cigars. The Serie V, introduced in 2004, announced the brand\'s ambitions immediately: a 97-point score from Cigar Aficionado established it as the reference for full-body Nicaraguan cigars. The Melanio followed in 2014 with 99 points — the highest score ever given to a Nicaraguan cigar in the publication\'s history.\r\n\r\nThe family\'s structural advantage is ownership. Every leaf that goes into an Oliva cigar was grown on family-owned land in Jalapa or Estelí. Gilberto Oliva Jr. inspects his plantations personally, on horseback, every growing season. This connection between the family and the soil has produced a consistency of quality across three decades of commercial production that no contract-sourcing arrangement can match.', `history_es` = 'La familia Oliva cultiva tabaco desde 1886 en Cuba. Oswaldo Oliva se instaló en Nicaragua en 1968, estableciendo plantaciones en el Valle de Jalapa. Durante décadas fue el proveedor secreto del sector. En 1995 lanzó sus propios cigarros. La Serie V (2004) obtuvo un 97 en CA, y el Melanio alcanzó 99 en 2014 — el mejor no-cubano jamás evaluado entonces.', `history_de` = 'Die Familie Oliva baut seit 1886 in Kuba Tabak an. Oswaldo Oliva ließ sich 1968 in Nicaragua nieder und legte Plantagen im Jalapa-Tal an. Jahrzehntelang war sie der geheime Lieferant der Branche. 1995 lancierte sie eigene Zigarren. Die Serie V (2004) erzielte eine 97 im CA, und der Melanio erreichte 2014 eine 99 — damals die beste Bewertung für eine Nicht-Kuba-Zigarre.', `history_zh` = '奥利瓦家族自1886年起在古巴种植烟草。奥斯瓦尔多·奥利瓦于1968年定居尼加拉瓜，在哈拉帕谷建立种植园。数十年来一直是行业的秘密供应商。1995年推出自己的雪茄。V系列（2004年）在CA获97分，Melanio于2014年达到99分——当时非古巴雪茄的最高评分。', `history_ar` = 'زرعت عائلة أوليفا التبغ في كوبا منذ 1886. استقر أوسفالدو أوليفا في نيكاراغوا عام 1968، مؤسِّسًا مزارع في وادي خالابا. لعقود كانت المورِّد السري للقطاع. عام 1995 أطلقت سيجارها الخاص. حازت السيري V (2004) على 97 في CA، ووصل ميلانيو إلى 99 عام 2014 — أعلى تقييم لسيجار غير كوبي آنذاك.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Serie V\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2004, Cigar Aficionado score 97. The Melanio (52 x 143mm) is the flagship — score 99 in 2014, the best non-Cuban ever rated at the time. Ecuadorian Sumatra wrapper over double Nicaraguan ligero. Notes of intense black pepper, coffee, macadamia nut, interminable finish.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sumatra\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Double Toro\", \"Melanio\", \"Figurado\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 99, \"year\": 2014}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2004}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie G\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Cameroon wrapper over Nicaraguan. Oliva\'s middle range — less bold than the Serie V, more complex than the Serie O. Notes of cashew, cedar, soft spices. The No.4 Robusto format is particularly well-balanced. The ideal entry into the Oliva universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"African Cameroon\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.4\", \"No.5\", \"No.7\", \"Belicoso\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nub\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Revolutionary concept launched in 2008: very short (3.75 inches) but very wide (54 or 60 ring gauge) cigars. The idea: the \'golden zone\' of a cigar is the center third — why not start there immediately? The Nub gives instant access to maximum complexity. The concept has since been copied by many houses.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"358\", \"460\", \"464\", \"Habano\", \"Connecticut\", \"Cameroon\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Serie V\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2004, Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 97. The Melanio (52 x 143mm) is the flagship — puntuación 99 in 2014, the best non-Cuban ever rated at the time. Ecuadorian Sumatra wrapper over double Nicaraguan ligero. Notas de intense pimienta negra, café, macadamia nut, interminable finish.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sumatra\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Double Toro\", \"Melanio\", \"Figurado\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 99, \"year\": 2014}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2004}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie G\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Cameroon wrapper over Nicaraguan. Oliva\'s middle range — less bold than the Serie V, more complex than the Serie O. Notas de cashew, cedro, soft especias. The No.4 Robusto format is particularly well-balanced. La entrada ideal al universo the Oliva universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"African Cameroon\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.4\", \"No.5\", \"No.7\", \"Belicoso\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nub\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Revolutionary concept launched in 2008: very short (3.75 inches) but very wide (54 or 60 ring gauge) cigars. The idea: the \'golden zone\' of a cigar is the center third — why not start there immediately? The Nub gives instant access to maximum complexity. The concept has since been copied by many houses.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"358\", \"460\", \"464\", \"Habano\", \"Connecticut\", \"Cameroon\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Serie V\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2004, Cigar Aficionado Score 97. The Melanio (52 x 143mm) is the flagship — score 99 in 2014, the best non-Cuban ever rated at the time. Ecuadorian Sumatra wrapper over double Nicaraguan ligero. Noten von intense schwarzer Pfeffer, Kaffee, macadamia nut, interminable finish.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sumatra\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Double Toro\", \"Melanio\", \"Figurado\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 99, \"year\": 2014}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2004}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie G\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Cameroon wrapper over Nicaraguan. Oliva\'s middle range — less bold than the Serie V, more complex than the Serie O. Noten von cashew, Zeder, soft Gewürze. The No.4 Robusto format is particularly well-balanced. Der ideale Einstieg in the Oliva universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"African Cameroon\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.4\", \"No.5\", \"No.7\", \"Belicoso\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nub\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Revolutionary concept launched in 2008: very short (3.75 inches) but very wide (54 or 60 ring gauge) cigars. The idea: the \'golden zone\' of a cigar is the center third — why not start there immediately? The Nub gives instant access to maximum complexity. The concept has since been copied by many houses.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"358\", \"460\", \"464\", \"Habano\", \"Connecticut\", \"Cameroon\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Serie V\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2004, 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 97. The Melanio (52 x 143mm) is the flagship — score 99 in 2014, the best non-Cuban ever rated at the time. Ecuadorian Sumatra wrapper over double Nicaraguan ligero. 风味： intense 黑胡椒, 咖啡, macadamia nut, interminable finish.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sumatra\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Double Toro\", \"Melanio\", \"Figurado\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 99, \"year\": 2014}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2004}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie G\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Cameroon wrapper over Nicaraguan. Oliva\'s middle range — less bold than the Serie V, more complex than the Serie O. 风味： cashew, 雪松木, soft 香料. The No.4 Robusto format is particularly well-balanced. 进入 Oliva universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"African Cameroon\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.4\", \"No.5\", \"No.7\", \"Belicoso\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nub\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Revolutionary concept launched in 2008: very short (3.75 inches) but very wide (54 or 60 ring gauge) cigars. The idea: the \'golden zone\' of a cigar is the center third — why not start there immediately? The Nub gives instant access to maximum complexity. The concept has since been copied by many houses.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"358\", \"460\", \"464\", \"Habano\", \"Connecticut\", \"Cameroon\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Serie V\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2004, تقييم Cigar Aficionado 97. The Melanio (52 x 143mm) is the flagship — score 99 in 2014, the best non-Cuban ever rated at the time. Ecuadorian Sumatra wrapper over double Nicaraguan ligero. نكهات:  intense فلفل أسود, قهوة, macadamia nut, interminable finish.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sumatra\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Double Toro\", \"Melanio\", \"Figurado\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 99, \"year\": 2014}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 97, \"year\": 2004}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie G\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Cameroon wrapper over Nicaraguan. Oliva\'s middle range — less bold than the Serie V, more complex than the Serie O. نكهات:  cashew, أرز, soft توابل. The No.4 Robusto format is particularly well-balanced. المدخل المثالي إلى عالم Oliva universe.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"African Cameroon\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.4\", \"No.5\", \"No.7\", \"Belicoso\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nub\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Revolutionary concept launched in 2008: very short (3.75 inches) but very wide (54 or 60 ring gauge) cigars. The idea: the \'golden zone\' of a cigar is the center third — why not start there immediately? The Nub gives instant access to maximum complexity. The concept has since been copied by many houses.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"358\", \"460\", \"464\", \"Habano\", \"Connecticut\", \"Cameroon\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Gilberto Oliva Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fourth-generation heir, he visits his Jalapa plantations on horseback every harvest month. He systematically refuses outside investors: \'When you give up your freedom, you give up your taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Gilberto Oliva Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fourth-generation heir, he visits his Jalapa plantations on horseback every harvest month. He systematically refuses outside investors: \'When you give up your freedom, you give up your taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Gilberto Oliva Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fourth-generation heir, he visits his Jalapa plantations on horseback every harvest month. He systematically refuses outside investors: \'When you give up your freedom, you give up your taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Gilberto Oliva Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fourth-generation heir, he visits his Jalapa plantations on horseback every harvest month. He systematically refuses outside investors: \'When you give up your freedom, you give up your taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Gilberto Oliva Jr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fourth-generation heir, he visits his Jalapa plantations on horseback every harvest month. He systematically refuses outside investors: \'When you give up your freedom, you give up your taste.\'\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Buffalo Trace Bourbon\", \"notes\": \"The American bourbon, with its vanilla and toasted oak notes, perfectly complements the peppery power of a Serie V Melanio.\"}, {\"type\": \"Beer\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Toña Cerveza\", \"notes\": \"The local beer, light and refreshing, is the everyday pairing of the plantation workers themselves after a day in the fields.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Buffalo Trace Bourbon\", \"notes\": \"The American bourbon, with its vanilla and toasted oak notes, perfectly complements the peppery power of a Serie V Melanio.\"}, {\"type\": \"Cerveza\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Toña Cerveza\", \"notes\": \"The local beer, light and refreshing, is the everyday pairing of the plantation workers themselves after a day in the fields.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Buffalo Trace Bourbon\", \"notes\": \"The American bourbon, with its vanilla and toasted oak notes, perfectly complements the peppery power of a Serie V Melanio.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bier\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Toña Cerveza\", \"notes\": \"The local beer, light and refreshing, is the everyday pairing of the plantation workers themselves after a day in the fields.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Buffalo Trace Bourbon\", \"notes\": \"The American bourbon, with its vanilla and toasted oak notes, perfectly complements the peppery power of a Serie V Melanio.\"}, {\"type\": \"啤酒\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Toña Cerveza\", \"notes\": \"The local beer, light and refreshing, is the everyday pairing of the plantation workers themselves after a day in the fields.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Buffalo Trace Bourbon\", \"notes\": \"The American bourbon, with its vanilla and toasted oak notes, perfectly complements the peppery power of a Serie V Melanio.\"}, {\"type\": \"البيرة\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Toña Cerveza\", \"notes\": \"The local beer, light and refreshing, is the everyday pairing of the plantation workers themselves after a day in the fields.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Oliva';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The conventional wisdom about Oliva is that it means power. The Serie V, the Master Blends, the Melanio — these are cigars built around Nicaraguan intensity, the earthy pepper-driven profile that made the Jalapa Valley\'s reputation. When Oliva decided to build a Connecticut Reserve line, it was entering territory many assumed was foreign to the house\'s competence and identity.\r\n\r\nThe result demonstrated that the conventional wisdom was incomplete. The Connecticut Reserve uses an Ecuadorian Connecticut shade wrapper grown at high altitude in the Ecuadorian Andes — conditions that produce a leaf with more character than American Connecticut while preserving the shade-grown creaminess that defines the style. This wrapper, sourced from the same farms that supply several premium Davidoff lines, goes over a Nicaraguan filler blend lighter than anything in the core Oliva catalog.\r\n\r\nWhat Oliva brings to this formula that other Connecticut-style cigars cannot match is its sourcing precision. The company owns its Nicaraguan farms outright — the Jalapa and Estelí plots that supply the entire Oliva catalog. This allows them to select, from within their own inventory, lighter, earlier-harvested leaves that would be unsuitable for the Serie V but are perfectly calibrated for a medium-light blend. The result is a cigar that delivers genuine complexity — cream, toasted grain, vanilla, light cedar — without the weight that would overwhelm a morning smoke or a first cigar of the evening.\r\n\r\nThe Connecticut Reserve challenged the assumption that premium Nicaraguan houses could only produce intensity. It also introduced the Oliva name to a segment of smokers who had avoided the catalog entirely on the basis of its reputation. The range\'s consistent performance across multiple Cigar Aficionado reviews — scores between 89 and 92 — validated the strategy.', `history_es` = 'La Connecticut Reserve de Oliva demuestra que la casa nicaragüense puede producir los cigarros más suaves del mercado con la misma excelencia que sus gamas full body. Envolvente Connecticut Shade ecuatoriano sobre blend nicaragüense ligero. Notas de crema, cereales tostados, vainilla ligera.', `history_de` = 'Die Connecticut Reserve von Oliva beweist, dass das nicaraguanische Haus die sanftesten Zigarren des Marktes mit derselben Exzellenz produzieren kann wie seine Full-Body-Serien. Ecuadorianischer Connecticut-Shade-Wrapper über nicaraguanischem Leicht-Blend. Noten von Sahne, gerösteten Getreide, leichter Vanille.', `history_zh` = '奥利瓦的康涅狄格珍藏系列证明，这家尼加拉瓜品牌能以与其Full Body系列同等的卓越品质，生产市场上最柔和的雪茄。厄瓜多尔康涅狄格遮阴茄衣覆盖轻盈尼加拉瓜混合烟叶。奶油、烤谷物、淡淡香草风味。', `history_ar` = 'تُثبت كونيكتيكت ريزيرف من أوليفا أن الدار النيكاراغوية قادرة على إنتاج أنعم السيجار في السوق بالتميز ذاته لتشكيلاتها الكاملة الجسم. غلاف Connecticut Shade الإكوادوري فوق خلطة نيكاراغوية خفيفة.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Connecticut Reserve\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade wrapper over light Nicaraguan filler. Notes of cream, toast, vanilla. Very approachable light-medium. Robusto format recommended for a full evolution — 45 minutes of Nicaraguan mildness.\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\",\"Corona\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Connecticut Reserve\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"Capa Connecticut Shade ecuatoriana sobre tripa nicaragüense ligera. Notas de nata, pan tostado y vainilla. Ligero-medio muy accesible. Se recomienda el formato Robusto para una evolución completa: 45 minutos de suavidad nicaragüense.\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\",\"Corona\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Connecticut Reserve\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"Ecuadorianisches Connecticut-Shade-Deckblatt über leichter nicaraguanischer Einlage. Noten von Sahne, Toast und Vanille. Sehr zugängliches Leicht-Medium. Für eine vollständige Entwicklung empfiehlt sich das Robusto-Format — 45 Minuten nicaraguanischer Milde.\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\",\"Corona\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Connecticut Reserve\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"厄瓜多尔 Connecticut Shade 茄衣，配轻盈的尼加拉瓜填充。奶油、烤面包与香草的气息。轻至中度，极易入口。想看到完整演变，推荐 Robusto 规格——45 分钟的尼加拉瓜柔和。\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\",\"Corona\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Connecticut Reserve\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"غلاف Connecticut Shade إكوادوري على حشوة نيكاراغوية خفيفة. لمسات من القشدة والخبز المحمَّص والفانيليا. خفيف–متوسط سهل التناول جداً. ويُنصح بطراز Robusto لتطوّر كامل — خمس وأربعون دقيقة من النعومة النيكاراغوية.\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\",\"Corona\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'Oliva Connecticut Reserve';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Serie G occupies a specific and important position in the Oliva catalog: it is the range that answers the question of what a Cameroon wrapper does to Nicaraguan tobacco when both are selected with the precision the company brings to its premium lines.\r\n\r\nCameroonian wrapper over Nicaraguan Jalapa filler is not an unusual combination — it appears across the premium market — but the specific execution matters enormously. The leaves sourced by Oliva for the Serie G represent the Centre province\'s mid-tier production: darker and more complex than what goes into standard market Cameroon cigars, but without the cost structure of the AVO XO selections that appear in more expensive ranges. The result is a wrapper that delivers chocolate and mild spice at a price point that justifies daily smoking.\r\n\r\nThe Nicaraguan filler from Jalapa — harvested from Oliva\'s own farms — adds the house\'s characteristic earthy depth beneath the Cameroon sweetness. The combination produces a profile that sits at Medium-Full without the aggressive power of the Serie V: hazelnut and milk chocolate lead, transitioning through coffee and cedar toward a finish of mild pepper and dried fruit. It is a cigar that holds complexity across its entire length without sudden intensity spikes.\r\n\r\nThe Serie G was designed as the entry point to the Oliva experience — the range that introduces new smokers to what Nicaraguan tobacco from Jalapa can do before they graduate to the fuller expressions of the Serie V and Melanio. In practice, it has also become the range that experienced smokers return to when they want premium quality without the physical demand of a full-body smoke. This dual role — gateway and destination — is what makes the Serie G commercially important beyond its position as the catalog\'s most accessible line.', `history_es` = 'La Serie G de Oliva es la gama entrada premium con envolvente camerunés sobre tabaco nicaragüense de Jalapa. Notas de avellana, chocolate con leche, café crema. La puerta de entrada al universo Oliva.', `history_de` = 'Die Serie G von Oliva ist die Premium-Einstiegslinie mit kamerunischem Wrapper über nicaraguanischem Jalapa-Tabak. Noten von Haselnuss, Milchschokolade, Kaffeecreme. Die Eingangstür zum Oliva-Universum.', `history_zh` = '奥利瓦的Serie G是高端入门系列，使用喀麦隆茄衣包裹尼加拉瓜哈拉帕烟叶。榛子、牛奶巧克力、咖啡奶油风味。进入奥利瓦世界的大门。', `history_ar` = 'السيري G من أوليفا هي التشكيلة المدخل الفاخر بغلاف كاميروني فوق تبغ خالابا النيكاراغوي. نكهات البندق والشوكولاتة بالحليب وكريمة القهوة. بوابة الدخول إلى عالم أوليفا.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Serie G\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Cameroonian wrapper over Nicaraguan filler from Jalapa. Notes of hazelnut, milk chocolate, café crème. Balanced medium-full. The No.4 (Robusto) is the most popular size. The house\'s affordable entry without sacrificing the quality of the Jalapa terroir.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.4\",\"No.5\",\"No.7\",\"Belicoso\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Serie G\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Capa camerunesa sobre tripa nicaragüense de Jalapa. Notas de avellana, chocolate con leche y café con crema. Medio-pleno equilibrado. El formato No.4 (Robusto) es el más popular. La opción asequible de la casa sin sacrificar la calidad del terruño de Jalapa.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.4\",\"No.5\",\"No.7\",\"Belicoso\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Serie G\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"Kamerun-Deckblatt über nicaraguanischer Einlage aus Jalapa. Noten von Haselnuss, Milchschokolade und Milchkaffee. Ausgewogenes Medium bis kräftig. Das Format No.4 (Robusto) ist das beliebteste. Der erschwingliche Zugang des Hauses, ohne die Güte des Jalapa-Terroirs zu opfern.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.4\",\"No.5\",\"No.7\",\"Belicoso\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Serie G\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"喀麦隆茄衣，配来自 Jalapa 的尼加拉瓜填充。榛果、牛奶巧克力与奶咖的气息。均衡的中至浓。No.4（Robusto）是最受欢迎的规格。这是这家老号价格亲民的一面，却没有牺牲 Jalapa 风土的品质。\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.4\",\"No.5\",\"No.7\",\"Belicoso\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Serie G\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"غلاف كاميروني على حشوة نيكاراغوية من Jalapa. لمسات من البندق وشوكولاتة الحليب والقهوة بالقشدة. متوسط إلى كامل ومتوازن. وطراز No.4 (Robusto) هو الأكثر رواجاً. إنه الوجه الميسور للدار دون التضحية بجودة أرض Jalapa.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"African Cameroon\",\"vitolas\":[\"No.4\",\"No.5\",\"No.7\",\"Belicoso\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'Oliva Serie G';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'José Orlando Padrón left Cuba in 1961, one of hundreds of thousands who departed after the revolution with skills but little else. He settled in Miami with the conviction that had sustained his family through three generations of tobacco cultivation: that the quality of what you put in the ground, and the patience with which you let it develop, determines everything about what eventually goes into the humidor.\r\n\r\nIn 1964, he founded Padrón Cigars with six hundred dollars in savings and a rented space in Miami. The early years were defined by two things: genuine commercial struggle and violence. The factory was bombed twice by Cuban exile groups who viewed Padrón\'s success with Nicaraguan tobacco — a country that had recently undergone its own leftist revolution — as a political betrayal. Padrón rebuilt each time, never relocated, never changed his source material.\r\n\r\nThe breakthrough came in 1994, when the family launched the 1964 Anniversary Series — a blend designed to honor the house\'s 30th year using Nicaraguan tobacco aged a minimum of four years before rolling. Cigar Aficionado awarded it 96 points, its highest score at the time for a non-Cuban cigar. The review changed everything. Padrón became, almost overnight, the standard against which Nicaraguan cigars were measured.\r\n\r\nThe accumulation of exceptional scores since then has no parallel in the industry. The 1964 Anniversary Diplomatico earned 100 points. The 1926 Serie received 100 points. The 80th Anniversary, released for José Orlando\'s 80th birthday in 2006, earned 100 points. Padrón is the only manufacturer to have received multiple perfect scores from Cigar Aficionado — a distinction that says something specific about consistency: these are not one-time achievements but evidence of a house that has internalized a standard and maintains it across decades.\r\n\r\nThe philosophy is agricultural before it is commercial. Padrón owns its Nicaraguan plantations outright, concentrated in the Jalapa Valley and around Estelí. The aging program is not a marketing narrative — every Padrón blend uses tobacco aged between two and four years minimum before rolling, with the premium lines using tobacco aged considerably longer. José Orlando, who continued walking his plantations into his late eighties, described the approach simply: \'I don\'t sell cigars. I sell time.\'\r\n\r\nHe died in 2017 at age 90. The family continues under Jorge Padrón. The standard has not moved.', `history_es` = 'José Orlando Padrón abandonó Cuba y fundó Padrón en Miami en 1964 con 600 dólares. Superó dos atentados con bomba de exiliados cubanos. En 1994 logró un 96 en Cigar Aficionado con la Serie 1964 Anniversary. Padrón es la única casa con múltiples puntuaciones de 100/100. Su filosofía: envejecer el tabaco nicaragüense de Jalapa al menos 2-4 años.', `history_de` = 'José Orlando Padrón verließ Kuba und gründete Padrón 1964 in Miami mit 600 Dollar. Er überstand zwei Bombenanschläge kubanischer Exilanten. 1994 erzielte er mit der Serie 1964 Anniversary eine 96 im Cigar Aficionado. Padrón ist das einzige Haus mit mehreren 100/100-Bewertungen. Seine Philosophie: Tabak aus dem nicaraguanischen Jalapa-Tal mindestens 2-4 Jahre reifen lassen.', `history_zh` = '何塞·奥兰多·帕德隆离开古巴，于1964年在迈阿密用600美元创立帕德隆。他经历了两次古巴流亡者的炸弹袭击。1994年，1964周年纪念系列在雪茄爱好者杂志获得96分。帕德隆是唯一获得多次100/100满分的品牌。理念：尼加拉瓜哈拉帕烟草至少陈化2-4年。', `history_ar` = 'غادر خوسيه أورلاندو بادرون كوبا وأسّس بادرون في ميامي عام 1964 بـ600 دولار. نجا من هجومين بالقنابل من قِبل المنفيين الكوبيين. حقق عام 1994 نقاط 96 في Cigar Aficionado مع سيري 1964 الذكرى السنوية. بادرون الدار الوحيدة ذات تقييمات 100/100 متعددة. فلسفته: تعتيق تبغ خالابا النيكاراغوي لا أقل من 2-4 سنوات.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"1964 Anniversary Series\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1994, Cigar Aficionado score 96. Medium-Full, maduro or natural wrapper. The house centerpiece. Deep notes of dark chocolate, espresso coffee, toasted coconut. Exclusivo format (50 x 143mm) considered by many as the finest non-Cuban cigar ever produced. Tobacco aged 4 years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exclusivo\", \"Monarca\", \"Torpedo\", \"Presidente\", \"Diplomaticos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2020}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 1994}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1926\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Born in 2002 for José Padrón\'s 75th birthday, in tribute to his birth year. The house\'s pinnacle. Tobacco aged 5 years, confidential production. Perfect score 100/100 from Cigar Aficionado for the No.1 Maduro in 2002. Notes of ristretto, pure cocoa, Jamaican pepper. The most decorated cigar in the magazine\'s history.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.6\", \"No.9\", \"No.35 Anniversary\", \"No.40\", \"No.46\", \"No.80\", \"No.90\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 2002}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1000\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry Padrón range — but with the same Nicaraguan tobacco, simply aged less. Accessibility without betrayal. Notes of hazelnut, light wood, white pepper. For discovering the house without investing in a 1926.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Natural or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"2000\", \"3000\", \"4000\", \"5000\", \"6000\", \"7000\"]}, {\"name\": \"Dámaso\", \"color\": \"#C04000\", \"story\": \"Launched in 2014, tribute to Dámaso Padrón, the founder\'s son. Connecticut wrapper, deliberate sweetness. Padrón proves with Dámaso that it can produce a soft and elegant cigar without conceding on quality. Notes of cream, brioche, toasted hazelnut. For enthusiasts seeking Nicaraguan finesse.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.10\", \"No.15\", \"No.20\", \"No.30\", \"No.32\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"1964 Anniversary Series\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Lanzada en 1994, Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 96. Medium-Full, maduro or natural wrapper. The house centerpiece. Deep notas de chocolate negro, café espresso, tostado coconut. Exclusivo format (50 x 143mm) considerado by many as the finest non-Cuban cigar ever produced. Tabaco añejado 4 years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exclusivo\", \"Monarca\", \"Torpedo\", \"Presidente\", \"Diplomaticos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2020}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 1994}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1926\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Born in 2002 for José Padrón\'s 75th birthday, in tribute to his birth year. La pinnacle. Tabaco añejado 5 years, confidential production. Perfect puntuación 100/100 from Cigar Aficionado for the No.1 Maduro in 2002. Notas de ristretto, pure cocoa, Jamaican pimienta. The most decorated cigar in the magazine\'s history.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.6\", \"No.9\", \"No.35 Anniversary\", \"No.40\", \"No.46\", \"No.80\", \"No.90\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 2002}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1000\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry Padrón range — but with the same Nicaraguan tobacco, simply aged less. Accessibility without betrayal. Notas de avellana, light wood, white pimienta. For discovering the house without investing in a 1926.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Natural or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"2000\", \"3000\", \"4000\", \"5000\", \"6000\", \"7000\"]}, {\"name\": \"Dámaso\", \"color\": \"#C04000\", \"story\": \"Lanzada en 2014, tribute to Dámaso Padrón, the founder\'s son. Connecticut wrapper, deliberate sweetness. Padrón proves with Dámaso that it can produce a soft and elegant cigar without conceding on quality. Notas de cream, brioche, tostado avellana. For aficionados seeking Nicaraguan finesse.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.10\", \"No.15\", \"No.20\", \"No.30\", \"No.32\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"1964 Anniversary Series\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1994, Cigar Aficionado Score 96. Medium-Full, maduro or natural wrapper. The house centerpiece. Deep Noten von dunkle Schokolade, Espresso, geröstet coconut. Exclusivo format (50 x 143mm) considered by many as the finest non-Cuban cigar ever produced. Tobacco aged 4 years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exclusivo\", \"Monarca\", \"Torpedo\", \"Presidente\", \"Diplomaticos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2020}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 1994}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1926\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Born in 2002 for José Padrón\'s 75th birthday, in tribute to his birth year. The house\'s pinnacle. Tobacco aged 5 years, confidential production. Perfect score 100/100 from Cigar Aficionado for the No.1 Maduro in 2002. Noten von ristretto, pure cocoa, Jamaican Pfeffer. The most decorated cigar in the magazine\'s history.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.6\", \"No.9\", \"No.35 Anniversary\", \"No.40\", \"No.46\", \"No.80\", \"No.90\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 2002}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1000\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry Padrón range — but with the same Nicaraguan tobacco, simply aged less. Accessibility without betrayal. Noten von Haselnuss, light wood, white Pfeffer. For discovering the house without investing in a 1926.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Natural or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"2000\", \"3000\", \"4000\", \"5000\", \"6000\", \"7000\"]}, {\"name\": \"Dámaso\", \"color\": \"#C04000\", \"story\": \"Lanciert 2014, tribute to Dámaso Padrón, the founder\'s son. Connecticut wrapper, deliberate sweetness. Padrón proves with Dámaso that it can produce a soft and elegant cigar without conceding on quality. Noten von cream, brioche, geröstet Haselnuss. For enthusiasts seeking Nicaraguan finesse.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.10\", \"No.15\", \"No.20\", \"No.30\", \"No.32\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"1964 Anniversary Series\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1994, 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 96. Medium-Full, maduro or natural wrapper. The house centerpiece. Deep 风味包括： 黑巧克力, 意式浓缩咖啡, 烘烤 coconut. Exclusivo format (50 x 143mm) considered by many as the finest non-Cuban cigar ever produced. Tobacco aged 4 years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exclusivo\", \"Monarca\", \"Torpedo\", \"Presidente\", \"Diplomaticos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2020}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 1994}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1926\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Born in 2002 for José Padrón\'s 75th birthday, in tribute to his birth year. The house\'s pinnacle. Tobacco aged 5 years, confidential production. Perfect score 100/100 from Cigar Aficionado for the No.1 Maduro in 2002. 风味： ristretto, pure cocoa, Jamaican 胡椒. The most decorated cigar in the magazine\'s history.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.6\", \"No.9\", \"No.35 Anniversary\", \"No.40\", \"No.46\", \"No.80\", \"No.90\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 2002}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1000\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry Padrón range — but with the same Nicaraguan tobacco, simply aged less. Accessibility without betrayal. 风味： 榛子, light wood, white 胡椒. For discovering the house without investing in a 1926.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Natural or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"2000\", \"3000\", \"4000\", \"5000\", \"6000\", \"7000\"]}, {\"name\": \"Dámaso\", \"color\": \"#C04000\", \"story\": \"2014年推出, tribute to Dámaso Padrón, the founder\'s son. Connecticut wrapper, deliberate sweetness. Padrón proves with Dámaso that it can produce a soft and elegant cigar without conceding on quality. 风味： cream, brioche, 烘烤 榛子. For 爱好者 seeking Nicaraguan finesse.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.10\", \"No.15\", \"No.20\", \"No.30\", \"No.32\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"1964 Anniversary Series\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1994, تقييم Cigar Aficionado 96. Medium-Full, maduro or natural wrapper. The house centerpiece. Deep نكهات:  شوكولاتة داكنة, قهوة إسبريسو, محمَّص coconut. Exclusivo format (50 x 143mm) considered by many as the finest non-Cuban cigar ever produced. Tobacco aged 4 years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exclusivo\", \"Monarca\", \"Torpedo\", \"Presidente\", \"Diplomaticos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2020}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 1994}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1926\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Born in 2002 for José Padrón\'s 75th birthday, in tribute to his birth year. The house\'s pinnacle. Tobacco aged 5 years, confidential production. Perfect score 100/100 from Cigar Aficionado for the No.1 Maduro in 2002. نكهات:  ristretto, pure cocoa, Jamaican فلفل. The most decorated cigar in the magazine\'s history.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.1\", \"No.2\", \"No.6\", \"No.9\", \"No.35 Anniversary\", \"No.40\", \"No.46\", \"No.80\", \"No.90\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 100, \"year\": 2002}, {\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 96, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Serie 1000\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry Padrón range — but with the same Nicaraguan tobacco, simply aged less. Accessibility without betrayal. نكهات:  بندق, light wood, white فلفل. For discovering the house without investing in a 1926.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Natural or Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"2000\", \"3000\", \"4000\", \"5000\", \"6000\", \"7000\"]}, {\"name\": \"Dámaso\", \"color\": \"#C04000\", \"story\": \"أُطلقت عام 2014, tribute to Dámaso Padrón, the founder\'s son. Connecticut wrapper, deliberate sweetness. Padrón proves with Dámaso that it can produce a soft and elegant cigar without conceding on quality. نكهات:  cream, brioche, محمَّص بندق. For المتحمسون seeking Nicaraguan finesse.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.10\", \"No.15\", \"No.20\", \"No.30\", \"No.32\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"José Orlando Padrón\", \"anecdote\": \"Legendary founder, born 1926, died 2017 at age 90. He was still working in his Jalapa plantations at 85. His philosophy: \'I don\'t sell cigars. I sell time. Time I spent caring for this tobacco.\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Arnold Schwarzenegger\", \"anecdote\": \"A great Padrón smoker, Schwarzenegger is one of the brand\'s most famous involuntary ambassadors. He regularly smokes Serie 1926 at public events.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"José Orlando Padrón\", \"anecdote\": \"Fundador legendario, nacido en 1926, fallecido en 2017 a los 90 años. Seguía trabajando en sus plantaciones de Jalapa a los 85 años. Su filosofía: \'No vendo cigarros. Vendo tiempo. El tiempo que dediqué a cuidar este tabaco.\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Arnold Schwarzenegger\", \"anecdote\": \"A great Padrón smoker, Schwarzenegger is one of the brand\'s most famous involuntary ambassadors. He regularly smokes Serie 1926 at public events.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"José Orlando Padrón\", \"anecdote\": \"Legendärer Gründer, 1926 geboren, 2017 im Alter von 90 Jahren gestorben. Mit 85 Jahren arbeitete er noch in seinen Jalapa-Plantagen. Seine Philosophie: \'Ich verkaufe keine Zigarren. Ich verkaufe Zeit. Zeit, die ich damit verbracht habe, diesen Tabak zu pflegen.\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Arnold Schwarzenegger\", \"anecdote\": \"A great Padrón smoker, Schwarzenegger is one of the brand\'s most famous involuntary ambassadors. He regularly smokes Serie 1926 at public events.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"José Orlando Padrón\", \"anecdote\": \"传奇创始人，生于1926年，2017年以90岁高龄辞世。85岁时仍在哈拉帕种植园劳作。他的哲学：\'我卖的不是雪茄，而是时间——我花在照料这片烟草上的时间。\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Arnold Schwarzenegger\", \"anecdote\": \"A great Padrón smoker, Schwarzenegger is one of the brand\'s most famous involuntary ambassadors. He regularly smokes Serie 1926 at public events.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"José Orlando Padrón\", \"anecdote\": \"المؤسِّس الأسطوري، وُلد عام 1926 وتوفي عام 2017 عن عمر 90 عامًا. كان لا يزال يعمل في مزارع خالابا في الخامسة والثمانين. فلسفته: \'لا أبيع السيجار، بل أبيع الوقت الذي أمضيته في رعاية هذا التبغ.\'\"}, {\"name\": \"Arnold Schwarzenegger\", \"anecdote\": \"A great Padrón smoker, Schwarzenegger is one of the brand\'s most famous involuntary ambassadors. He regularly smokes Serie 1926 at public events.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 18 years\", \"notes\": \"Nicaragua\'s most premium rum accompanies Nicaragua\'s most premium cigar. Common terroir, obvious symbiosis.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Macallan Sherry Oak 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit notes of the Macallan amplify the chocolate and coconut of the 1964 Anniversary. A first-class pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaragua Single Origin\", \"notes\": \"Terroir against terroir — coffee from the same hills as the tobacco. Twin notes of chocolate and caramel.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Licores\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 18 years\", \"notes\": \"Nicaragua\'s most premium rum accompanies Nicaragua\'s most premium cigar. Common terroir, obvious symbiosis.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Macallan Sherry Oak 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit notas de the Macallan amplify the chocolate and coconut of the 1964 Anniversary. A first-class pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Nicaragua Single Origin\", \"notes\": \"Terroir against terroir — coffee from the same hills as the tobacco. Twin notas de chocolate and caramel.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirituosen\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 18 years\", \"notes\": \"Nicaragua\'s most premium rum accompanies Nicaragua\'s most premium cigar. Common terroir, obvious symbiosis.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Macallan Sherry Oak 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit Noten von the Macallan amplify the chocolate and coconut of the 1964 Anniversary. A first-class pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaragua Single Origin\", \"notes\": \"Terroir against terroir — coffee from the same hills as the tobacco. Twin Noten von chocolate and caramel.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"烈酒\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 18 years\", \"notes\": \"Nicaragua\'s most premium rum accompanies Nicaragua\'s most premium cigar. Common terroir, obvious symbiosis.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Macallan Sherry Oak 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit 风味： the Macallan amplify the chocolate and coconut of the 1964 Anniversary. A first-class pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Nicaragua Single Origin\", \"notes\": \"Terroir against terroir — coffee from the same hills as the tobacco. Twin 风味： chocolate and caramel.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"المسكرات\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 18 years\", \"notes\": \"Nicaragua\'s most premium rum accompanies Nicaragua\'s most premium cigar. Common terroir, obvious symbiosis.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Macallan Sherry Oak 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The sherry and dried fruit نكهات: the Macallan amplify the chocolate and coconut of the 1964 Anniversary. A first-class pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Nicaragua Single Origin\", \"notes\": \"Terroir against terroir — coffee from the same hills as the tobacco. Twin نكهات: chocolate and caramel.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Padrón';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Don Jaime Partagás founded his factory in 1845 in Havana\'s Barrio de los Sitios, on a street that would one day bear his name. At Calle Industria 520, the neoclassical building he constructed has never moved, never closed, never reinvented itself into something unrecognizable. For 180 years it has survived Spanish colonial rule, American occupation, two world wars, a revolution, a half-century of embargo, and the slow collapse of everything around it. It is today the oldest cigar factory still in active production anywhere in the world — a distinction that is architectural, historical, and entirely earned.\r\n\r\nDon Jaime was a restless innovator in an era when most manufacturers simply maintained tradition. He traveled to the tobacco fields himself. He understood that the earthy, powerful profile his factory produced required tobaccos from specific micro-regions of Vuelta Abajo — the deep red soils near San Luis and San Juan y Martínez that impart the characteristic dark cocoa and forest floor complexity that defines the Partagás style. He paid premiums for those leaves when his competitors did not.\r\n\r\nHis most enduring contribution was not commercial but cultural. Partagás was the first manufacturer in Cuba — and possibly in the world — to employ a lector: a professional reader who sat on an elevated platform in the rolling gallery and read aloud to the torcedores throughout the working day. The practice transformed the factory floor into an unlikely salon. Workers heard Zola, Dickens, Victor Hugo, and Marx. They debated what they heard. They requested specific texts. Don Jaime believed that cultivated minds produced better cigars — and the quality of Partagás under his direction supported the theory. La lectura spread to every Cuban factory, then to exiled torcedore communities in Tampa, Key West, and New York, where it survived well into the twentieth century.\r\n\r\nAfter Don Jaime\'s death in 1868 — murdered, the legend says, by a rival — the factory passed through several hands before being nationalized in 1960. The state maintained the address, the workforce, and most importantly the tobacco sourcing. The Serie D No.4, a Robusto measuring 50 x 124mm, became under Cuban state management what it remains today: the global benchmark for full-body cigars. Its notes of bitter cocoa, black pepper, damp undergrowth, and aged cedar arrive in waves across 45 minutes of consistent, escalating complexity. Cigar Aficionado has awarded it scores between 92 and 95 across fifteen consecutive reviews.\r\n\r\nThe Lusitanias — a Double Corona measuring 49 x 194mm — is one of the last great format cigars still produced regularly in Cuba. Ninety minutes in the hand. Five distinct aromatic phases. The 8-9-8 Varnished, sold in cedar boxes with cigars arranged in the namesake pattern, is the house\'s most elegant proposition: a Panetela so narrow it seems impossibly fragile, yet concentrates aromas with an intensity that surprises every smoker who approaches it expecting lightness. These three cigars — the Serie D, the Lusitanias, the 8-9-8 — form a triangle that has defined serious cigar culture for a century and shows no sign of becoming irrelevant.', `history_es` = 'Don Jaime Partagás fundó su fábrica en 1845 en el Barrio de los Sitios de La Habana, en la Calle Industria 520 — dirección que nunca ha abandonado. Es la fábrica más antigua del mundo aún en funcionamiento.\r\n\r\nPartagás fue el pionero de la lectura: un lector leía en voz alta a los obreros durante el trabajo. Esta práctica se extendió por todas las fábricas cubanas.\r\n\r\nSus cigarros son robustos, terrosos, expresivos. Los aficionados a Partagás son fieles hasta el extremo: siempre se vuelve.', `history_de` = 'Don Jaime Partagás gründete 1845 seine Fabrik in der Calle Industria 520 in Havanna — eine Adresse, die sie nie verlassen hat. Es ist die älteste Zigarrenfabrik der Welt.\r\n\r\nPartagás erfand die Lectura: Ein Vorleser las den Arbeitern während der Arbeit vor. Diese Praxis verbreitete sich in ganz Kuba.\r\n\r\nKräftige, erdige, ausdrucksstarke Zigarren. Partagás-Fans sind bedingungslos treu — man kommt immer zurück.', `history_zh` = '唐·海梅·帕特加斯于1845年在哈瓦那工业街520号创立了他的工厂——至今从未离开。它是全球仍在运营的最古老雪茄工厂。\r\n\r\n帕特加斯首创了朗读传统：在工作时朗读者为工人大声朗读。这一习俗传遍古巴所有工厂。\r\n\r\n浓郁、有力、泥土气息的雪茄。帕特加斯爱好者极其忠诚——总会回来。', `history_ar` = 'أسّس دون خايمي بارتاغاس مصنعه عام 1845 في كاييه إنداستريا 520 بهافانا — عنوان لم يغادره قط. إنه أقدم مصنع سيجار في العالم لا يزال يعمل.\r\n\r\nكان بارتاغاس رائدًا في الليكتورا: قارئ يجهر للعمال أثناء اللف. انتشرت هذه العادة في جميع مصانع كوبا.\r\n\r\nسيجار قوي ترابي معبِّر. عشاق بارتاغاس أوفياء دائمًا — ستعود إليها في نهاية المطاف.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Serie D\", \"color\": \"#8B2500\", \"story\": \"The Serie D No.4 — Robusto 50 x 124mm — is the absolute full-body reference cigar. Earthy, powerful, complex. Notes of bitter cocoa, black pepper, damp forest floor. Smoked in 45 minutes, it does not forgive improper storage. Cigar Aficionado score 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.4\", \"No.5\"]}, {\"name\": \"Lusitanias\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm), 90 minutes of smoke. One of the few giant formats still regularly produced in Cuba. Named for the ocean liner sunk in 1915. A cigar for solemn great occasions — it tolerates neither haste nor distraction.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Lusitanias\"]}, {\"name\": \"8-9-8 Collection\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Sold in boxes of 25 arranged 8-9-8. Panetela format (33 x 170mm), the finest ever produced in Cuba. Deceptive lightness: the narrow ring gauge concentrates aromas into unexpected intensity. Beloved by Parisian enthusiasts.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"8-9-8 Varnished\"]}, {\"name\": \"Habaneros\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry-level range — but at Partagás, \'entry\' is relative. The Habaneros Short are the everyday pleasure cigars of Havanans themselves. Short (42 x 110mm), intense, smoked in 20 minutes. The true popular Cuban flavor, without ceremony.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Short\", \"Club\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Serie D\", \"color\": \"#8B2500\", \"story\": \"The Serie D No.4 — Robusto 50 x 124mm — is the absolute full-body reference cigar. Earthy, powerful, complex. Notas de bitter cocoa, pimienta negra, damp forest floor. Fumado en 45 minutos, it does not forgive improper storage. Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.4\", \"No.5\"]}, {\"name\": \"Lusitanias\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm), 90 minutos of smoke. One of the few giant formats still regularly produced in Cuba. Nombrada por the ocean liner sunk in 1915. A cigar for solemn great occasions — it tolerates neither haste nor distraction.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Lusitanias\"]}, {\"name\": \"8-9-8 Collection\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Sold in boxes of 25 arranged 8-9-8. Panetela format (33 x 170mm), the finest ever produced in Cuba. Deceptive lightness: the narrow ring gauge concentrates aromas into unexpected intensity. Beloved by Parisian aficionados.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"8-9-8 Varnished\"]}, {\"name\": \"Habaneros\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry-level range — but at Partagás, \'entry\' is relative. The Habaneros Short are the everyday pleasure cigars of Havanans themselves. Short (42 x 110mm), intense, smoked in 20 minutes. The true popular Cuban flavor, without ceremony.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Short\", \"Club\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Serie D\