itanias\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm), 90分钟 of smoke. One of the few giant formats still regularly produced in Cuba. 以…命名 the ocean liner sunk in 1915. A cigar for solemn great occasions — it tolerates neither haste nor distraction.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Lusitanias\"]}, {\"name\": \"8-9-8 Collection\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Sold in boxes of 25 arranged 8-9-8. Panetela format (33 x 170mm), the finest ever produced in Cuba. Deceptive lightness: the narrow ring gauge concentrates aromas into unexpected intensity. Beloved by Parisian 爱好者.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"8-9-8 Varnished\"]}, {\"name\": \"Habaneros\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry-level range — but at Partagás, \'entry\' is relative. The Habaneros Short are the everyday pleasure cigars of Havanans themselves. Short (42 x 110mm), intense, smoked in 20 分钟. The true popular Cuban flavor, without ceremony.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Short\", \"Club\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Serie D\", \"color\": \"#8B2500\", \"story\": \"The Serie D No.4 — Robusto 50 x 124mm — is the absolute full-body reference cigar. Earthy, powerful, complex. نكهات:  bitter cocoa, فلفل أسود, damp forest floor. يُدخَّن في 45 دقيقة, it does not forgive improper storage. تقييم Cigar Aficionado 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"No.4\", \"No.5\"]}, {\"name\": \"Lusitanias\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm), 90 دقيقة of smoke. One of the few giant formats still regularly produced in Cuba. سُمِّيت تيمنًا بـ the ocean liner sunk in 1915. A cigar for solemn great occasions — it tolerates neither haste nor distraction.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Lusitanias\"]}, {\"name\": \"8-9-8 Collection\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Sold in boxes of 25 arranged 8-9-8. Panetela format (33 x 170mm), the finest ever produced in Cuba. Deceptive lightness: the narrow ring gauge concentrates aromas into unexpected intensity. Beloved by Parisian المتحمسون.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"8-9-8 Varnished\"]}, {\"name\": \"Habaneros\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry-level range — but at Partagás, \'entry\' is relative. The Habaneros Short are the everyday pleasure cigars of Havanans themselves. Short (42 x 110mm), intense, smoked in 20 دقيقة. The true popular Cuban flavor, without ceremony.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Short\", \"Club\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx smoked cigars constantly on stage and in life. He reportedly said: \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx fumaba cigars constantly on stage and in life. Supuestamente dijo: \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx rauchte cigars constantly on stage and in life. Er soll gesagt haben: \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx smoked cigars constantly on stage and in life. 据报道他曾说： \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx smoked cigars constantly on stage and in life. يُروى أنه قال: \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. A pairing for connoisseurs.\"}, {\"type\": \"Beer\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee notes of a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"Tea\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Licores\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. Un maridaje para conocedores.\"}, {\"type\": \"Cerveza\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee notas de a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"Té\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirituosen\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. Eine Paarung für Kenner.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bier\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee Noten von a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"Tee\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"烈酒\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. 行家的搭配.\"}, {\"type\": \"啤酒\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee 风味： a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"茶\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"المسكرات\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. مقارنة للمتذوقين.\"}, {\"type\": \"البيرة\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee نكهات: a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"الشاي\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Partagás';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The American Partagás situation illustrates the same legal phenomenon as Cohiba USA: the American embargo against Cuba created an intellectual property vacuum that General Cigar quickly and legally occupied.\r\n\r\nGeneral Cigar holds the Partagás trademark rights in the United States, independently of the Cuban Partagás owned by Habanos S.A. The American version has been manufactured in the Dominican Republic since the 1980s, using Dominican and Mexican tobaccos in an intentionally evocative — yet distinct — profile from the original Havana house.\r\n\r\nThe commercial impact of this American version is substantial: Partagás is one of the best-selling premium brands in the United States over three decades. The loyalty of consumers who cannot access the Cuban Partagás — and who developed their palates on the Dominican version — creates a solid base of recurring buyers.\r\n\r\nThe 1845 range, launched to commemorate the founding year of the original Havana house, is the most ambitious proposition of the American version: a Mexican San Andrés-dominant blend that explicitly seeks to reproduce the earthy intensity of the Cuban Partagás. Some American enthusiasts prefer it to the original for its consistency; others find it too linear in its intensity. Both positions are defensible and simply reflect different stylistic preferences.', `history_es` = 'La situación de Partagás en Estados Unidos ilustra el mismo fenómeno jurídico que Cohiba USA: el embargo estadounidense contra Cuba creó un vacío de propiedad intelectual que General Cigar ocupó con rapidez y legalidad.\n\nGeneral Cigar posee los derechos de la marca Partagás en Estados Unidos, con independencia del Partagás cubano de Habanos S.A. La versión estadounidense se fabrica en la República Dominicana desde los años ochenta, con tabacos dominicanos y mexicanos en un perfil deliberadamente evocador —pero distinto— del original habanero.\n\nEl impacto comercial de esta versión estadounidense es notable: Partagás figura desde hace tres décadas entre las marcas premium más vendidas en Estados Unidos. La fidelidad de unos consumidores que no pueden acceder al Partagás cubano —y que han formado su paladar con la versión dominicana— sostiene una base sólida de compradores recurrentes.\n\nLa gama 1845, lanzada para conmemorar el año de fundación de la casa habanera original, es la propuesta más ambiciosa de la versión estadounidense: una ligada de predominio mexicano San Andrés que busca explícitamente reproducir la intensidad terrosa del Partagás cubano. Algunos aficionados estadounidenses la prefieren al original por su regularidad; otros la encuentran demasiado lineal. Ambas posturas son defendibles y solo reflejan preferencias de estilo distintas.', `history_de` = 'Die Lage von Partagás in den Vereinigten Staaten veranschaulicht dasselbe rechtliche Phänomen wie Cohiba USA: Das amerikanische Embargo gegen Kuba schuf eine Lücke im geistigen Eigentum, die General Cigar rasch und legal besetzte.\n\nGeneral Cigar hält die Rechte an der Marke Partagás in den Vereinigten Staaten, unabhängig vom kubanischen Partagás der Habanos S.A. Die amerikanische Version wird seit den 1980er Jahren in der Dominikanischen Republik hergestellt, aus dominikanischen und mexikanischen Tabaken, in einem Profil, das das havannesische Original bewusst anklingen lässt — und sich doch davon unterscheidet.\n\nDer kommerzielle Erfolg dieser amerikanischen Version ist beträchtlich: Partagás gehört seit drei Jahrzehnten zu den meistverkauften Premiummarken der Vereinigten Staaten. Die Treue von Verbrauchern, die keinen Zugang zum kubanischen Partagás haben und ihren Gaumen an der dominikanischen Version geschult haben, trägt einen soliden Stamm an Wiederkäufern.\n\nDie Linie 1845, benannt nach dem Gründungsjahr des ursprünglichen Havanna-Hauses, ist der ehrgeizigste Vorschlag der amerikanischen Version: eine Mischung mit Übergewicht des mexikanischen San Andrés, die ausdrücklich die erdige Intensität des kubanischen Partagás nachbilden will. Manche amerikanischen Liebhaber ziehen sie wegen ihrer Gleichmäßigkeit dem Original vor, andere finden sie zu geradlinig. Beide Haltungen lassen sich vertreten und spiegeln schlicht unterschiedliche Stilvorlieben.', `history_zh` = 'Partagás 在美国的处境，说明的是与 Cohiba USA 相同的法律现象：美国对古巴的禁运造成了知识产权真空，而 General Cigar 迅速且合法地填补了它。\n\nGeneral Cigar 拥有 Partagás 商标在美国的权利，与 Habanos S.A. 旗下的古巴 Partagás 互不相干。美国版自 1980 年代起在多米尼加共和国生产，采用多米尼加与墨西哥烟叶，风格刻意让人联想到哈瓦那原版，却又与之不同。\n\n这一美国版的商业影响相当可观：三十年来，Partagás 一直是美国销量最高的高端品牌之一。那些无缘古巴 Partagás、并以多米尼加版养成味觉的消费者，形成了稳固的回头客基础。\n\n为纪念哈瓦那原厂创立年份而推出的 1845 系列，是美国版最具野心的作品：以墨西哥 San Andrés 为主的配方，明确追求还原古巴 Partagás 的厚土强度。一些美国爱好者因其稳定而更偏爱它，另一些人则嫌其过于平直。两种看法都站得住脚，不过是风格偏好不同而已。', `history_ar` = 'يوضّح وضع Partagás في الولايات المتحدة الظاهرة القانونية نفسها التي عرفتها Cohiba USA: فالحظر الأمريكي على كوبا خلق فراغاً في الملكية الفكرية شغلته General Cigar سريعاً وبصورة قانونية.\n\nتملك General Cigar حقوق علامة Partagás في الولايات المتحدة، بمعزل عن Partagás الكوبية التابعة لـ Habanos S.A. وتُصنع النسخة الأمريكية في جمهورية الدومينيكان منذ الثمانينيات، من تبغ دومينيكي ومكسيكي، بطابع يستحضر الأصل الهافاني عن قصد — ويظل مختلفاً عنه.\n\nوأثر هذه النسخة الأمريكية تجارياً كبير: فـ Partagás من أكثر العلامات الفاخرة مبيعاً في الولايات المتحدة منذ ثلاثة عقود. ووفاء مستهلكين لا سبيل لهم إلى Partagás الكوبية، وقد تربّت أذواقهم على النسخة الدومينيكية، يصنع قاعدة متينة من المشترين الدائمين.\n\nأما تشكيلة 1845، التي أُطلقت إحياءً لسنة تأسيس الدار الهافانية الأصلية، فهي أطمح ما تقدّمه النسخة الأمريكية: خلطة يغلب عليها San Andrés المكسيكي وتسعى صراحةً إلى استعادة الشدّة الترابية لـ Partagás الكوبية. بعض الهواة الأمريكيين يفضّلونها على الأصل لانتظامها، وبعضهم يجدها خطّية أكثر مما ينبغي. والموقفان معاً وجيهان، ولا يعكسان سوى اختلاف في تفضيلات الأسلوب.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Partagás 1845\", \"color\": \"#3D1A00\", \"story\": \"Premium range with Mexican San Andrés wrapper. Earthy and spiced profile in homage to the Cuban Partagás. Notes of dark chocolate, black pepper, forest floor. For American enthusiasts seeking intensity without access to the Cuban original.\"}, {\"name\": \"Partagás Black Label\", \"color\": \"#1A1A1A\", \"story\": \"Maduro range with Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper fermented 3 years. Milk chocolate, roasted coffee, paradoxical sweetness despite the power. Multiple appearances in Cigar Aficionado\'s Top 25.\"}, {\"name\": \"Partagás Serie D USA\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Tribute to the iconic Robusto format of the Cuban version, but using Dominican and Honduran tobacco. Less powerful profile, exemplary construction, consistency that attracts enthusiasts valuing predictability.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Partagás 1845\",\"color\":\"#3D1A00\",\"story\":\"Gama premium con capa mexicana San Andrés. Perfil terroso y especiado en homenaje al Partagás cubano. Notas de chocolate negro, pimienta negra y sotobosque. Para los aficionados estadounidenses que buscan intensidad sin poder acceder al original.\"},{\"name\":\"Partagás Black Label\",\"color\":\"#1A1A1A\",\"story\":\"Gama Maduro con capa Connecticut Broadleaf fermentada 3 años. Notas de chocolate con leche y café tostado, con una dulzura paradójica pese a la potencia. Varias veces en el Top 25 de Cigar Aficionado.\"},{\"name\":\"Partagás Serie D USA\",\"color\":\"#8B0000\",\"story\":\"Homenaje al emblemático Robusto de la versión cubana, pero con tabaco dominicano y hondureño. Perfil menos potente, construcción ejemplar y una regularidad que seduce a quienes valoran lo previsible.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Partagás 1845\",\"color\":\"#3D1A00\",\"story\":\"Premiumlinie mit mexikanischem San-Andrés-Deckblatt. Erdiges, würziges Profil als Verbeugung vor dem kubanischen Partagás. Noten von Zartbitterschokolade, schwarzem Pfeffer und Waldboden. Für amerikanische Liebhaber, die Intensität suchen und keinen Zugang zum Original haben.\"},{\"name\":\"Partagás Black Label\",\"color\":\"#1A1A1A\",\"story\":\"Maduro-Linie mit drei Jahre fermentiertem Connecticut-Broadleaf-Deckblatt. Noten von Milchschokolade und Röstkaffee, von paradoxer Süße trotz der Kraft. Mehrfach in den Top 25 von Cigar Aficionado.\"},{\"name\":\"Partagás Serie D USA\",\"color\":\"#8B0000\",\"story\":\"Eine Verbeugung vor dem sinnbildlichen Robusto der kubanischen Version, doch aus dominikanischem und honduranischem Tabak. Weniger kräftiges Profil, vorbildliche Machart und eine Gleichmäßigkeit, die Liebhaber des Berechenbaren überzeugt.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Partagás 1845\",\"color\":\"#3D1A00\",\"story\":\"以墨西哥 San Andrés 茄衣打造的高端系列。厚土与香料的风格，是向古巴 Partagás 的致敬。黑巧克力、黑胡椒与林下腐叶的气息。献给追求强度、却无缘原版的美国爱好者。\"},{\"name\":\"Partagás Black Label\",\"color\":\"#1A1A1A\",\"story\":\"Maduro 系列，采用发酵三年的 Connecticut Broadleaf 茄衣。牛奶巧克力与烘焙咖啡的气息，强劲之中带着一份矛盾的甜润。多次进入《Cigar Aficionado》前 25 名。\"},{\"name\":\"Partagás Serie D USA\",\"color\":\"#8B0000\",\"story\":\"向古巴版标志性 Robusto 规格致敬之作，却改用多米尼加与洪都拉斯烟叶。强度较低，卷制堪称典范，那份稳定一致最能打动看重可预期性的爱好者。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Partagás 1845\",\"color\":\"#3D1A00\",\"story\":\"تشكيلة فاخرة بغلاف San Andrés المكسيكي. طابع ترابي متبّل تحيّةً لـ Partagás الكوبية. لمسات من الشوكولاتة الداكنة والفلفل الأسود وأرضية الغابة. لهواة أمريكا الباحثين عن الشدّة والعاجزين عن بلوغ الأصل.\"},{\"name\":\"Partagás Black Label\",\"color\":\"#1A1A1A\",\"story\":\"تشكيلة Maduro بغلاف Connecticut Broadleaf مخمَّر ثلاث سنوات. لمسات من شوكولاتة الحليب والقهوة المحمّصة، بحلاوة تبدو متناقضة مع قوّته. ورد مراراً في قائمة Top 25 لمجلة Cigar Aficionado.\"},{\"name\":\"Partagás Serie D USA\",\"color\":\"#8B0000\",\"story\":\"تحيّة إلى طراز الروبوستو الرمزي في النسخة الكوبية، لكن بتبغ دومينيكي وهندوراسي. طابع أقلّ قوة، وصناعة مثالية، وانتظام يغري محبّي ما يمكن توقّعه.\"}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Ramón Cifuentes\", \"anecdote\": \"The last private owner of the Havana Partagás before the 1960 nationalization ended his career in the United States, advising various American manufacturers. He acknowledged the work of Dominican manufacturers while noting that \'Cuba\'s terroir cannot be transplanted\'.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Ramón Cifuentes\",\"anecdote\":\"El último propietario privado del Partagás habanero antes de la nacionalización de 1960 terminó su carrera en Estados Unidos, asesorando a varias manufacturas estadounidenses. Reconoció el trabajo de las fábricas dominicanas, aunque subrayaba que «el terruño de Cuba no se transplanta».\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Ramón Cifuentes\",\"anecdote\":\"Der letzte private Eigentümer des havannesischen Partagás vor der Verstaatlichung 1960 beendete seine Laufbahn in den Vereinigten Staaten als Berater mehrerer amerikanischer Manufakturen. Er anerkannte die Arbeit der dominikanischen Häuser, betonte jedoch: „Kubas Terroir lässt sich nicht verpflanzen.\\\"\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Ramón Cifuentes\",\"anecdote\":\"1960 年国有化之前，哈瓦那帕特加斯的最后一位私人所有者在美国结束了职业生涯，为多家美国制造厂担任顾问。他认可多米尼加厂家的工艺，但始终强调「古巴的风土无法移植」。\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"رامون سيفوينتيس\",\"anecdote\":\"آخر مالك خاص لبارتاغاس الهافانية قبل التأميم عام 1960 أنهى مسيرته في الولايات المتحدة مستشارًا لعدة مصانع أمريكية. أقرّ بجودة عمل المصانع الدومينيكية، لكنه كان يؤكّد أن «تربة كوبا لا تُنقل».\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Highland Single Malt 18 Years\", \"notes\": \"The light peat and sherry wood of an 18-year Highland single malt add a European dimension to the earthy American profile of the 1845. A pairing that transcends geographies.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Concentrated cold brew\", \"notes\": \"For the Black Label Maduro, a high-concentration cold brew amplifies the dark chocolate and roasted coffee notes in an obvious but absolutely successful pairing.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilado\",\"name\":\"Whisky Highland Single Malt de 18 años\",\"notes\":\"La turba ligera y la crianza en sherry de un Highland de 18 años añaden una dimensión europea al perfil terroso estadounidense del 1845. Un maridaje que trasciende las geografías.\"},{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Cold brew concentrado\",\"notes\":\"Para el Black Label Maduro, un cold brew de alta concentración amplifica las notas de chocolate negro y café tostado en un maridaje evidente pero absolutamente logrado.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituose\",\"name\":\"Highland Single Malt Whisky, 18 Jahre\",\"notes\":\"Der leichte Torf und das Sherryfass eines 18-jährigen Highland verleihen dem erdigen amerikanischen Profil der 1845 eine europäische Dimension. Eine Kombination, die Geografien überschreitet.\"},{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Konzentrierter Cold Brew\",\"notes\":\"Für die Black Label Maduro verstärkt ein hochkonzentrierter Cold Brew die Noten von Bitterschokolade und geröstetem Kaffee — eine naheliegende, aber absolut gelungene Kombination.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"18 年高地单一麦芽威士忌\",\"notes\":\"18 年高地威士忌的淡雅泥煤与雪利桶陈，为 1845 的美式土壤气息添上欧洲维度。一场跨越地理的搭配。\"},{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"高浓度冷萃咖啡\",\"notes\":\"对 Black Label Maduro 而言，高浓度冷萃放大黑巧克力与烘焙咖啡的气息——看似顺理成章，却完全成立。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروب روحي\",\"name\":\"ويسكي مولت مفرد من الهايلاندز معتّق 18 عامًا\",\"notes\":\"الخثّ الخفيف وبرميل الشيري في هايلاندز 18 عامًا يضيفان بعدًا أوروبيًا إلى الطابع الترابي الأمريكي في «1845». مزاوجة تتجاوز الجغرافيا.\"},{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة باردة الاستخلاص مركّزة\",\"notes\":\"مع «بلاك ليبل مادورو»، تُبرز القهوة باردة الاستخلاص عالية التركيز نفحات الشوكولاتة الداكنة والقهوة المحمّصة في مزاوجة بديهية لكنها ناجحة تمامًا.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Partagás USA';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'PDR — for Pinar del Río, the Cuban region the founding family comes from — is based in Tamboril, the town that probably rolls more cigars per inhabitant than anywhere in the world. Abe Flores built a house there that grows, ferments and rolls on site, which remains a minority practice even in the Dominican Republic, where many brands buy their tobacco and subcontract the blending.\n\nThe house made its name through work on fermentation — long, pushed processes that yield dark, sweet cigars — and through a pricing policy that kept it accessible while its competitors moved upmarket.\n\nIt also produces for other brands, as almost every factory in Tamboril does. That is a reality the atlas should state: in this town, the same pair of hands often rolls several bands.', `history_es` = 'PDR — por Pinar del Río, la región cubana de la que procede la familia fundadora — está instalada en Tamboril, la ciudad que probablemente lía más cigarros por habitante que ninguna otra del mundo. Abe Flores levantó allí una casa que cultiva, fermenta y lía en el mismo lugar, algo que sigue siendo minoritario incluso en la República Dominicana, donde muchas marcas compran su tabaco y subcontratan la ligada.\n\nLa casa se dio a conocer por un trabajo sobre la fermentación — procesos largos, llevados al límite, que dan cigarros oscuros y dulces — y por una política de precios que la hizo accesible allí donde sus competidoras subían de gama.\n\nProduce también para otras marcas, como casi todas las fábricas de Tamboril. Es una realidad que el atlas debe decir: en esta ciudad, el mismo par de manos lía a menudo varias vitolas.', `history_de` = 'PDR — für Pinar del Río, die kubanische Region, aus der die Gründerfamilie stammt — sitzt in Tamboril, der Stadt, die vermutlich weltweit die meisten Zigarren pro Einwohner rollt. Abe Flores baute dort ein Haus auf, das vor Ort anbaut, fermentiert und rollt, was selbst in der Dominikanischen Republik die Ausnahme bleibt, wo viele Marken ihren Tabak zukaufen und das Blenden vergeben.\n\nBekannt wurde das Haus durch seine Arbeit an der Fermentation — lange, weit getriebene Verfahren, die dunkle, süße Zigarren ergeben — und durch eine Preispolitik, die es zugänglich hielt, während seine Konkurrenten ins gehobene Segment strebten.\n\nEs produziert außerdem für andere Marken, wie fast alle Manufakturen in Tamboril. Das ist eine Wirklichkeit, die der Atlas benennen muss: In dieser Stadt rollt dasselbe Paar Hände oft mehrere Bauchbinden.', `history_zh` = 'PDR——取自创始家族的祖籍、古巴的阿巴霍谷（Pinar del Río）——坐落于坦博里尔，这座城市按人均计算大概是世界上卷制雪茄最多的地方。阿贝·弗洛雷斯在此建起一家自种、自发酵、自卷制的企业；即便在多米尼加共和国，这也仍属少数，因为许多品牌是买进烟叶、把配制外包出去。\n\n这家企业因发酵工艺而闻名——长时间、推到极致的处理，做出深色而带甜的雪茄——也因一套定价策略而广为可及，彼时它的同行正纷纷向高端走。\n\n它同样为别的品牌代工，正如坦博里尔几乎所有工厂一样。这是图册应当说出的现实：在这座城市里，同一双手往往卷出好几个烟标。', `history_ar` = '«بي دي آر» — اختصاراً لبينار ديل ريو، المنطقة الكوبية التي تنحدر منها العائلة المؤسِّسة — تقع في تامبوريل، المدينة التي تلفّ على الأرجح أكبر عدد من السيجار للفرد في العالم. بنى فيها آبي فلوريس داراً تزرع وتخمّر وتلفّ في المكان نفسه، وهو ما يبقى أقليّاً حتى في الجمهورية الدومينيكية، حيث تشتري علاماتٌ كثيرة تبغها وتُسند التركيب إلى الغير.\n\nعُرفت الدار بعملها على التخمير — عمليات طويلة مدفوعة إلى أقصاها تمنح سيجاراً داكناً حلواً — وبسياسة أسعار أبقتها في المتناول بينما كان منافسوها يصعدون إلى الفئات العليا.\n\nوهي تنتج أيضاً لعلامات أخرى، كما تفعل جميع مصانع تامبوريل تقريباً. وهذه حقيقة على الأطلس أن يقولها: في هذه المدينة، غالباً ما يلفّ الزوجُ نفسه من الأيدي عدّة أشرطة.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"PDR 1878 Capa Oscura\",\"color\":\"#4A3728\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Oscuro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"The pushed fermentation work that made the house\'s name: a very dark wrapper, burnt sugar, coffee, a deceptive sweetness over a powerful base.\"},{\"name\":\"PDR Small Batch\",\"color\":\"#9C6B4F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Short runs, a paler and woodier blend. The sober face of a house known for its black wrappers.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"PDR 1878 Capa Oscura\",\"color\":\"#4A3728\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Oscuro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"El trabajo de fermentación llevado al límite que dio fama a la casa: capa muy oscura, azúcar quemado, café, una dulzura engañosa sobre un fondo potente.\"},{\"name\":\"PDR Small Batch\",\"color\":\"#9C6B4F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano de Ecuador\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Series cortas, liga más clara y más amaderada. La cara sobria de una casa conocida por sus capas negras.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"PDR 1878 Capa Oscura\",\"color\":\"#4A3728\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Oscuro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"Die weit getriebene Fermentationsarbeit, die den Ruf des Hauses begründete: sehr dunkles Deckblatt, gebrannter Zucker, Kaffee, eine trügerische Süße über kräftigem Grund.\"},{\"name\":\"PDR Small Batch\",\"color\":\"#9C6B4F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano aus Ecuador\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Kurze Serien, ein hellerer und holzigerer Blend. Das nüchterne Gesicht eines Hauses, das für seine schwarzen Deckblätter bekannt ist.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"PDR 1878 Capa Oscura\",\"color\":\"#4A3728\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Oscuro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"让这家企业成名的极致发酵工艺：极深的茄衣、焦糖、咖啡，浓郁底子之上一层带有迷惑性的甜。\"},{\"name\":\"PDR Small Batch\",\"color\":\"#9C6B4F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"厄瓜多尔哈瓦那种\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"短批量，配方更浅、更偏木质。一家以深色茄衣闻名的企业素净的一面。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"PDR 1878 Capa Oscura\",\"color\":\"#4A3728\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Oscuro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"عمل التخمير المدفوع إلى أقصاه الذي صنع سمعة الدار: غلاف شديد الدكنة، سكر محروق، قهوة، وحلاوة خادعة فوق أساس قويّ.\"},{\"name\":\"PDR Small Batch\",\"color\":\"#9C6B4F\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"هابانو إكوادوري\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"دفعات قصيرة، وخلطة أفتح وأكثر خشبية. الوجه الرصين لدارٍ عُرفت بأغلفتها السوداء.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"Amber Dominican rum\",\"notes\":\"The burnt sugar of the capa oscura finds its exact echo there.\"},{\"type\":\"Other\",\"name\":\"Milk chocolate\",\"notes\":\"An easy and apt pairing with heavily fermented blends.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Ron dominicano ámbar\",\"notes\":\"El azúcar quemado de la capa oscura encuentra ahí su eco exacto.\"},{\"type\":\"Otro\",\"name\":\"Chocolate con leche\",\"notes\":\"Un acuerdo fácil y justo sobre las ligas muy fermentadas.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Dominikanischer Amber-Rum\",\"notes\":\"Der gebrannte Zucker der Capa Oscura findet darin sein genaues Echo.\"},{\"type\":\"Sonstiges\",\"name\":\"Milchschokolade\",\"notes\":\"Eine einfache und stimmige Verbindung bei stark fermentierten Blends.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"多米尼加琥珀朗姆\",\"notes\":\"深色茄衣的焦糖在此找到确切的回响。\"},{\"type\":\"其他\",\"name\":\"牛奶巧克力\",\"notes\":\"配重度发酵的配方，一种简单而恰当的搭配。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"روم دومينيكي كهرماني\",\"notes\":\"سكر «الكابا أوسكورا» المحروق يجد صداه التامّ هنا.\"},{\"type\":\"أخرى\",\"name\":\"شوكولاتة بالحليب\",\"notes\":\"تناغم سهل وصائب مع الخلطات الشديدة التخمير.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'PDR Cigars';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Nick Perdomo\'s relationship with Nicaraguan tobacco is genealogical before it is commercial. His family cultivated tobacco in Cuba\'s Pinar del Río province for generations before the revolution that ended that chapter. The seeds and knowledge they carried into exile were not metaphorical — the Perdomo family, like the Olivás and the Plasencias, preserved actual genetic material from Cuban tobacco plants that they eventually planted in Nicaraguan soil.\r\n\r\nThat continuity matters because Perdomo\'s central argument — that Nicaraguan tobacco from the Jalapa Valley can rival Cuban tobacco in complexity and depth — is not a marketing claim but the conclusion of someone who grew up with both. Nick Perdomo\'s father knew what Vuelta Abajo tobacco tasted like because he had grown it. Nick Perdomo knew what it tasted like because his father had shown him. The comparison he makes when describing his Nicaraguan leaf is informed by direct sensory memory transmitted across generations.\r\n\r\nThe Perdomo operation in Estelí controls its tobacco sourcing more completely than most manufacturers in the American market. Where competitors source leaf through brokers or long-term supply contracts, Perdomo grows significant portions of his tobaccos on family-owned land, using cultivation practices developed over a century of practice. The wrapper tobacco that appears across the premium Perdomo ranges — including the rare cases where he uses Nicaraguan wrapper rather than the Ecuadorian Connecticut shade that most makers prefer — represents years of varietal development and fermentation experimentation.\r\n\r\nThe 2012 20th Anniversary series, released for the company\'s first two decades, demonstrated the range\'s ambitions clearly. The Nicaraguan Oscuro wrapper — fermented for an extended period to develop the dark, oily character that San Andrés Maduro provides more naturally — produces a profile of dark chocolate and espresso over the Jalapa filler blend that several reviewers described as the most accomplished Nicaraguan cigar they had smoked. Cigar Aficionado\'s 97-point score for the Robusto established Perdomo among the handful of houses whose premium expressions compete directly with Padrón and Oliva for the top position in Nicaraguan tobacco.', `history_es` = 'Nick Perdomo fundó Perdomo Cigars en Miami en 1992 con la convicción de que el tabaco nicaragüense de Jalapa iguala al Vuelta Abajo cubano. Su especialidad: envolventes nicaragüenses. La gama 20th Anniversary (2012) — wrapper oscuro nicaragüense añejado 5 años — desafía directamente a la Serie V de Oliva.', `history_de` = 'Nick Perdomo gründete Perdomo Cigars 1992 in Miami mit der Überzeugung, dass Nicaraguanischer Tabak aus dem Jalapa-Tal dem kubanischen Vuelta Abajo ebenbürtig ist. Seine Spezialität: nicaraguanische Wrapper. Die 20th Anniversary (2012) — nicaraguanischer Oscuro-Wrapper, 5 Jahre gereift — fordert Olivas Serie V direkt heraus.', `history_zh` = '尼克·帕德模于1992年在迈阿密创立了帕德模雪茄，坚信尼加拉瓜哈拉帕烟草可媲美古巴布埃尔塔阿巴霍。他的专长：尼加拉瓜茄衣。2012年的20周年纪念系列——陈化5年的尼加拉瓜奥斯库罗茄衣——直接挑战奥利瓦V系列。', `history_ar` = 'أسّس نيك بيردومو بيردومو سيغار في ميامي عام 1992 مقتنعًا بأن تبغ نيكاراغوا من وادي خالابا يعادل الفويلتا أباخو الكوبية. تخصصه: أغلفة نيكاراغوية. سيري الذكرى العشرين (2012) — غلاف نيكاراغوي أوسكورو معتَّق 5 سنوات — يتحدى مباشرة السيري V لأوليفا.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Perdomo 20th Anniversary\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Launched 2012. 5-year-aged Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper — entirely Nicaraguan. Notes of dark chocolate, strong coffee, long black pepper, leather finish. Regular score 95+. The Sun Grown Natural Toro is often favorably compared to Oliva\'s Serie V. Toro format (54 x 152mm) recommended.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Box-Pressed Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2013}]}, {\"name\": \"Perdomo Habano\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Habano blend — Nicaraguan shade-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan ligero. Notes of coffee cream, soft spices, cedar. Medium-Full, balanced. Perdomo\'s \'everyday\' range — accessible without compromise on construction quality.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nick\'s Stick\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Perdomo\'s affordable range — named directly after the founder. Connecticut wrapper over Nicaraguan. Notes of toasted hazelnut, café au lait, gentle sweetness. Perfect for discovering the house without committing to a 20th Anniversary.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Perdomo 20th Anniversary\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Launched 2012. añejado 5 años Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper — entirely Nicaraguan. Notas de chocolate negro, strong café, long pimienta negra, cuero finish. Puntuación regular 95+. The Sun Grown Natural Toro is often favorably compared to Oliva\'s Serie V. Toro format (54 x 152mm) recommended.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Box-Pressed Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2013}]}, {\"name\": \"Perdomo Habano\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Habano blend — Nicaraguan shade-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan ligero. Notas de café cream, soft especias, cedro. Medium-Full, balanced. Perdomo\'s \'everyday\' range — accessible without compromise on construction quality.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nick\'s Stick\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Perdomo\'s affordable range — named directly after the founder. Connecticut wrapper over Nicaraguan. Notas de tostado avellana, café au lait, gentle sweetness. Perfect for discovering the house without committing to a 20th Anniversary.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Perdomo 20th Anniversary\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Launched 2012. 5 Jahre gereift Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper — entirely Nicaraguan. Noten von dunkle Schokolade, strong Kaffee, long schwarzer Pfeffer, Leder finish. Regular score 95+. The Sun Grown Natural Toro is often favorably compared to Oliva\'s Serie V. Toro format (54 x 152mm) recommended.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Box-Pressed Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2013}]}, {\"name\": \"Perdomo Habano\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Habano blend — Nicaraguan shade-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan ligero. Noten von Kaffee cream, soft Gewürze, Zeder. Medium-Full, balanced. Perdomo\'s \'everyday\' range — accessible without compromise on construction quality.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nick\'s Stick\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Perdomo\'s affordable range — named directly after the founder. Connecticut wrapper over Nicaraguan. Noten von geröstet Haselnuss, café au lait, gentle sweetness. Perfect for discovering the house without committing to a 20th Anniversary.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Perdomo 20th Anniversary\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Launched 2012. 陈化5年 Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper — entirely Nicaraguan. 风味： 黑巧克力, strong 咖啡, long 黑胡椒, 皮革 finish. Regular score 95+. The Sun Grown Natural Toro 常被与…相提并论 Oliva\'s Serie V. Toro format (54 x 152mm) recommended.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Box-Pressed Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2013}]}, {\"name\": \"Perdomo Habano\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Habano blend — Nicaraguan shade-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan ligero. 风味： 咖啡 cream, soft 香料, 雪松木. Medium-Full, balanced. Perdomo\'s \'everyday\' range — accessible without compromise on construction quality.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nick\'s Stick\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Perdomo\'s affordable range — named directly after the founder. Connecticut wrapper over Nicaraguan. 风味： 烘烤 榛子, café au lait, gentle sweetness. Perfect for discovering the house without committing to a 20th Anniversary.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Perdomo 20th Anniversary\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Launched 2012. معتَّق 5 سنوات Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper — entirely Nicaraguan. نكهات:  شوكولاتة داكنة, strong قهوة, long فلفل أسود, جلد finish. Regular score 95+. The Sun Grown Natural Toro is often favorably compared to Oliva\'s Serie V. Toro format (54 x 152mm) recommended.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Box-Pressed Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2013}]}, {\"name\": \"Perdomo Habano\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Habano blend — Nicaraguan shade-grown wrapper over Nicaraguan ligero. نكهات:  قهوة cream, soft توابل, أرز. Medium-Full, balanced. Perdomo\'s \'everyday\' range — accessible without compromise on construction quality.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Habano\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Epicure\"]}, {\"name\": \"Nick\'s Stick\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Perdomo\'s affordable range — named directly after the founder. Connecticut wrapper over Nicaraguan. نكهات:  محمَّص بندق, café au lait, gentle sweetness. Perfect for discovering the house without committing to a 20th Anniversary.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Nick Perdomo\", \"anecdote\": \"Perdomo tests each blend by smoking them blindly — without knowing which prototype he\'s smoking. He developed this method after realizing his knowledge of the blend influenced his evaluation. A scientist\'s rigor in a craftsman\'s workshop.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Nick Perdomo\", \"anecdote\": \"Perdomo tests each blend by smoking them blindly — without knowing which prototype he\'s smoking. He developed this method after realizing his knowledge of the blend influenced his evaluation. A scientist\'s rigor in a craftsman\'s workshop.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Nick Perdomo\", \"anecdote\": \"Perdomo tests each blend by smoking them blindly — without knowing which prototype he\'s smoking. He developed this method after realizing his knowledge of the blend influenced his evaluation. A scientist\'s rigor in a craftsman\'s workshop.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Nick Perdomo\", \"anecdote\": \"Perdomo tests each blend by smoking them blindly — without knowing which prototype he\'s smoking. He developed this method after realizing his knowledge of the blend influenced his evaluation. A scientist\'s rigor in a craftsman\'s workshop.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Nick Perdomo\", \"anecdote\": \"Perdomo tests each blend by smoking them blindly — without knowing which prototype he\'s smoking. He developed this method after realizing his knowledge of the blend influenced his evaluation. A scientist\'s rigor in a craftsman\'s workshop.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguans of the same terroir — the cane rum and the Jalapa tobacco cigar. Shared caramel and vanilla notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The Nicaraguan mountain coffee, with its orange and cocoa notes, amplifies the chocolaty complexity of the 20th Anniversary.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Ron\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguans of the same terroir — the cane rum and the Jalapa tobacco cigar. Shared caramel and vanilla notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The Nicaraguan mountain coffee, with its orange and cocoa notes, amplifies the chocolaty complexity of the 20th Anniversary.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguans of the same terroir — the cane rum and the Jalapa tobacco cigar. Shared caramel and vanilla notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The Nicaraguan mountain coffee, with its orange and cocoa notes, amplifies the chocolaty complexity of the 20th Anniversary.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"朗姆酒\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguans of the same terroir — the cane rum and the Jalapa tobacco cigar. Shared caramel and vanilla notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The Nicaraguan mountain coffee, with its orange and cocoa notes, amplifies the chocolaty complexity of the 20th Anniversary.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الروم\", \"name\": \"Ron Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguans of the same terroir — the cane rum and the Jalapa tobacco cigar. Shared caramel and vanilla notes.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The Nicaraguan mountain coffee, with its orange and cocoa notes, amplifies the chocolaty complexity of the 20th Anniversary.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Perdomo';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Connecticut shade tobacco story has two chapters. The first is set in the Connecticut River Valley, where sandy soil and diffuse light have produced America\'s most celebrated wrapper leaf for over two centuries. The second chapter — less familiar, and in some respects more interesting — is set in Ecuador, where farmers recognized in the 1990s that the country\'s near-equatorial altitude and constant cloud cover could replicate the conditions that make Connecticut shade distinctive, and potentially improve on them.\r\n\r\nEcuadorian Connecticut shade grows at elevations where thinner air and consistent cloud diffusion create natural growing conditions analogous to the shade tents that Connecticut farmers must construct artificially. The result is a leaf with the signature Connecticut creaminess, but with additional complexity derived from volcanic soils and the specific microclimate of the Ecuadorian Andes. Several major manufacturers — Davidoff prominently among them — now source their Connecticut-style wrappers from Ecuador rather than Connecticut itself.\r\n\r\nPerdomo\'s Ecuador range builds its entire proposition around this sourcing choice. The wrapper is the product of high-altitude Ecuadorian cultivation, bringing to the blend a silkier texture and more pronounced oil content than standard Connecticut shade. Beneath it, a Nicaraguan Jalapa filler blend — lighter than what appears in the Perdomo 20th Anniversary, calibrated specifically to allow the wrapper to lead — delivers notes of cream, mild vanilla, and toasted grain without the weight that would overwhelm the Ecuador\'s inherent delicacy.\r\n\r\nThe range represents the softer face of a house known for Nicaraguan power. Nick Perdomo built his reputation on demonstrating that Nicaraguan tobacco could match Cuban tobacco in complexity and depth. The Ecuador range makes a different argument: that the same farm and the same blending precision can produce the most elegant style in the market when applied to lighter materials.', `history_es` = 'La gama Ecuador de Perdomo explota el envolvente Connecticut shade ecuatoriano cultivado en altitud. Las condiciones andinas crean un envolvente más suave y sedoso. Notas cremosas, ligereza notable. La cara suave de la casa Perdomo.', `history_de` = 'Die Ecuador-Linie von Perdomo nutzt den in der Höhe angebauten ecuadorianischen Connecticut-Shade-Wrapper. Die Andenbedingungen schaffen einen weicheren, seidigeren Wrapper. Cremige Noten, bemerkenswerte Leichtigkeit. Das sanfte Gesicht des Perdomo-Hauses.', `history_zh` = '帕德模的厄瓜多尔系列利用高海拔种植的厄瓜多尔康涅狄格遮阴茄衣。安第斯山脉的条件创造出更柔和、更丝滑的茄衣。奶油风味，轻盈感突出。帕德模品牌的柔和面孔。', `history_ar` = 'تشكيلة إكوادور من بيردومو تستغل غلافة Connecticut Shade الإكوادورية المزروعة على الارتفاعات. الظروف الأندية تُنتج غلافة أكثر نعومة وحريرية. نكهات كريمية وخفة لافتة.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Perdomo Ecuador\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade wrapper over Nicaraguan filler. Notes of cream, Ecuadorian vanilla, hazelnut. Light-medium. The range for enthusiasts discovering Perdomo without committing straight away to the full-bodied 20th Anniversary.\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Perdomo Ecuador\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"Capa Connecticut Shade ecuatoriana sobre tripa nicaragüense. Notas de nata, vainilla ecuatoriana y avellana. Ligero-medio. La gama para quienes descubren Perdomo sin querer comprometerse de entrada con el cuerpo pleno del 20th Anniversary.\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Perdomo Ecuador\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"Ecuadorianisches Connecticut-Shade-Deckblatt über nicaraguanischer Einlage. Noten von Sahne, ecuadorianischer Vanille und Haselnuss. Leicht bis mittel. Die Linie für Liebhaber, die Perdomo entdecken, ohne sich gleich auf die kräftige 20th Anniversary einzulassen.\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Perdomo Ecuador\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"厄瓜多尔 Connecticut Shade 茄衣，配尼加拉瓜填充。奶油、厄瓜多尔香草与榛果的气息。轻至中度。这条线是给刚认识 Perdomo、又不想一上来就挑战 20th Anniversary 那份浓郁的人。\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Perdomo Ecuador\",\"color\":\"#C9A96E\",\"story\":\"غلاف Connecticut Shade إكوادوري على حشوة نيكاراغوية. لمسات من القشدة والفانيليا الإكوادورية والبندق. خفيف–متوسط. وهي التشكيلة المخصّصة لمن يكتشف Perdomo دون أن يلتزم فوراً بالجسم الكامل لـ 20th Anniversary.\",\"force\":\"Light-Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Connecticut Shade\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Toro\",\"Churchill\",\"Torpedo\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'Perdomo Ecuador';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Plasencia family has grown tobacco since 1865 — a continuity spanning five generations, two continents, and one of the tobacco industry\'s most profound upheavals. What began in Cuba\'s Pinar del Río province survived the Cuban revolution, the Nicaraguan revolution, the Contra war, and a half-century of economic instability across Central America to emerge as arguably the most important independent tobacco family in the world.\r\n\r\nThe exile from Cuba in 1961 set the trajectory. Like most Cuban tobacco families, the Plasencias carried their seeds, their knowledge, and their professional contacts into displacement. Unlike most, they found their way to land that proved genuinely exceptional. The Jalapa Valley in northern Nicaragua — a volcanic basin at 900 meters altitude, with consistent humidity and temperature ranges that replicate many of the conditions that make Vuelta Abajo distinctive — became their primary base of operations.\r\n\r\nFor decades, the Plasencia story was invisible to cigar consumers but essential to virtually every major manufacturer. The family supplied leaf to Davidoff, who used it in the Millennium Blend. They supplied Padrón, who used it in the 1926 Series. They supplied My Father, who built his Nicaraguan identity partly on their leaf. Ashton, Rocky Patel, Alec Bradley — the list of houses whose premium Nicaraguan production depends on Plasencia leaf reads like a directory of the American market\'s finest.\r\n\r\nThe Alma Fuerte, launched in 2018, was the family\'s first serious effort at creating cigars under their own identity. The name — Strong Soul — signals what the Plasencias wanted to say about themselves after fifty years of supporting other people\'s brands. The blend uses the finest tobaccos from across their Nicaraguan and Honduran operations, rolled in formats of unusual size and construction complexity. The market response was immediate: a 96-point score from Cigar Aficionado, and allocation demands that exceeded production within the first year.\r\n\r\nThe family now operates over 3,000 acres of plantations across Nicaragua, Honduras, and Guatemala. No other independent grower approaches that scale. Perfecto García, the current generation\'s patriarch, still walks the fields. The operation that began in nineteenth-century Cuba has never stopped growing.', `history_es` = 'La familia Plasencia cultiva tabaco desde 1865 — cinco generaciones ininterrumpidas. Proveedor secreto de Davidoff, Padrón, My Father y docenas más durante décadas. En 2018 lanzó finalmente el Alma Fuerte — su primera creación verdaderamente \'firma\'. Sus plantaciones cubren más de 3000 acres en tres países.', `history_de` = 'Die Familie Plasencia baut seit 1865 Tabak an — fünf ununterbrochene Generationen. Jahrzehntelang geheimer Lieferant von Davidoff, Padrón, My Father und Dutzenden anderen. 2018 lancierte sie endlich den Alma Fuerte — ihre erste wirklich \'Signature\'-Kreation. Ihre Plantagen umfassen über 3000 Acres in drei Ländern.', `history_zh` = '普拉森西亚家族自1865年起种植烟草——五代人不间断传承。数十年来是大卫杜夫、帕德隆、我的父亲等数十个品牌的秘密供应商。2018年终于推出Alma Fuerte——他们第一款真正的\'签名\'创作。种植园覆盖三个国家超过3000英亩。', `history_ar` = 'تزرع عائلة بلاسينسيا التبغ منذ 1865 — خمسة أجيال متواصلة. لعقود كانت المورِّد السري لديفيدوف وبادرون وماي فاذر وعشرات سواها. عام 2018 أطلقت أخيرًا ألما فويرتي — أول إبداع \'توقيع\' حقيقي لها. مزارعها تغطي أكثر من 3000 فدان في ثلاثة بلدان.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Alma Fuerte\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2018, Cigar Aficionado score 95. Box-pressed (square section), Robustus Magnus format (58 x 127mm). Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper over triple ligero from their own plantations. Notes of iced coffee, red leather, Kampot pepper, licorice. Plasencia\'s declaration of independence.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robustus Magnus\", \"Toro Largo\", \"Nestor IV\", \"Generacion V\", \"Sixto I\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Cosecha 146\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Named \'146\' for the 146th harvest since the 1865 founding. Annual blend, each vintage different depending on the crop. A unique concept in the cigar world — Plasencia publishes tasting notes for each vintage like a Bordeaux château.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Alma del Campo\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"\'The Soul of the Field\' — tribute to plantation workers. Corona format (44 x 140mm). Medium, accessible, with the Plasencia earthy signature. Notes of dried hay, aromatic herbs, light wood. The everyday cigar for enthusiasts who know the house\'s secrets.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Travesía\", \"Candela\", \"Toro\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Alma Fuerte\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2018, Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 95. Box-pressed (square section), Robustus Magnus format (58 x 127mm). Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper over triple ligero from their own plantations. Notas de iced café, red cuero, Kampot pimienta, regaliz. Plasencia\'s declaration of independence.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robustus Magnus\", \"Toro Largo\", \"Nestor IV\", \"Generacion V\", \"Sixto I\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Cosecha 146\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Named \'146\' for the 146th harvest since the 1865 founding. Annual blend, each vintage different depending on the crop. A unique concept in the cigar world — Plasencia publishes tasting notes for each vintage like a Bordeaux château.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Alma del Campo\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"\'The Soul of the Field\' — tribute to plantation workers. Corona format (44 x 140mm). Medium, accessible, with the Plasencia earthy signature. Notas de dried hay, aromatic herbs, light wood. The everyday cigar for aficionados who know la secrets.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Travesía\", \"Candela\", \"Toro\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Alma Fuerte\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2018, Cigar Aficionado Score 95. Box-pressed (square section), Robustus Magnus format (58 x 127mm). Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper over triple ligero from their own plantations. Noten von iced Kaffee, red Leder, Kampot Pfeffer, licorice. Plasencia\'s declaration of independence.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robustus Magnus\", \"Toro Largo\", \"Nestor IV\", \"Generacion V\", \"Sixto I\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Cosecha 146\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Named \'146\' for the 146th harvest since the 1865 founding. Annual blend, each vintage different depending on the crop. A unique concept in the cigar world — Plasencia publishes tasting notes for each vintage like a Bordeaux château.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Alma del Campo\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"\'The Soul of the Field\' — tribute to plantation workers. Corona format (44 x 140mm). Medium, accessible, with the Plasencia earthy signature. Noten von dried hay, aromatic herbs, light wood. The everyday cigar for enthusiasts who know the house\'s secrets.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Travesía\", \"Candela\", \"Toro\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Alma Fuerte\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2018, 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 95. Box-pressed (square section), Robustus Magnus format (58 x 127mm). Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper over triple ligero from their own plantations. 风味： iced 咖啡, red 皮革, Kampot 胡椒, 甘草. Plasencia\'s declaration of independence.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robustus Magnus\", \"Toro Largo\", \"Nestor IV\", \"Generacion V\", \"Sixto I\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Cosecha 146\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Named \'146\' for the 146th harvest since the 1865 founding. Annual blend, each vintage different depending on the crop. A unique concept in the cigar world — Plasencia publishes tasting notes for each vintage like a Bordeaux château.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Alma del Campo\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"\'The Soul of the Field\' — tribute to plantation workers. Corona format (44 x 140mm). Medium, accessible, with the Plasencia earthy signature. 风味： dried hay, aromatic herbs, light wood. The everyday cigar for 爱好者 who know the house\'s secrets.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Travesía\", \"Candela\", \"Toro\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Alma Fuerte\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Launched 2018, تقييم Cigar Aficionado 95. Box-pressed (square section), Robustus Magnus format (58 x 127mm). Nicaraguan oscuro wrapper over triple ligero from their own plantations. نكهات:  iced قهوة, red جلد, Kampot فلفل, عرق السوس. Plasencia\'s declaration of independence.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robustus Magnus\", \"Toro Largo\", \"Nestor IV\", \"Generacion V\", \"Sixto I\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Cosecha 146\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Named \'146\' for the 146th harvest since the 1865 founding. Annual blend, each vintage different depending on the crop. A unique concept in the cigar world — Plasencia publishes tasting notes for each vintage like a Bordeaux château.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Alma del Campo\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"\'The Soul of the Field\' — tribute to plantation workers. Corona format (44 x 140mm). Medium, accessible, with the Plasencia earthy signature. نكهات:  dried hay, aromatic herbs, light wood. The everyday cigar for المتحمسون who know the house\'s secrets.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Travesía\", \"Candela\", \"Toro\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He is the only person in the world who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he reportedly said.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He es el único person in the world who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he supuestamente said.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He is the only person in the world who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he angeblich said.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He 是唯一 person 在世界上 who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he 据报道 said.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He هو الوحيد person في العالم who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he يُقال إن said.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguan icons of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. Notes of caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Ron\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"Dos iconos nicaragüenses of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. Notas de caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguan icons of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. Noten von caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"朗姆酒\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"两个尼加拉瓜的标志 of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. 风味： caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الروم\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguan icons of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. نكهات: caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Plasencia';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Punch was born in 1840, the same year that the British satirical magazine bearing the same name published its first issue. The coincidence was not accidental. Manuel López, the Spanish manufacturer who created the brand in Havana, was targeting the British market with precision. He understood that English buyers — who already dominated Cuban cigar imports through houses like Hunters & Frankau — responded to wit, to cultural reference, to the sense that a luxury product understood their world. Naming a cigar after London\'s sharpest satirical journal was a statement of cultural alignment. It worked immediately.\r\n\r\nThe Mr. Punch character — the hook-nosed, pointy-hatted jester of the Punch and Judy tradition — appeared on the brand\'s bands from the first year and has remained there for 180 years. He is tobacco\'s longest-serving mascot, predating every corporate logo in the modern industry. Victorian London\'s gentlemen\'s clubs — White\'s, Brooks\'s, the Reform, the Garrick — maintained dedicated Punch cellars. The brand supplied royal households. The expression of satisfaction at the delivery of a long-awaited order became, briefly, one of the meanings of the phrase \'pleased as Punch.\'\r\n\r\nDuring the mid-nineteenth century, Punch was the best-selling cigar brand in the British market — a position it maintained until the First World War disrupted trade and changed smoking habits permanently. The brand survived both world wars, nationalization in 1959, and the American trade embargo that removed it from the United States market entirely. Through all of this, the factory — shared with H. Upmann at the Havana address that both brands still occupy — maintained the quality standards that had built the original reputation.\r\n\r\nThe Punch aromatic profile occupies the middle ground of the Cuban spectrum with considerable authority. Woody and peppery on entry, with notes of roasted cashew and white cedar in the middle, resolving in the final third into a long finish of dried fruit and faint honey. It is not the most powerful Cuban and not the most delicate. It is, instead, the most dependably pleasurable — the cigar that experienced smokers reach for when they want conversation and company rather than a solo meditation.\r\n\r\nThe Punch Double Corona, at 49 x 194mm, is one of the format\'s finest expressions in the Cuban portfolio — 90 minutes that demonstrate what mature Vuelta Abajo tobacco can do with sufficient time and ring gauge. The Punch Punch, the house\'s signature Robusto, delivers the full profile in 45 minutes with a consistency that has made it one of the most reviewed and re-reviewed cigars in Havana\'s catalog. Cigar Aficionado has rated it between 91 and 94 across six separate assessments — a record of reliability that speaks directly to what the brand has always offered: not surprise, but confidence.', `history_es` = 'Punch nació en 1840 bajo Manuel López, tomando su nombre de la famosa revista británica del mismo año. Fue el cigarro más vendido en Gran Bretaña durante la era victoriana. Sus notas maderosas y pimienta a precio moderado lo convierten en la puerta de entrada para muchos aficionados.', `history_de` = 'Punch wurde 1840 von Manuel López gegründet und nach der gleichnamigen britischen Satirezeitschrift benannt. Im viktorianischen Zeitalter war es die meistverkaufte Zigarre in Großbritannien. Seine holzigen, pfeffrigen Noten zu moderatem Preis machen es für viele zum Einstieg.', `history_zh` = 'Punch于1840年由曼努埃尔·洛佩斯创立，以同年创刊的英国讽刺杂志命名。维多利亚时代是英国最畅销的雪茄。木质与胡椒风味、价格适中，是许多爱好者的入门之选。', `history_ar` = 'أُسِّست Punch عام 1840 على يد مانويل لوبيث، واتُّخذ اسمها من المجلة البريطانية الساخرة الصادرة في العام ذاته. كانت الأكثر مبيعًا في بريطانيا خلال العهد الفيكتوري. نكهاتها الخشبية والفلفلية بسعر معقول تجعلها بوابة الدخول لكثير من المتذوقين.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90 minutes of woody, peppery smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. Notes of oak, white pepper, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. Notes of cedar wood, pepper, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For enthusiasts who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90 minutos of woody, pimientay smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. Notas de oak, white pimienta, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. Notas de cedro wood, pimienta, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For aficionados who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90 Minuten of woody, Pfeffery smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. Noten von oak, white Pfeffer, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. Noten von Zeder wood, Pfeffer, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For enthusiasts who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90分钟 of woody, 胡椒y smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. 风味： oak, white 胡椒, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. 风味： 雪松木 wood, 胡椒, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For 爱好者 who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90 دقيقة of woody, فلفلy smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. نكهات:  oak, white فلفل, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. نكهات:  أرز wood, فلفل, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For المتحمسون who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he smoked them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. He reportedly said: \'The cigar is the only luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he fumaba them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. Supuestamente dijo: \'The cigar es el único luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he rauchte them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. Er soll gesagt haben: \'The cigar is the only luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he smoked them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. 据报道他曾说： \'The cigar 是唯一 luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he smoked them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. يُروى أنه قال: \'The cigar هو الوحيد luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Beer\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"The natural pairing — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Cerveza\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"El maridaje natural — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"Vino\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Bier\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"Die natürliche Paarung — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wein\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"啤酒\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"天然的搭配 — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"葡萄酒\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"البيرة\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"المقارنة الطبيعية — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"النبيذ\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Punch';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Honduras page announced Punch, and the link led to the Cuban article — that of a brand founded in Havana in 1840 for the English market, with its Mr. Punch puppet on the lid. The reader was therefore given the history of a cigar he would not find in Honduras. This article puts that misunderstanding right.\n\nThe Honduran Punch was born of the Cuban nationalisation: the name, taken up outside the island, has been made in Honduras since the 1960s and was sold in the United States throughout the embargo. It built its own following there, on a profile earthier and fuller than the Havana\'s, and on prices that stayed affordable while the Cuban became a rare commodity.\n\nTwo brands, two countries, one shared name inherited from the same nineteenth century — one of the scars 1960 left on the geography of the cigar, and the atlas shows it rather than smoothing it over.', `history_es` = 'La ficha de Honduras anunciaba Punch, y el enlace llevaba al artículo cubano — el de una marca de 1840 fundada en La Habana para el mercado inglés, con su Mr. Punch de marioneta en la tapa. El lector leía, pues, la historia de un cigarro que no encontraría en Honduras. Este artículo repara ese malentendido.\n\nEl Punch hondureño nació de la nacionalización cubana: el nombre, retomado fuera de la isla, se fabrica en Honduras desde los años sesenta y se vendió en Estados Unidos durante todo el embargo. Allí construyó su propia clientela, sobre un perfil más terroso y más fuerte que el habano, y sobre unos precios que siguieron siendo accesibles cuando el cubano se volvía un producto raro.\n\nDos marcas, dos países, un mismo nombre heredado de un mismo siglo XIX — una de las cicatrices que 1960 dejó en la geografía del cigarro, y el atlas la muestra en lugar de alisarla.', `history_de` = 'Die Honduras-Seite kündigte Punch an, und der Link führte zum kubanischen Artikel — dem einer 1840 in Havanna für den englischen Markt gegründeten Marke, mit ihrer Mr.-Punch-Puppe auf dem Deckel. Der Leser bekam also die Geschichte einer Zigarre, die er in Honduras nicht finden würde. Dieser Artikel räumt das Missverständnis aus.\n\nDer honduranische Punch entstand aus der kubanischen Verstaatlichung: Der außerhalb der Insel wieder aufgenommene Name wird seit den 1960er Jahren in Honduras gefertigt und wurde während des gesamten Embargos in den Vereinigten Staaten verkauft. Dort baute er sich eine eigene Kundschaft auf — mit einem erdigeren, kräftigeren Profil als die Havanna und mit Preisen, die erschwinglich blieben, während die Kubanerin zur Rarität wurde.\n\nZwei Marken, zwei Länder, ein gemeinsamer, aus demselben 19. Jahrhundert ererbter Name — eine der Narben, die 1960 in der Geografie der Zigarre hinterlassen hat, und der Atlas zeigt sie, statt sie zu glätten.', `history_zh` = '洪都拉斯的国家页写着「潘趣」，链接却指向古巴的条目——那是一个1840年在哈瓦那为英国市场创立的品牌，盒盖上有它的潘趣先生木偶。读者因而读到的，是一支他在洪都拉斯根本找不到的雪茄的历史。这篇文章纠正了这个误会。\n\n洪都拉斯的潘趣源于古巴的国有化：这个名字在岛外被重新启用，自1960年代起在洪都拉斯生产，并在整个禁运期间行销美国。它在那里建立了自己的客群，靠的是比哈瓦那更带土味、更浓郁的风格，以及在古巴雪茄日渐稀有之时仍保持可及的价格。\n\n两个品牌，两个国家，一个继承自同一个十九世纪的共同名字——这是1960年在雪茄地理上留下的伤疤之一，而这部图册选择呈现它，而非将其抹平。', `history_ar` = 'كانت صفحة هندوراس تعلن «بانش»، بينما يقود الرابط إلى المقالة الكوبية — مقالة علامة تأسّست في هافانا سنة 1840 للسوق الإنكليزية، بدميتها «مستر بانش» على الغطاء. فكان القارئ يقرأ تاريخ سيجار لن يجده في هندوراس. وهذه المقالة تصحّح ذلك الالتباس.\n\nوُلد «بانش» الهندوراسي من التأميم الكوبي: فالاسم، الذي استُؤنف خارج الجزيرة، يُصنع في هندوراس منذ الستينيات وبِيع في الولايات المتحدة طوال فترة الحصار. وهناك بنى جمهوره الخاص، بطابع أكثر ترابية وقوّة من الهافانا، وبأسعار بقيت في المتناول بينما صار الكوبي سلعة نادرة.\n\nعلامتان وبلدان واسم واحد موروث عن القرن التاسع عشر ذاته — إحدى الندوب التي خلّفها عام 1960 في جغرافيا السيجار، والأطلس يُظهرها بدل أن يطمسها.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Punch Honduras\",\"color\":\"#7B3F00\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Ecuadorian Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"Earth, wood, frank pepper: the classic Honduran profile, at a price that made its following throughout the embargo. Nothing to do with the Havana of the same name.\"},{\"name\":\"Punch Gran Puro\",\"color\":\"#4E342E\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"A Honduran puro — every leaf comes from the country, filler included. The demonstration that Honduras is sufficient unto itself.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Punch Honduras\",\"color\":\"#7B3F00\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano de Ecuador\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"Tierra, madera, pimienta franca: el perfil hondureño clásico, a un precio que le dio su clientela durante todo el embargo. Nada que ver con el habano del mismo nombre.\"},{\"name\":\"Punch Gran Puro\",\"color\":\"#4E342E\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Un puro hondureño — todo el tabaco viene del país, tripa incluida. La demostración de que Honduras se basta a sí mismo.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Punch Honduras\",\"color\":\"#7B3F00\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano aus Ecuador\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"Erde, Holz, offener Pfeffer: das klassische honduranische Profil, zu einem Preis, der ihm während des gesamten Embargos seine Kundschaft sicherte. Mit der gleichnamigen Havanna hat es nichts zu tun.\"},{\"name\":\"Punch Gran Puro\",\"color\":\"#4E342E\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"Ein honduranischer Puro — sämtlicher Tabak stammt aus dem Land, die Einlage eingeschlossen. Der Beweis, dass Honduras sich selbst genügt.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Punch Honduras\",\"color\":\"#7B3F00\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"厄瓜多尔哈瓦那种\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"泥土、木质、直率的胡椒：典型的洪都拉斯风格，价格则在整个禁运期间为它赢得客群。与同名的哈瓦那毫无关系。\"},{\"name\":\"Punch Gran Puro\",\"color\":\"#4E342E\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"一支洪都拉斯纯产雪茄——包括茄芯在内的所有烟叶都来自本国。证明洪都拉斯可以自给自足。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Punch Honduras\",\"color\":\"#7B3F00\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"هابانو إكوادوري\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\",\"Churchill\"],\"story\":\"تراب وخشب وفلفل صريح: الطابع الهندوراسي الكلاسيكي، بسعرٍ صنع له جمهوره طوال الحصار. لا صلة له بالهافانا ذات الاسم نفسه.\"},{\"name\":\"Punch Gran Puro\",\"color\":\"#4E342E\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Maduro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Toro\"],\"story\":\"«بورو» هندوراسي — كل التبغ من البلد، بما في ذلك الحشوة. برهان على أن هندوراس تكفي نفسها.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"Honduran rum\",\"notes\":\"A pairing of country, on a cigar that lays claim to its terroir down to the filler.\"},{\"type\":\"Coffee\",\"name\":\"Black coffee\",\"notes\":\"The pepper of the blend can take a frank roast.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Ron hondureño\",\"notes\":\"Un acuerdo de país, sobre un cigarro que reivindica su terruño hasta en la tripa.\"},{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Café solo\",\"notes\":\"La pimienta de la liga soporta un tueste franco.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Honduranischer Rum\",\"notes\":\"Eine Verbindung des Landes, bei einer Zigarre, die ihr Terroir bis in die Einlage beansprucht.\"},{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Schwarzer Kaffee\",\"notes\":\"Der Pfeffer des Blends verträgt eine kräftige Röstung.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"洪都拉斯朗姆\",\"notes\":\"同一国度的呼应，配一支从茄芯起就宣示风土的雪茄。\"},{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"清咖啡\",\"notes\":\"配方中的胡椒足以承受重度烘焙。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"روم هندوراسي\",\"notes\":\"تناغم بلد واحد، مع سيجار يدّعي أرضه حتى في حشوته.\"},{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة سوداء\",\"notes\":\"فلفل الخلطة يحتمل تحميصاً صريحاً.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Punch Honduras';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Quesada family has been in tobacco since the end of the nineteenth century, first in Cuba, then in the Dominican Republic, where it settled in the 1970s — before the wave that made the country the first destination of the premium cigar. That head start counts: when the great houses arrived, the Quesadas were already there, with their Santiago factory.\n\nThe house long worked in the shadows, producing for other brands as much as for its own, and cultivating a discretion that contrasts with the commercial exuberance of the trade. It is now run by the next generation and remains one of the few large Dominican houses still independent and family-held.\n\nIts style follows the classic Dominican temperament: balance, suppleness, an elegance that seeks no effect. Casa Magna, its best-known blend, is the exception, reaching for Nicaraguan strength — a way of showing that the house can do something other than what is expected of it.', `history_es` = 'La familia Quesada trabaja el tabaco desde finales del siglo XIX, primero en Cuba y después en la República Dominicana, donde se instaló en los años setenta — antes de la ola que hizo del país el primer destino del cigarro premium. Esa anterioridad cuenta: cuando llegaron las grandes casas, los Quesada ya estaban allí, con su fábrica de Santiago.\n\nLa casa trabajó mucho tiempo en la sombra, produciendo para otras marcas tanto como para la suya, y cultivando una discreción que contrasta con la exuberancia comercial del oficio. Hoy la dirige la generación siguiente y sigue siendo una de las escasas grandes casas dominicanas aún independientes y familiares.\n\nSu estilo sigue el temperamento dominicano clásico: equilibrio, flexibilidad, una elegancia que no busca el efecto. Casa Magna, su liga más conocida, es la excepción y va a buscar la fuerza nicaragüense — una manera de mostrar que la casa sabe hacer algo distinto de lo que se espera de ella.', `history_de` = 'Die Familie Quesada ist seit dem Ende des 19. Jahrhunderts im Tabak tätig, zunächst auf Kuba, dann in der Dominikanischen Republik, wo sie sich in den 1970er Jahren niederließ — vor jener Welle, die das Land zur ersten Adresse der Premiumzigarre machte. Dieser Vorsprung zählt: Als die großen Häuser kamen, waren die Quesadas mit ihrer Manufaktur in Santiago bereits da.\n\nLange arbeitete das Haus im Verborgenen, produzierte für andere Marken ebenso wie für die eigene und pflegte eine Zurückhaltung, die zur kommerziellen Überschwänglichkeit des Gewerbes im Gegensatz steht. Heute führt es die nächste Generation, und es bleibt eines der wenigen großen dominikanischen Häuser, die noch unabhängig und in Familienhand sind.\n\nSein Stil folgt dem klassischen dominikanischen Temperament: Ausgewogenheit, Geschmeidigkeit, eine Eleganz ohne Effekthascherei. Casa Magna, sein bekanntester Blend, bildet die Ausnahme und greift nach nicaraguanischer Kraft — eine Art zu zeigen, dass das Haus auch anderes kann als das, was man von ihm erwartet.', `history_zh` = '克萨达家族自十九世纪末就从事烟草，先在古巴，后于1970年代落户多米尼加共和国——那还在使该国成为优质雪茄第一产地的浪潮之前。这份先手很重要：当大厂到来时，克萨达一家已经在那里，带着他们位于圣地亚哥的工厂。\n\n这家企业长期在幕后工作，为别的品牌代工不亚于为自己生产，并保持着与行业商业喧嚣相反的低调。如今由下一代执掌，仍是少数依然独立且属于家族的多米尼加大厂之一。\n\n其风格遵循经典的多米尼加气质：平衡、柔顺，一种不追求效果的优雅。最广为人知的配方「卡萨玛格纳」是个例外，它去追寻尼加拉瓜的力度——这是一种表态：这家会做的，不止于人们对它的期待。', `history_ar` = 'تعمل عائلة كيسادا في التبغ منذ أواخر القرن التاسع عشر، في كوبا أولاً ثم في الجمهورية الدومينيكية حيث استقرّت في السبعينيات — قبل الموجة التي جعلت البلاد الوجهة الأولى للسيجار الفاخر. وهذه الأسبقية مهمّة: فحين وصلت البيوت الكبرى، كان آل كيسادا هناك بالفعل، بمصنعهم في سانتياغو.\n\nعملت الدار طويلاً في الظلّ، تنتج لعلامات أخرى بقدر ما تنتج لنفسها، وتحافظ على تحفّظ يناقض الصخب التجاري في المهنة. ويقودها اليوم الجيل التالي، وتبقى من البيوت الدومينيكية الكبرى القليلة التي لا تزال مستقلّة وعائلية.\n\nأسلوبها يتبع المزاج الدومينيكي الكلاسيكي: توازن ومرونة وأناقة لا تبحث عن الأثر. أمّا «كاسا ماغنا»، خلطتها الأشهر، فهي الاستثناء إذ تذهب إلى القوّة النيكاراغوية — طريقة لتقول إن الدار تُحسن غير ما يُنتظَر منها.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\":\"Casa Magna\",\"color\":\"#7C3030\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Nicaraguan Habano\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"The deliberate departure of a Dominican house: Nicaraguan filler, full strength, pepper and earth. The blend that made the family known beyond its own country.\"},{\"name\":\"Quesada Reserva Privada\",\"color\":\"#B5651D\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\"],\"story\":\"The house style in its usual register: balanced, supple, without demonstration. A cigar you let yourself forget, in the best sense.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Casa Magna\",\"color\":\"#7C3030\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano de Nicaragua\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"El desvío asumido de una casa dominicana: tripa nicaragüense, fuerza plena, pimienta y tierra. La liga que dio a conocer a la familia más allá de su país.\"},{\"name\":\"Quesada Reserva Privada\",\"color\":\"#B5651D\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\"],\"story\":\"El estilo de la casa en su registro habitual: equilibrado, flexible, sin demostración. Un cigarro que se deja olvidar, en el buen sentido.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Casa Magna\",\"color\":\"#7C3030\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano aus Nicaragua\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"Der bewusste Ausbruch eines dominikanischen Hauses: nicaraguanische Einlage, volle Kraft, Pfeffer und Erde. Der Blend, der die Familie über ihr Land hinaus bekannt machte.\"},{\"name\":\"Quesada Reserva Privada\",\"color\":\"#B5651D\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\"],\"story\":\"Der Hausstil in seinem gewohnten Register: ausgewogen, geschmeidig, ohne Zurschaustellung. Eine Zigarre, die man vergessen darf — im besten Sinne.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Casa Magna\",\"color\":\"#7C3030\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"尼加拉瓜哈瓦那种\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"一家多米尼加企业刻意的出格：尼加拉瓜茄芯，全力度，胡椒与泥土。正是这款配方让这个家族的名字越出国界。\"},{\"name\":\"Quesada Reserva Privada\",\"color\":\"#B5651D\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\"],\"story\":\"这家惯常的风格：平衡、柔顺、不事张扬。一支可以让人忘掉它存在的雪茄——这是褒义。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Casa Magna\",\"color\":\"#7C3030\",\"force\":\"Full\",\"wrapper\":\"هابانو نيكاراغوي\",\"vitolas\":[\"Robusto\"],\"story\":\"خروج مقصود من دار دومينيكية: حشوة نيكاراغوية وقوّة كاملة وفلفل وتراب. الخلطة التي عرّفت بالعائلة خارج بلدها.\"},{\"name\":\"Quesada Reserva Privada\",\"color\":\"#B5651D\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Connecticut Broadleaf\",\"vitolas\":[\"Corona Gorda\"],\"story\":\"أسلوب الدار في مزاجه المعتاد: متوازن، مرن، بلا استعراض. سيجار يسمح لك بأن تنساه، بالمعنى الجميل.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirits\",\"name\":\"Spanish brandy\",\"notes\":\"The roundness of the brandy embraces the Dominican balance rather than jostling it.\"},{\"type\":\"Coffee\",\"name\":\"Dominican coffee from the Cibao\",\"notes\":\"Grown in the same valley as the factory: the shortest pairing there is.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Destilados\",\"name\":\"Brandy español\",\"notes\":\"La redondez del brandy abraza el equilibrio dominicano en vez de sacudirlo.\"},{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Café dominicano del Cibao\",\"notes\":\"Cultivado en el mismo valle que la fábrica: el acuerdo más corto posible.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Spirituosen\",\"name\":\"Spanischer Brandy\",\"notes\":\"Die Rundheit des Brandys umfasst die dominikanische Balance, statt sie zu stören.\"},{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Dominikanischer Kaffee aus dem Cibao\",\"notes\":\"Im selben Tal angebaut wie die Manufaktur: die kürzestmögliche Verbindung.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"烈酒\",\"name\":\"西班牙白兰地\",\"notes\":\"白兰地的圆润顺应多米尼加式的平衡，而非扰乱它。\"},{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"锡瓦奥谷多米尼加咖啡\",\"notes\":\"与工厂同处一谷：最短的一种呼应。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"مشروبات روحية\",\"name\":\"براندي إسباني\",\"notes\":\"استدارة البراندي تحتضن التوازن الدومينيكي بدل أن تزعزعه.\"},{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة دومينيكية من سيباو\",\"notes\":\"تُزرع في الوادي نفسه الذي يقوم فيه المصنع: أقصر تناغم ممكن.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Quesada';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Quintero is the best-kept secret of the Habanos portfolio. Founded in 1924 in Cienfuegos by Agustín Quintero Benítez, the manufacture produced for decades cigars destined almost exclusively for the Spanish market — a country that developed with Quintero a relationship of fidelity comparable to the British relationship with Romeo y Julieta.\r\n\r\nQuintero\'s originality lies in its regional provenance. Unlike the great Havana brands that source exclusively from western Vuelta Abajo, Quintero historically used tobaccos from Vuelta Arriba — the eastern provinces of Cuba — lighter, more herbaceous, with an aromatic signature distinctly different from the western terroir. This particularity created a unique profile: unmistakably Cuban, but with a lightness and herbaceousness that Partagás fans found disconcerting, and that Quintero enthusiasts found irreplaceable.\r\n\r\nAfter nationalization, Quintero joined Habanos S.A. but retained its priority distribution to Spain. The brand remains virtually unknown outside the Iberian Peninsula and the circles of very well-informed connoisseurs — a situation that perfectly suits the aficionados who discover it and realize they have access to exceptional Cuban cigars at prices absurdly low relative to their actual quality.\r\n\r\nThe Medias Coronas (40×102mm) is the house\'s most iconic vitola: quick, economical, with a light herbaceous and slightly mentholated freshness that Spanish espresso drinkers have adopted as a daily ritual for more than sixty years. It is probably the most smoked Cuban cigar in Spain, and the least known outside it.', `history_es` = 'Quintero es el secreto mejor guardado del catálogo de Habanos. Fundada en 1924 en Cienfuegos por Agustín Quintero Benítez, la manufactura produjo durante décadas puros destinados casi en exclusiva al mercado español, país que trabó con Quintero una relación de fidelidad comparable a la de los británicos con Romeo y Julieta.\n\nLa originalidad de Quintero está en su procedencia regional. A diferencia de las grandes marcas habaneras, que se abastecen en exclusiva en la Vuelta Abajo occidental, Quintero empleaba históricamente tabacos de la Vuelta Arriba —las provincias orientales de Cuba—, más ligeros, más herbáceos, con una firma aromática claramente distinta del terruño occidental. Esa particularidad creó un perfil único: cubano sin discusión, pero con una ligereza y un carácter herbáceo que a los aficionados a Partagás desconcertaban y que a los de Quintero les resultaban insustituibles.\n\nTras la nacionalización, Quintero pasó a Habanos S.A. pero conservó su distribución prioritaria hacia España. La marca sigue siendo prácticamente desconocida fuera de la península ibérica y de los círculos de entendidos muy informados, una situación que conviene de maravilla a los aficionados que la descubren y comprenden que tienen acceso a puros cubanos excepcionales a precios irrisorios frente a su calidad real.\n\nEl Medias Coronas (40×102 mm) es la vitola más emblemática: rápida, económica, de un frescor herbáceo y ligeramente mentolado que los amantes españoles del espresso han adoptado como ritual cotidiano desde hace más de sesenta años. Es probablemente el puro cubano más fumado en España y el menos conocido fuera de ella.', `history_de` = 'Quintero ist das bestgehütete Geheimnis des Habanos-Portfolios. 1924 in Cienfuegos von Agustín Quintero Benítez gegründet, stellte die Manufaktur jahrzehntelang Zigarren her, die fast ausschließlich für den spanischen Markt bestimmt waren — ein Land, das zu Quintero eine Treuebeziehung entwickelte, vergleichbar mit jener der Briten zu Romeo y Julieta.\n\nQuinteros Eigenart liegt in ihrer regionalen Herkunft. Anders als die großen Havanna-Marken, die sich ausschließlich in der westlichen Vuelta Abajo eindecken, verwendete Quintero traditionell Tabake aus der Vuelta Arriba — den östlichen Provinzen Kubas —, leichter, krautiger, mit einer Aromatik, die sich deutlich vom westlichen Terroir unterscheidet. Daraus entstand ein einzigartiges Profil: unbestreitbar kubanisch, doch mit einer Leichtigkeit und Krautigkeit, die Partagás-Liebhaber befremdlich und Quintero-Liebhaber unersetzlich fanden.\n\nNach der Verstaatlichung kam Quintero zu Habanos S.A., behielt aber den Vorrang der spanischen Distribution. Die Marke ist außerhalb der Iberischen Halbinsel und sehr gut unterrichteter Kennerkreise praktisch unbekannt — ein Zustand, der jenen Aficionados bestens gefällt, die sie entdecken und merken, dass ihnen außergewöhnliche kubanische Zigarren zu Preisen offenstehen, die zu ihrer tatsächlichen Güte in keinem Verhältnis stehen.\n\nDie Medias Coronas (40×102 mm) ist die sinnbildlichste Vitola: schnell, günstig, von einer krautigen, leicht mentholigen Frische, die spanische Espressotrinker seit über sechzig Jahren zum täglichen Ritual gemacht haben. Sie ist wohl die meistgerauchte kubanische Zigarre Spaniens — und außerhalb die am wenigsten bekannte.', `history_zh` = 'Quintero 是 Habanos 旗下守得最严的秘密。1924 年由 Agustín Quintero Benítez 在 Cienfuegos 创立，这家工厂数十年间生产的雪茄几乎全部销往西班牙——西班牙与 Quintero 结下的忠诚，堪比英国人之于 Romeo y Julieta。\n\nQuintero 的独特之处在于其烟叶的产区来源。哈瓦那各大品牌一概只取西部 Vuelta Abajo 的烟叶，Quintero 历来却使用 Vuelta Arriba——古巴东部各省——的烟叶：更轻盈、更草本，香气签名与西部风土截然不同。由此形成了独一无二的风格：无可置疑的古巴味，却带着一种轻盈与草本气，让 Partagás 的拥趸感到不解，也让 Quintero 的拥趸觉得无可替代。\n\n国有化之后，Quintero 归入 Habanos S.A.，但保留了优先供应西班牙的渠道。在伊比利亚半岛与消息极为灵通的行家圈之外，这个品牌几乎无人知晓——而这种状况恰好合了那些发现它的爱好者的心意：他们由此得以用与实际品质完全不相称的低廉价格，享用出色的古巴雪茄。\n\nMedias Coronas（40×102mm）是最具代表性的规格：快、便宜，带着草本与淡淡薄荷的清新，六十多年来一直是西班牙浓缩咖啡爱好者的日常仪式。它很可能是西班牙抽得最多的古巴雪茄，也是境外最不为人知的一支。', `history_ar` = 'Quintero هي السرّ الأشدّ حفظاً في محفظة Habanos. تأسّست عام 1924 في Cienfuegos على يد Agustín Quintero Benítez، وظلّ المصنع عقوداً ينتج سيجاراً موجّهاً شبه حصرياً إلى السوق الإسبانية — وهي بلد نسج مع Quintero علاقة وفاء تشبه علاقة البريطانيين بـ Romeo y Julieta.\n\nتنبع خصوصية Quintero من منشأ تبغها الإقليمي. فخلافاً لكبريات علامات هافانا التي تتزوّد حصراً من Vuelta Abajo الغربية، درجت Quintero تاريخياً على استخدام تبغ Vuelta Arriba — أي المقاطعات الشرقية من كوبا — وهو أخفّ وأكثر عشبية، ببصمة عطرية تختلف بوضوح عن الأرض الغربية. وقد أنشأ ذلك طابعاً فريداً: كوبياً بلا جدال، لكن بخفّة ونفَس عشبي كان هواة Partagás يجدونهما محيّرين، وهواة Quintero يجدونهما بلا بديل.\n\nبعد التأميم انضمّت Quintero إلى Habanos S.A. لكنها احتفظت بأولوية التوزيع نحو إسبانيا. وتظل العلامة شبه مجهولة خارج شبه الجزيرة الإيبيرية ودوائر العارفين المطّلعين جداً — وهو وضع يناسب تماماً الهواة الذين يكتشفونها فيدركون أن بين أيديهم سيجاراً كوبياً استثنائياً بأسعار زهيدة قياساً بجودته الحقيقية.\n\nو Medias Coronas (40×102 مم) هو الطراز الأكثر رمزية: سريع، اقتصادي، بانتعاش عشبي ولمسة نعناع خفيفة تبنّاها عشّاق الإسبريسو الإسبان طقساً يومياً منذ أكثر من ستين عاماً. وهو على الأرجح أكثر سيجار كوبي يُدخَّن في إسبانيا، وأقلّها شهرةً في الخارج.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Medias Coronas\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"40×102mm — the legendary short format that defines the brand in Spain. Twenty-five minutes of fresh herbaceousness, light honey, and cedar. The morning cigar of Spanish aficionados since 1924. Accessible price, remarkable quality.\"}, {\"name\": \"Brevas\", \"color\": \"#7A5C0F\", \"story\": \"Standard format (40×140mm) — the accessible core range. Notes of fresh grass, dried tobacco, light honey finish. The perfect daily cigar for those who appreciate Cuban lightness.\"}, {\"name\": \"Churchill\", \"color\": \"#6B4E10\", \"story\": \"Long format (47×178mm) that reveals the full complexity of Vuelta Arriba terroir. Herbaceous on entry, evolving toward oak wood and dried tobacco, with a distinctly Cuban green tea finish.\"}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Medias Coronas\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"40×102 mm: el legendario formato corto que define la marca en España. Veinticinco minutos de frescor herbáceo, miel ligera y cedro. El puro matinal de los aficionados españoles desde 1924. Precio asequible, calidad notable.\"},{\"name\":\"Brevas\",\"color\":\"#7A5C0F\",\"story\":\"Formato estándar (40×140 mm): el centro de gama asequible. Notas de hierba fresca, tabaco secado y un ligero toque de miel en el final. El puro diario perfecto para los amantes de la ligereza cubana.\"},{\"name\":\"Churchill\",\"color\":\"#6B4E10\",\"story\":\"Formato largo (47×178 mm) que revela toda la complejidad del terruño Vuelta Arriba. Herbáceo al principio, evoluciona hacia la madera de roble y el tabaco secado, con un final de té verde inconfundiblemente cubano.\"}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Medias Coronas\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"40×102 mm — das legendäre Kurzformat, das die Marke in Spanien ausmacht. Fünfundzwanzig Minuten frische Krautigkeit, leichter Honig und Zeder. Seit 1924 die Morgenzigarre der spanischen Aficionados. Erschwinglicher Preis, bemerkenswerte Güte.\"},{\"name\":\"Brevas\",\"color\":\"#7A5C0F\",\"story\":\"Standardformat (40×140 mm) — die erschwingliche Mitte der Linie. Noten von frischem Gras, getrocknetem Tabak und ein leichter Honigtupfer im Abgang. Die perfekte tägliche Zigarre für Freunde kubanischer Leichtigkeit.\"},{\"name\":\"Churchill\",\"color\":\"#6B4E10\",\"story\":\"Langes Format (47×178 mm), das die ganze Komplexität des Vuelta-Arriba-Terroirs offenlegt. Krautig im Auftakt, entwickelt es sich zu Eichenholz und getrocknetem Tabak, mit einem unverkennbar kubanischen Grüntee-Abgang.\"}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"Medias Coronas\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"40×102mm——在西班牙定义了这个品牌的传奇短规格。二十五分钟的清新草本、淡淡蜂蜜与雪松。自 1924 年起，它就是西班牙老烟客的晨间之选。价格亲民，品质出众。\"},{\"name\":\"Brevas\",\"color\":\"#7A5C0F\",\"story\":\"标准规格（40×140mm）——价格可亲的产品线中坚。青草、干烟叶的气息，收尾带一丝蜂蜜。对偏爱古巴轻盈风格的人来说，这是完美的日常之选。\"},{\"name\":\"Churchill\",\"color\":\"#6B4E10\",\"story\":\"长规格（47×178mm），足以展开 Vuelta Arriba 风土的全部层次。入口草本，随后转向橡木与干烟叶，收尾是一份鲜明的古巴式绿茶感。\"}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"Medias Coronas\",\"color\":\"#8B6914\",\"story\":\"40×102 مم — الطراز القصير الأسطوري الذي يحدّد العلامة في إسبانيا. خمس وعشرون دقيقة من انتعاش عشبي وعسل خفيف وأرز. سيجار الصباح لدى الهواة الإسبان منذ 1924. سعر في المتناول وجودة لافتة.\"},{\"name\":\"Brevas\",\"color\":\"#7A5C0F\",\"story\":\"الطراز القياسي (40×140 مم) — قلب التشكيلة الميسور. لمسات من العشب الطري والتبغ المجفَّف ولمسة عسل خفيفة في النهاية. السيجار اليومي المثالي لمحبّي الخفّة الكوبية.\"},{\"name\":\"Churchill\",\"color\":\"#6B4E10\",\"story\":\"طراز طويل (47×178 مم) يكشف كامل تعقيد أرض Vuelta Arriba. يبدأ عشبياً ثم يتحوّل إلى خشب البلوط والتبغ المجفَّف، بنهاية من الشاي الأخضر كوبية الطابع بوضوح.\"}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Spanish aficionados\", \"anecdote\": \"Quintero has no celebrity attached to its history — which is precisely what makes it the beloved brand of genuine Spanish connoisseurs. For decades, Madrid and Barcelona tobacco shops sold Quintero to clients who wanted something less exhibitionist and equally good as the major brands.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Aficionados españoles\",\"anecdote\":\"Quintero no tiene ninguna celebridad ligada a su historia, y es precisamente eso lo que la convierte en la marca predilecta de los verdaderos conocedores españoles. Durante décadas, las tabacaleras de Madrid y Barcelona vendían Quintero a los clientes que querían algo menos ostentoso y tan bueno como las grandes marcas.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Spanische Aficionados\",\"anecdote\":\"Quintero hat keine Berühmtheit in seiner Geschichte — und genau das macht sie zur Lieblingsmarke der echten spanischen Kenner. Jahrzehntelang verkauften die Tabakläden von Madrid und Barcelona Quintero an Kunden, die etwas Unauffälligeres wollten, das den großen Marken in nichts nachstand.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\":\"西班牙雪茄爱好者\",\"anecdote\":\"金特罗的历史上没有任何名人加持——而这恰恰使它成为西班牙真正行家钟爱的品牌。数十年来，马德里与巴塞罗那的烟草行把金特罗卖给那些想要低调却毫不逊色于大牌的顾客。\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\":\"عشّاق السيجار الإسبان\",\"anecdote\":\"لا ترتبط كينتيرو بأي شخصية شهيرة في تاريخها — وهذا بالضبط ما يجعلها العلامة المحبوبة لدى أهل الخبرة الإسبان الحقيقيين. لعقود، كانت متاجر التبغ في مدريد وبرشلونة تبيع كينتيرو لمن يريد شيئًا أقل استعراضًا وبجودة الكبار نفسها.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Spanish café con leche\", \"notes\": \"The original and definitive pairing. The Medias Coronas smoked while preparing the morning coffee is a century-old Spanish ritual. The milky sweetness perfectly balances the cigar\'s herbaceousness.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Manzanilla de Sanlúcar\", \"notes\": \"The lightest and most marine sherry plays with the herbaceous freshness of the Quintero in an Andalusian pairing of great coherence. Deceptive lightness on both sides.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\":\"Café\",\"name\":\"Café con leche español\",\"notes\":\"El maridaje original y definitivo. Fumar un Medias Coronas mientras se prepara el café de la mañana es un ritual español centenario. El dulzor lácteo equilibra a la perfección el carácter herbáceo del puro.\"},{\"type\":\"Vino\",\"name\":\"Manzanilla de Sanlúcar\",\"notes\":\"El jerez más ligero y más marino juega con la frescura herbácea del Quintero en un maridaje andaluz de gran coherencia. Ligereza engañosa en ambos lados.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\":\"Kaffee\",\"name\":\"Spanischer Café con leche\",\"notes\":\"Die ursprüngliche und endgültige Kombination. Eine Medias Coronas beim Zubereiten des Morgenkaffees ist ein jahrhundertealtes spanisches Ritual. Die milchige Süße gleicht die grasige Note der Zigarre perfekt aus.\"},{\"type\":\"Wein\",\"name\":\"Manzanilla de Sanlúcar\",\"notes\":\"Der leichteste und maritimste Sherry spielt mit der grasigen Frische der Quintero in einer andalusischen Kombination von großer Stimmigkeit. Trügerische Leichtigkeit auf beiden Seiten.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\":\"咖啡\",\"name\":\"西班牙拿铁咖啡\",\"notes\":\"最初也最经典的搭配。清晨煮咖啡时点上一支 Medias Coronas，是西班牙延续百年的仪式。乳脂的甜润恰好平衡雪茄的草本气息。\"},{\"type\":\"葡萄酒\",\"name\":\"桑卢卡尔曼萨尼亚雪利酒\",\"notes\":\"这款最清淡、最带海风气息的雪利酒，与金特罗的草本清新相互呼应，成就一场高度契合的安达卢西亚搭配。两者的轻盈都只是表象。\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\":\"قهوة\",\"name\":\"قهوة بالحليب الإسبانية\",\"notes\":\"المزاوجة الأصلية والنهائية. تدخين «ميدياس كوروناس» أثناء إعداد قهوة الصباح تقليد إسباني عمره قرن. حلاوة الحليب توازن تمامًا نفحة السيجار العشبية.\"},{\"type\":\"نبيذ\",\"name\":\"مانزانييا دي سانلوكار\",\"notes\":\"أخفّ أنواع الشيري وأكثرها طابعًا بحريًا يتحاور مع النضارة العشبية لكينتيرو في مزاوجة أندلسية بالغة الاتساق. خفّة خادعة من الطرفين.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Quintero';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Rocky Patel\'s professional trajectory is the cigar industry\'s most improbable success story in the American market. He spent his twenties as a Los Angeles entertainment attorney, representing clients in the industry whose hours made cigar lounges a natural professional habitat. He learned about tobacco the way lawyers learn about most things: by asking questions, reading extensively, and talking to people who actually knew. By the early 1990s, he understood the premium cigar market better than most of his peers in the legal profession.\r\n\r\nIn 1995, he decided to enter it. He had no tobacco-growing background, no manufacturing relationships, and no trade network. He had legal skills, commercial instincts, and a specific thesis: that the American cigar boom of the 1990s was creating demand that existing premium manufacturers were not meeting at accessible price points. Padrón was excellent but expensive. Davidoff was flawless but positioned for a different customer. There was a gap between genuine quality and daily affordability that no one was addressing with the same seriousness he intended to apply.\r\n\r\nThe Vintage series — which he introduced in the early 2000s — articulated this thesis in product form. Cigars built around tobaccos aged from the vintage year indicated on the band, sold at prices that allowed serious daily smoking rather than occasional ceremony. The 1990, 1992, and 1999 Vintages earned critical scores between 92 and 95 consistently across multiple reviews, establishing the brand\'s credibility with the segment that had previously dismissed accessible price-point cigars as a compromise.\r\n\r\nThe catalog that followed — now extending to over 30 ranges in multiple price tiers — represents the most comprehensive approach to market segmentation in the premium American industry. Each range addresses a specific taste preference and budget, with the manufacturing quality maintaining a floor that prevents any Rocky Patel cigar from embarrassing the brand regardless of its price point. This consistency is the direct result of Patel\'s long-term relationships with Honduran manufacturers, developed over two decades of increasingly specific collaborative production.', `history_es` = 'Rocky Patel abandonó su carrera de abogado en Los Ángeles en 1995 para fundar su propia marca. Vendía cajas desde el maletero de su coche. Su gran ruptura llegó con la serie Vintage — cigarros construidos alrededor de tabacos envejecidos desde los años correspondientes. Generosidad sin comprometer la calidad, precio accesible para fumadores diarios.', `history_de` = 'Rocky Patel gab 1995 seine Anwaltskarriere in Los Angeles auf, um seine eigene Marke zu gründen. Er verkaufte Kisten aus seinem Kofferraum. Sein Durchbruch kam mit der Vintage-Serie — Zigarren rund um Tabake gebaut, die seit den entsprechenden Jahrgängen gelagert wurden. Großzügigkeit ohne Qualitätskompromisse, zu einem Preis für tägliche Raucher.', `history_zh` = '洛基·帕特尔于1995年放弃洛杉矶律师生涯创立自己的品牌。他从汽车后备箱卖雪茄。他的重大突破是老年份系列——围绕相应年份陈化烟草打造的雪茄。品质不打折扣的慷慨，日常吸烟者可负担的价格。', `history_ar` = 'روكي باتيل ترك مهنة المحاماة في لوس أنجلوس عام 1995 لتأسيس علامته. كان يبيع العلب من صندوق سيارته. اختراقه الكبير جاء مع سلسلة فينتاج — سيجار مبني حول تبغ معتَّق من السنوات المقابلة. كرم دون تنازل عن الجودة، بسعر في متناول المدخنين اليوميين.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Vintage 1992\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Honduran and Nicaraguan tobacco aged since 1992. Ecuador Connecticut wrapper. Notes of toasted hazelnut, caramel, light wood. Medium-Full, well-balanced. The Vintage series is the market\'s most original narrative proposition — each vintage tells a specific plantation year\'s story.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuador Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 91, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Fifty Years\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched for Rocky Patel\'s 50th birthday. Complex Honduran-Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Sun-Grown wrapper. Notes of coffee, oriental spices, undergrowth. One of the house\'s finest cigars, often underrated against the Vintage series.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"The Edge\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible house range. Connecticut wrapper over Honduran/Nicaraguan. Sweet notes of cream and hazelnut. The first Rocky Patel for a newcomer — easy to approach, consistent, rewarding. Democratic pricing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona\", \"Gordo\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Vintage 1992\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Honduran and Nicaraguan tabaco añejado since 1992. Ecuador Connecticut wrapper. Notas de tostado avellana, caramelo, light wood. Medium-Full, well-balanced. The Vintage series is the market\'s most original narrative proposition — each vintage tells a specific plantation year\'s story.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuador Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 91, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Fifty Years\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched for Rocky Patel\'s 50th birthday. Complex Honduran-Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Sun-Grown wrapper. Notas de café, oriental especias, undergrowth. One of la finest cigars, often underrated against the Vintage series.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"The Edge\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible house range. Connecticut wrapper over Honduran/Nicaraguan. Sweet notas de cream and avellana. The first Rocky Patel for a newcomer — easy to approach, consistent, rewarding. Democratic pricing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona\", \"Gordo\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Vintage 1992\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Honduran and Nicaraguan tobacco aged since 1992. Ecuador Connecticut wrapper. Noten von geröstet Haselnuss, Karamell, light wood. Medium-Full, well-balanced. The Vintage series is the market\'s most original narrative proposition — each vintage tells a specific plantation year\'s story.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuador Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 91, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Fifty Years\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched for Rocky Patel\'s 50th birthday. Complex Honduran-Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Sun-Grown wrapper. Noten von Kaffee, oriental Gewürze, undergrowth. One of the house\'s finest cigars, often underrated against the Vintage series.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"The Edge\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible house range. Connecticut wrapper over Honduran/Nicaraguan. Sweet Noten von cream and Haselnuss. The first Rocky Patel for a newcomer — easy to approach, consistent, rewarding. Democratic pricing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona\", \"Gordo\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Vintage 1992\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Honduran and Nicaraguan tobacco aged since 1992. Ecuador Connecticut wrapper. 风味： 烘烤 榛子, 焦糖, light wood. Medium-Full, well-balanced. The Vintage series is the market\'s most original narrative proposition — each vintage tells a specific plantation 