rown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"The Edge\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible house range. Connecticut wrapper over Honduran/Nicaraguan. Sweet نكهات:  cream and بندق. The first Rocky Patel for a newcomer — easy to approach, consistent, rewarding. Democratic pricing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona\", \"Gordo\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"Vino\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wein\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"波旁威士忌\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"葡萄酒\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"البوربون\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"النبيذ\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Rocky Patel';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Romeo y Julieta was founded in 1875 by Inocencio Álvarez, a Havana manufacturer who understood that a great name was the first condition of greatness. The brand\'s romantic title — drawn from Shakespeare, whose plays Cuban cigar workers knew well through their lector sessions — carried an emotional charge that translated across languages and cultures. Within two decades, Romeo y Julieta had won gold medals at exhibitions in Amsterdam, Paris, and Chicago. Álvarez commissioned the finest lithographers in Havana to produce bands and box labels of extraordinary visual quality. The brand looked like what it tasted like: exceptional.\r\n\r\nThe defining relationship in the brand\'s history began in 1895. Winston Churchill was 21 years old, working as a war correspondent covering the Cuban independence struggle, and he was introduced to Romeo y Julieta cigars during his three-week stay in Havana. The encounter was transformative. Churchill would go on to smoke between 8 and 10 cigars per day, every single day, for the next 70 years — through two world wars, the Blitz, countless parliamentary sessions, and the writing of a six-volume history of the Second World War that earned him the Nobel Prize in Literature. His absolute preference was the Double Corona: 47 x 178mm, approximately 45 minutes of floral, creamy, cedary complexity that companions describe as inseparable from the man himself.\r\n\r\nThe brand honored the relationship in 1948 by naming its Double Corona format the Churchill — a distinction no other brand had offered a living statesman. Churchill reportedly found the gesture amusing rather than presumptuous. The format remains the centerpiece of the collection, made at the Romeo y Julieta factory in Havana\'s Belascoaín district and distributed through Habanos S.A.\'s global network.\r\n\r\nRomeo y Julieta\'s profile stands in deliberate contrast to the power brands of the Cuban portfolio. Where Partagás and Bolívar push earthiness and intensity, Romeo trades in florality, cream, and an almost orchestral sense of progression. The cigars open with cedar and light spice, develop through hazelnut and white pepper, and finish on dried fruit and honey. It is the brand that most converts describe as their gateway to understanding what Cuban tobacco could be — and for many serious smokers, it is the brand they return to after exploring the extremes.\r\n\r\nThe Reserva line, using aged tobaccos from selected Vuelta Abajo plots, extends the house\'s ambition into collector territory. The Wide Churchill, launched in 2008, updated the classic format with a slightly wider ring gauge that delivers a cooler, longer smoke. The brand\'s limited editions — released annually through Habanos S.A.\'s Gran Reserva and Regional Edition programs — are among the most anticipated in the calendar.', `history_es` = 'Romeo y Julieta fue fundada en 1875 por Inocencio Álvarez. Debe su fama mundial a Sir Winston Churchill, quien la descubrió en Cuba a los 21 años y fumó entre 8 y 10 cigarros diarios hasta su muerte. El Churchill (47x178mm), formato bautizado en su honor, es 45 minutos de complejidad floral y cremosa.', `history_de` = 'Romeo y Julieta wurde 1875 von Inocencio Álvarez gegründet. Weltberühmt wurde die Marke durch Sir Winston Churchill, der sie mit 21 Jahren in Kuba entdeckte und bis zu seinem Tod täglich 8 bis 10 Zigarren rauchte. Das Churchill-Format (47x178mm) wurde ihm zu Ehren benannt.', `history_zh` = '罗密欧与朱丽叶由伊诺西昂西奥·阿尔瓦雷斯于1875年创立。它的世界声誉归功于温斯顿·丘吉尔——他21岁在古巴发现了这个品牌，此后每天吸8至10支，直到去世。以他命名的丘吉尔规格（47×178mm）是45分钟的花香与奶油复杂性。', `history_ar` = 'تأسست روميو وخولييتا عام 1875 على يد إينوسينسيو ألفاريز. اشتهرت عالميًا بفضل السير ونستون تشرشل الذي اكتشفها في كوبا وهو في الحادية والعشرين، وظل يدخن 8 إلى 10 سيجارات يوميًا حتى وفاته. مقاس تشرشل (47×178ملم) سُمِّي على شرفه.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Churchill\", \"color\": \"#DC143C\", \"story\": \"Churchill format (47 x 178mm) — named directly after the Prime Minister. 45 minutes of smoke. Floral, cream, soft cedar notes. The most accessible and recommended cigar for developing enthusiasts. Churchill himself ordered personalized boxes with his distinctive band. Cigar Aficionado score 93.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Exhibición No.4\", \"color\": \"#B22222\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1875, Petit Corona format (42 x 127mm). The perfect introduction to the Romeo y Julieta universe — sweet, floral, slightly creamy. Experts recommend starting here before venturing toward the Churchill.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exhibición No.4\", \"Exhibición No.3\"]}, {\"name\": \"Wide Churchill\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Thick format (55 x 178mm), same length as the Churchill but ring gauge 55 — one of the widest ever produced in Cuba. The increased wrapper surface intensifies the creamy and vanilla notes. Smoked in 60 minutes. Reserved for enthusiasts who do not compromise on ring gauge.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Wide Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Regional Editions\", \"color\": \"#9B2335\", \"story\": \"Romeo y Julieta produces annual regional editions exclusively for different markets — Germany, Spain, UK, Benelux. The Cazadores EL (2018, Germany) and Short Churchills EL are particularly sought after. Some collectors travel across Europe solely to acquire local regional editions.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"Cazadores\", \"Short Churchill\", \"Coloniales\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\":\"Churchill\",\"color\":\"#DC143C\",\"story\":\"Churchill format (47 x 178mm) — named directly after the Prime Minister. 45 minutes of smoke. Floral, cream, soft cedro notes. The most accessible and recommended cigar for developing aficionados. Churchill himself ordered personalized boxes with his distinctive band. Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 93.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Churchill\"],\"scores\":[{\"source\":\"Cigar Aficionado\",\"score\":93,\"year\":2021}]},{\"name\":\"Exhibición No.4\",\"color\":\"#B22222\",\"story\":\"Launched in 1875, Petit Corona format (42 x 127mm). The perfect introduction to the Romeo y Julieta universe — sweet, floral, slightly creamy. Experts recommend starting here before venturing toward the Churchill.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Exhibición No.4\",\"Exhibición No.3\"]},{\"name\":\"Wide Churchill\",\"color\":\"#8B0000\",\"story\":\"Thick format (55 x 178mm), same length as the Churchill but ring gauge 55 — one of the widest ever produced in Cuba. The increased wrapper surface intensifies the creamy and vainilla notes. Smoked in 60 minutos. Reserved for aficionados who do not compromise on ring gauge.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado\",\"vitolas\":[\"Wide Churchill\"]},{\"name\":\"Ediciones Regionales\",\"color\":\"#9B2335\",\"story\":\"Romeo y Julieta produces annual regional editions exclusively for different markets — Germany, Spain, UK, Benelux. The Cazadores EL (2018, Germany) and Short Churchills EL are particularly sought after. Some coleccionistas travel across Europe solely to acquire local regional editions.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Variable\",\"vitolas\":[\"Cazadores\",\"Short Churchill\",\"Coloniales\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\":\"Churchill\",\"color\":\"#DC143C\",\"story\":\"Churchill format (47 x 178mm) — named directly after the Prime Minister. 45 minutes of smoke. Floral, cream, soft Zeder notes. The most accessible and recommended cigar for developing enthusiasts. Churchill himself ordered personalized boxes with his distinctive band. Cigar Aficionado Score 93.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Churchill\"],\"scores\":[{\"sourc